<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">Late</book>
  <para style="h">Late</para>
  <para style="toc1">Late</para>
  <para style="toc2">Late</para>
  <para style="mt">Late</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian ngaisahloute lemguot bang a, um ngai lou a, migiloute lampi a zong ding ngailou a, mi simmawhatte toupha a, zong tou ngailou mi khu ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Akipahna khu Mangpa dan ah ahizaw a, tualeh adan thute sun leh zan in angaituo ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama khu luiluong gei a sing kisuon ahun a ga zel, ana zong vuoi ngailou bang ahi ding a, asil bawl pouma ah alamzang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian ngaisahloute pen tuabang ahisih ua, hui in bushi amutmang bang ahi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian ngaisahloute pen, vaihawmna ah ading thei sih ding ua, mikhielte zong midihtatte kikhopna ah, a um thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n midihtatte lampi a thei a, hinanleh Pasian ngaisahloute lampi pen, amangthang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangding a namte lungthah a, tualeh bang dinga miten silphatuomlou, angaituo uh adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitunga leengte akisa ua, tualeh vaihawm mite zong akikum khawm ua, Mangpa leh asathaunupa tungah thu aphiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ahing kaan na siakhaute uh bottan vai in, tualeh ahing khina khauhuolte uh, ei a kipat in ipaimang ding uhi,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa’n van pan in a nuisat a, alung guotte uh nuijat huoi asa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuazou chiengin Aman thangpai tahin, akung uah thu agen ding a, lungkimloutahin amauh a sumangbang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Keima’n ka muol siengthou Zion ah, ka leengpa ka tousahta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa thuguotsa ka phuongkhe ding hi; Mangpa’n ka kungah “Nangpen ka Tapa na hita a, tuni in ka hing hingkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hing ngen inlen, tuachi’n, namte na gouluo dingin, kawlmong tawp tandong na goutan dingin. Ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma’n sia chieng in amauh, na satsegawp dinga, bel khengten bel apai keeh bangun, na sep guoi dimdem ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin nou leengte aw pilta un, nou leitung vaihawmte aw giihna ngaisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zau dan siem in Mangpa nna sem unlen, chitun pum in amai ah kun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa khu bie un tuachilouin, alungthah kha dinga, lamkaal ah na mangthang kha ding uhi. A thangpaina mitphietkal loua kuong thei ahi a, Ama a aginna uh koite zousie a hampha uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa aw ka galte pung hina va-ia e! Kei hing doute tampi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a dingin Pasian ah, panpina mawngmawng a um sih, chi a ka tungtang thugente tampi aum uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw! Mangpa nangpe’n, kei a dingin ka lum leh phaw na hi a, Ka thupina leh ka lu domkangpa na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kap kawm in Mangpa ka han a, Aman amuol siengthou akipat in, ahing dawng zel hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka lumsuh a Ka imuta hi, Mangpa’n ahing na tuh ngitnget zieh in, ka khanglou ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hing dou a ka kimkot a, hing im mi tul sawm zong ka zau sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa aw hing thou inlen, ka Pasian aw hing hundam in, Nangma’n ka galte zousie, abienggu uh na sattawng pieh a, migiloute hatu zong na suhbal pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hundamna khu Mangpa a ahi, Na guolzawlna khu na mite tungah umta hen. Selah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka dihtatna Pasian aw, ka hing hat chiengin hing dawngin. Ka chimaw vawt chiengin, nangma’n na hing khotuo a, ka tungah zangai inlen, ka thungetna ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nou mihing tate aw, bangtan vei ahiei ka thupina, zalatna na suohsah ding uh? Bangtan vei ahiei sil ginalou na ngainat ua, zuou thu na sui ding uh? Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa Pasian ngaisah mi, ama a dingin akoituom ahi chi thei zaw un; Ama ka hat chiengin, Mangpa’n ahing ngaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungthah unlen khiel vang khiel sih un, na lupna tung uah na lungtang un, ngaituo unlen sip dide un. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dihtatna kithoina laan unlen, Mangpa muong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mi tampite’n Koi in ahiei, silhoi eite ahing ensah thei ding? achi uhi. Mangpa na melvah ka tung uah taang sah in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abu uleh a uoin uh ahing pun chienga, akipahna uh sanga kipahna thupi zaw, ka lungtang ah na umsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hamuongtahin ka lumsuh dinga, ka imu ding hi. Aziehpen Mangpa aw, Nang bouin bittahin na hing umsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thute ah na bil hing daw inlen, Aw Mangpa ka thumnate hing ngaituo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kaa na aw ngaikhie in, ka Lengpa leh ka Pasian aw, Nangma kunga thungen ka hi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa aw zingmawng in ka aw na za dinga, Zingmawngchiengin na kungah ka thungetna, ka hing tun dinga, tuachi’n nang dawnna aw, ka na ngah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen gitlouna kipahpi Pasian na hisih a, gitlouna khu nang toh aumkhawm theisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mikiliensahte khu na mitmu ah ading thei sih ding ua, Nang silgilou bawlte zousie na huo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zuouthu gente nangman na sumangthang dinga, Mangpa’n sisan suohatte leh mi solhatte akidah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh kei pen, na khotuona kiningchingtah zieh in, na inn ah Ka hing lut dinga, zau kawmin na biehinn siengthou lam ngain, ka hing be ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa aw, ka galte ziehin na dihtatna ah hing pui inlen, ka masangah na lampi tangtahin kihung sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen a kam uah thudih mawngmawng a um sih a, alungtang sung uah sietna a um a; agong uh han kihong ahi a, alei un solna thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pasian, amauh siemmaw tangsah in, amauh lemguotna ma ah puasah inlen, atatkhelna uh tampite zieh in, ama uh paikhie in, aziehpen ama ute na tungah ahel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh nangma hing muongte zousie, nuom uhenlen, amaute nahumbit ziehin nuom in kikou uheh, na min itte zong nangma ah nuom in um uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, nangma’n, midihtatte, na guolzawl dinga, deisahna toh lumbangin na sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa lungthah in hing phoh sin len, thangpai in hing sugenthei vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hing khotuoin Aw Mangpa, aziehpen ka gimgawpta hi; Mangpa aw hing damsah in; ka gu kataangteng ana siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hinna zong nasatah in suh mangbang in a um hi; Aw Mangpa bangtan vei ahiei, donlou a na hing umsah ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa aw, hing kihei kia inlen ka hinna hundam in, Na khotuona ziehin hing hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen shi nua chiengin, nangma thei ngitngetna a um sih hi. Sheol ah koi ahiei na tunga kipahthu gen ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kaa kamauna ziehin ka ba gawpta hi, zan simsiel in ka lupna tungah hitui avei denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mitte lungkhamna ziehin ase gawpta a, ka melmate zieh in ka vuoi hiei hieita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gitlouna nasem noute zousie aw, hing peisanta un, Mangpa’n ka ka na awging azata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa’n ka ngetnate azata a, Mangpa’n ka thungetna ahing sangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka melmate zousie zumsahin um uhenlen, nahpitahin buoi gawp uheh; kinua hei uhenlen, thakhat in zalah uhen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa ka Pasian Aw, nangma ka hing muong hi. Keima hing sugentheite zousie lah akipat in, hing hundam inlen hing hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachilouin hunkhe ding mi umlou in, humpibahnei bangin ka hinna, abottel kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, tami kana bawl a, ka khut a bawlkhielna ana um a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima toh kilem a um mite, silgilou a thuh kana hi a, azieh bei a ka galte bulu kana hileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka galpan hing nuadel henlen, hing nuaphah mai henlen, ka hinna lei lah ah tuonchil henlen, ka zatat huoina leivui lah ah sielpua mai hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, lungthah in thou inlen, ka melmate thangpaina doudingin kisa in, kei a dingin khanglou inlen, nangma’n vaihawmna ding thu na piehsa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi kikhawmten nang hing im kuol uhenlen; amaute ziehin sangtahin hing kile kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n mipite tungah thu akhen zel a, Mangpa aw keima a dihtatna leh, Ka lungsim a hoina um dungzui in ka tungah vaihawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw migiloute gitlouna beita mai henlen, hinanleh midihtatte pen sukip in. Aziehpen Pasian dihtat in, lungtangte leh lungsimte a enchien zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kihumbitna Pasian ahi a, lungtanga dihtatte ahundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian pen dihtah a vaihawmpa ahia, Pasian khu migiloute tungah, nichin in alungthah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi koipou akisia sihleh, Pasian in a namsau ataat hiem ding a; Athalpi aluoita a, kap ding a mansa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman shina vanzahte mansain akoita a; Athaltangte akuong theiin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, gitlouna khu nau vop in avom a, thulim louna nau vei in avei a, zuouthu apiengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilouin midangte ki-etna dingin leihum abawl a, thuhtah in a tou a, ama tawsa leihum sungah akie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asil bawlkhielna khu ama lutungma ah atu kia dinga, hiemngamtah a asil bawl khu, ama jangsip ah ake ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Adihtatna bangzel in Mangpa ka phat dinga, Tungnung sang pen, Mangpa pahtawina in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, Koute Mangpa aw, leitung pumpi ah na min hoi hina va-ia e; nang vante tungah na thupina na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na melma leh phubala mite, na sip sah theina dingin; nang hing doute ziehin, naungehte leh nausen nawiteplaite kam a kipat, hatna na sudetta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na khutsuoh na vante, hapi leh aasite amun mun ua, dettah a na koite Ka ngaituo chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mihing bang ahitalawma, hichi va-ia a na ngaisah e? tualeh mihing tapa zong bang ahitalawma, hichikhopa na ve zel ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen nangma’n amaute vansawltahte, sanga ngiemzaw deu in na bawl a, thupina leh zatatna na khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma’n na khutsuohte tungah, amaute thuneina na pie a, akephang nuoi ah sil bangkim na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Belam leh bawng talte zousie, ahi, gamlah a gamsate nangawn zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tung leeng vate leh tuipi sunga ngate, tuipi sunga lamha a pei poumate toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa koute Mangpa aw leitung pumpi ah, na min hoi hina va-ia e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa aw ka lungtang tengteng in, nang ka hing phat ding hi. Na sil lamdang bawlte zousie ka gengen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma ah kipah in ka nuom dinga, Aw Tungnung pen na min phat in, la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka melmate anuatai kia chiengun, na masangah apua ding ua, amangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen nangma’n ka dihna tungtang ah na hing hum a; dihtah a vaihawm in, Mangtoupha ah na tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang namte na vau a, migiloute na sumang hi. Amin u’zong kumtawn kumtawn a dingin na thaimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw melma, kumtawn a bei mang dingin, sietna ahing tung ta tualeh nangma’n khopite na susie a, amauh thei zingna khu amautoh abeimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa khu kumtawn in aum ding a; a Mangtoupha khu vaihawmna dingin atungdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman dihtatna toh khovel vai ahawm dinga; namchin tungah thudihna toh vai ahawm pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawlgenthei a umte a dingin Mangpa khu kibutna kulpi ahi a; Mangbat hun chienga bel ding kulpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na min thei poumaten nangma ah muonna a koi ding ua; aziehpen Mangpa aw, nangma hing sui mite na taisan ngaisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion a teng Mangpa phat in lasa unlen, mite lah ah asil bawlte phuongza un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman sisan phuba alah chiengin; amaute a thei zing dinga, suhgenthei a um mite kikou aw, amanghil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, kei hing khotuo inlen, kei hing mudate hing suhgenthei dan en in; Shina kotkha akipat a hing domkang nangma na hi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n, Zion tanu kulpi dawngkot a, na pahtawina ka phuong thei dinga, na hundamna ah ka nuom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namte amauh tawsa kokhuh sungah akie ua, aguh a amauh lenthang kam sate ah, akeng uh a awhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa pen athukhenna dihtah apat in akithei hi. Migiloute pen amauh bawlsa thangah a awh uhi. Higgaion Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Migiloute khu gawtmun ah akiheilut ding ua, tualeh Pasian manghil nam zousiete zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tasamte manghil in a um den sih ding ua, migentheite kinepna zong a beiden sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing thou inlen, mihing guolzou sah sin; namte nangma mitmu ah, vaihawmkhum in um uheh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, amaute zausah inlen, namten mihing leltah ahi uh chi, akitheina ding un. Selah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa bangdinga gamlatah a ding na hiei? Bangdinga mangbat hunlai a, kiphuol na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migilouten kisathei tahin, mizawngte abawl genthei ua, guhsima asilgilou ngaituonate uah, amauh mama awh uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen migilouten alungtang, ut lam uh asuong ua, tualeh Pasian theilou mi huoihamte aguolzawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Migilouten kiletsah mel puoin Pasian asui sih ua; angaituonate uah “Pasian a aum sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Agamtatnate ah alawching ua, akisathei uhi; tunglam sangtah a na thukhennate amupha sih ua, amelmate zousie uh anuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaun alungsim ah, “Lawsam ngai sih vang, vangsietna zong ka tuohsih ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akam khu hamse lawnate, solbawlnate leh mi enghounate in adim a, alei nuoi ah thusie leh thulimlouna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khosung ah mi lambuhna munte ah, mi buhin adap tou a, mun sip ah mawna neiloute athat a, amit in migentheite aguh et zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Humpibahnei sa buh bangin aguhin mi abuh a, mi gentheite man dingin abuh zel a, alen in akaimang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akuun suh ua, aboh ua, panpi ding neiloute athahatna nuoi uah apua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman alungsim in, “Pasian in amanghilta, Aman amai aphuolta, amu ngai nawn sih ding,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Mangpa thou inlen, Aw ka Pasian na khut zahtou inlen, bawlgenthei a umte manghil vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangdinga migilou in “Pasian asimmaw ahiei? alungsim a na phuut sih ding” achi zel ahiei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mu pen na muta tham a, na khut a thuh dingin; bawlkhelna leh suhhasietna na en zing hi, migentheite na kung ah ahing kikemsah ua, Nang pa neiloute panpipa na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migiloute leh silgilou bawlte ban suhtan pieh inlen, agitlouna uh na mu sieng masangsie in suikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa khu kumtawn kumtawn a dinga leengpa a hiden ding hi, agama kipat in namte amangthai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangma’n mi kingaingiemte, lunggul na ngaikhie a alungtang uh, na suhhat pieh dinga amaute lang ah, na bil na daw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pa neiloute leh bawlsiet a umte, leitung mi’n abawlsiet nawnlouna dingun, vai na hawmpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa ah ka tahsanna ka nga zel a; “Bangchidan ahiei ka hinna kunga, na muol uah va bangin leengmang un, na chi uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En in, migilouten lungtang dihtah pomi, aguh a akap theina ding un, athalpi te uh aluoi ua, athaltangte uh athalpi gui ah athuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abulpi suongphumte kisuseta leh, midihtatin bang ahiei abawlthei ding?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa khu abiehinn siengthou ah a um a, Mangpa mangtoupha khu van ah a um a; amit vun in a en a, mihing tate a en chien zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n midihtatte a en chien zel a, hinanleh migilou leh thagum suo ut mite pen, ahinna in ahuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n migiloute tungah, mei leh kaat leh huipi lumtah guobangin azusah dinga, tuakhu a haitan uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa khu thudih ahiziehin, aman dihtatna a it a, midihtatten a mel amu ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing panpi in, aziehpen Pasian ngaisah mi a um nawn sih hi; mihing tate lah a kipat miginumte amangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Michin in a innvengte kungah thumanlou agen ua, maitangphat leh lungsim thuoni neiin thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa’n maitangphatna kam zousie a atkhe dinga, kisatheitah a thu lienpipi gen leite toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaun ilei in iguolzou ding ua, “I kamte uh eima a ahi, i tung ua houtu koi ahiei um?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mi zawng gentheite kibawlsietna zieh leh tasamte thumna ziehin,” Mangpa’n tuin ka dingdoh dinga nuisantup akipat in, “Ama bittah in ka umsah ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa thute khu thu siengthou ahia; leitunga dangka haltuina mei a sagi vei, kisusiengthousa bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma’n amauh na keem dinga, Aw Mangpa tam khang thate lah a pat in, kumtawnin amauh na humbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihingte lah a khelna pahtawi a aum chiengin, ning chin ah migiloute avah viel viel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa bangtanvei ahiei? Kei na hing manghil dending? Bangtanvei kei akipat na mai phuol ding na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangtan vei ahiei nisim a, ka hinna lungkham a akingaituo ding? Bangtan vei ahiei ka galte, ka tunga pahtawi a um ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa ka Pasian aw, ngaituo inlen hing dawngin; Ka mitte hing vahsah in; tuachilou in shina imutna in ka imu kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh ka melma in, “Ama ka zouta” achi kha ding a; tualeh ka chitut zieh in, kei hing douten nuom asa kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh kei vangin na khotuona, ka muong ta a, na hundamna ah ka lungsim akipah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tunga silhoi a bawltah ziehin, Mangpa pahtawi in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mimaw in alungtang in “Pasian a um sih” achi a, amaute atawnkhiel siengta ua, sil kidahhuoite abawl ua, silhoi bawl mawngmawng a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n van a kipat in mihing tate a ensuh a; a theisiem leh Pasian sui mi mawngmawng, a um uoi mah chi’n a ensuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahilou lam ah alam piel siengta ua, abawn un akise gawp zouta ua, sil kidahhuoi abawl ua silhoi bawl mawngmawng a um sih ua, khat beh zong a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Silgilou bawl zousiein, theina neilou ahi uoi mah? Tanghou neh banga ka mite ne ten, Mangpa a sui talawm sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian khu midihtat hah lesuonte lah a um ahizieh in; amaute zauin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Migenthei te lemguotna na selphou ua; hinanleh Mangpa khu a kihumbitna uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zion akipat in Israel hundamna hing tung maileh Aw! Mangpa’n amite sal a ataan uhanuapui kia chiengin, tuahun chiengin Jakob a nuomta dinga, Israel akipah ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa Aw, Koi ahiei na biehbuh inn a umden thei ding? Na muol siengthou a koi ahiei teng thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dihtah a gamta mi leh sildih bawl mi; tualeh alungtanga a thutah gen mi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a lei a mi gense ngailou mi; a innveng tunga silgilou bawl ngailou leh, akhanguolte minsietna ding bawl ngailou mi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amit ua migiloute muda a, hinanleh Mangpa zau mite pahtawi a, ama thuohna ding nangawn a, athuchiema zuoutat ngailou mi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sumpung del a, sum pahah ngailou mi, mawna neilou, mawpai ding a sum negulou mi. Tambanga gamta mi khu, bangchih tan in suhling in aum sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian Aw, Nangma muongin ka hing bel hi, hing humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw ka hinna Mangpa kungah, “Nang ka Mangpa na hi a, nangma kung chilou ah ka hoina bangma ahisih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leitunga misiengthou umte pen mi hoipente, ka kipahnate umnate ahi uh ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koizong pasien dang tel mite, alungkhamna uh a pung ding a, a sisan dawn kithoinate uh ken ka laan sih ding, ahisihleh ka kam in amin uh ka lou malmal sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa khu ka goutan leh ka haitan ahi a, nangman ka tanvou nang suhdet pieh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamgi khaute khu kei a dingin, mun nuomtah ah aketa a, goutan hoitah ka luota hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lemguotna hing pepa, Mangpa ka phat dinga, ka lungtang in zong zanlai chiengin, ahing thuhil zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangchihlai pouin Mangpa khu, ka masangah ka umsah ngitnget a, Ama ka ziet lam a a um ziehin ka kilohsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka lungtang akipah a, ka hinna in nuom asa hi; Ka tahsa zong lungmuongtah in akhawldam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen, ka hinna hankhuh ah na nuasie sih ding a, na mi siengthou zong Mishikhuo mu dingin, na phal sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangman hinna lampite na hing musah ding a, Na umna mun ah kipahna bukim a um a, Na ziet lam ah kumtawn nopna a um hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, ka dihna thu za inlen, ka kikou aw hing ngaikhiet pieh in, zuouthu genhat kam a pawt hilou, ka thungetna lamah na bil hing dawin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thupuasahte khu nangma masang apat a pawt hihenlen; na mit in sildih mu hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma’n ka lungtang na enchienta a, zanlai chiengin na hing ve a, na hing chienta a bangma na mu sih hi, ka kam in agenkhiel sih ding; ka chi chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihingte nasepna thu ah pen, na kam a thupawt ziehin susemi, lampi apat in ka kihemkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lampi ah dettah in kal kasuonta a, ka kengte akitaal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Pasian, nangman hing dawng ding na hiziehin, nang ka hing han hi; na bil hing daw inlen ka thugen ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma a aginna uh koi poumate, amauh doute akipat a na khut ziet lam a hundampa aw, na khotuona lamdang kilangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mit laidum bangin hing keem inlen, na halim nuoi ah hing sel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei hing nuoisie migiloute leh, ka shi theina melma hing imkimkotte, lah akipat in hing sel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaun alungtang uh hepina nei lou in akhachip ua, akam un kisahtheitahin thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin ka kalsuonna pou uah, ahing imkuol ua tuoltang satna dingin, ahing mittuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asamat bottel ding kilawp humpibahnei bang leh, samat ding buhdap humpibahnei lunlai bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Mangpa thou inlen, amaute kimaituopi inlen, tuol ah paikhie inlen, Ka hinna khu migiloute akipat in, na namsau in hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Mangpa mihingte lah a kipat in, na khut in hing hunkhie in. Amaute pen leitung mihing ahi ua, leitung damlai hinkhuo, atanvou uh ahibou hi. Amaute dinga na kholpieh ann in agil uh va sah inlen; atate un neh ding kichingtah nei uhenlen, ata neute ua dingin, anei vaalte uh nuasie pieh uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ken vang dihtatnain na mel ka mu dinga, nangma batna nei a ka khahlaw chiengin, ka lungkim ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hatna Mangpa aw, Nang ka hing it ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa khu ka suongpi, ka kulpi leh kei hing hunkhepa ahi. Ka Pasian ka kibutna suongpi ahi a, Ama ah ka ginna ka koi ding hi, ama ka lum leh phaw, ka hundamna kii leh ka kulpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Phattaah Mangpa ka han ding a, tuachi’n ka galte lah a kipat in, hundam in ka um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Shina khauhuolten ahing viel a, Pasian ngaisahlouna tuilien in ahing zausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mishikhuo khauhuolten ahing viel a shina thangte ka kimvel ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka chimaw lungkham chiengin, Mangpa ka han a ka Pasian kungah, panpina ngen in ka kikou a; Aman a biehinn apat in ka aw aza a, ka kikou husa ama bil ah atungtouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n leitung akiling a, akiloh hi, Ama alungthah zieh in taangte kingahnate, akinuh a akithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anakawhawm akipat in meikhu apawtdoh a, Akamsunga kipat in katum thei meikuong apawtdoh a; tuana kipat in mei-amte akuongdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman vante aluoi kun a, ahing kumsuh hi; mielna khu akeeng nuoi ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama Cherub tunga tuongin aleeng hi; Ama khu huipi hate tunga tuongin hat tahin aleeng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ki khuna dingin akimkot ah khomiel abawl a; atunga khusuh dingin guo puo van meivomte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amasanga vahna ziehin meipi satah athenga, gieltangte leh mei-amte ake lemlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa khu van ah vanging bangin aginga, Tungnung pen in a aw asuohsah a, gieltang leh mei-amte akie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman athaltangte akapkhie a; amaute athe zah hi. Tualeh tunphe aphesah a, amaute asubuoi veng vung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n aw Mangpa lungthah a na vauna leh, na nakawhawma hu pawt in asem zieh in, tui luonnate ahing kilanga, leitung kingapnate muthei in ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman tunglam apat in ahing sawhsuh a, ahing tu a, tui tampi akipat in ahing kaidoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman ahat mama ka galte leh, kei hing muda ka melmate lah a kipat in, ahing hunkheta hi, amaute kei a dingin ahat mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaute’n ka vangsiet ni in ahing dou uh a; hinanleh Mangpa khu kei hing panpi pa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman mun awngthawl ah ahing pui a, ka tunga akipah ziehin ahing hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n ka dihtatna dungzui in, nuomman ahing peta hi; Ka khutte asienthou dungzui in ahing din kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa lampite ka zui a, ka Pasian a kipat in giloutahin, ka lampiel ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Adan thupiehte zousie ka masangah a um a, tualeh athupiehte keima akipat in, ka koimang ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amasangah genbanglou in ka um a, gitlouna apat in keima ka kihemkhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n ka dihtatna dungzui leh, amitmu a ka khutte sienthouna dungzui in, ahing din kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi khotuosiemte kungah, khotuosiemin na kilang ding a, genbangloute kungah, genbangloua kilang ding na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi siengthoute kungah, siengthou in na kilang ding a, genhate kungah, genhatah in na kilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen Nang mi kingaingiemte na hundam a, amit ha ua kisatheite na sungiem zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangma’n ka thaumei na hing detpieh ding a, Mangpa ka Pasian in, ka mielna ahing suhvah pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangma panpina zieh in, galkap honte ka nuoigawp zoua, tualeh ka Pasian panpina zal in, kulpi bang nangawn ka tawmkan zou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pasian lampi ahoibukim a, Mangpa thu etchien ahi a, Ama muong a belte zousie adingin, Ama khu lumlephaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa chilou Pasian koi a um ei? Eite Pasian loungal suongpi koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thahatna toh hing thuom a, ka lampite hoibukimsahpa khu ka Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aman ka kengte sazuhpi keng bangin abawl a, ka munsangtungte ah bittah in ahing umsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aman ka khutte galdou dan ding a zilsah a, tuachi’n ka khutten sum-eng thalpi aluoi zou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nangma’n na hundamna phaw na hing peta a, tualeh na zietlam khutin na hing tu a, na nunnemnain kei ahing thupi sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka nuoi ah ka kalsuonte na liensahta a, tuachi’n ka kengte ateu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka galte ka nuadel a, ka nua phah hi; thagam a a um masangsie un ka kinuale sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amaute thoukia nawnlou dingin ka satpua a; ka keng nuoi ah apua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aziehpen Nangma’n kidouna thahatna toh, kei na hing thuom a, kei hing doute ka nuoi ah na kun sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka galte kei hing nua ngat in, na nuatai sah a tualeh kei hing mudate, ka mangthaisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amaute akikou ua, hinanleh amauh hundam ding koima a um sih hi. Mangpa kungah akikou ua, hinanleh Mangpa’n amaute adawng tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuatahin hui in leivui amutleeng bangin, ken amaute ka satguoi a, gawlzing buonnawi bangin, ka paimang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nangma’n helna bawl mite lah a kipat in, na hing hundoh a, namte lutangin na hing pangsahta a; ka thei ngailou mite ka nasem in apangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ka tanchin atheitah chiengun, ka thu amang pai ngal ua, gamdang mite ka kungah ahing kitulut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Gamdang mite alung kie ua; akibutnate ua kipat in, zau kawm in ahing pawtdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mangpa ahing hi; ka suongpi phat in um hen; tualeh ka hundamna Pasian pahtawi in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Phuba hing lahpiehpa leh, namte hing zousah a ka nuoi a, hing koi piehpa Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Aman ka melmate lah a kipat ang hunkhie a; ahi, ahing doute tunglam ah na hing domsanga, mi gumtatte lah akipat in na hing hundoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaziehin, Aw Mangpa, namte lah ah, na min phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Aman aleengpa kungah guolzawna thupitah apie a; Asathau nu David leh ahah asuonte tungah, a itna tulngailou alangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vante’n Pasian thupina aphuong ua, huikhuo in akhut nasep asulang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sunin sun kungah thu agen a, Zan in zan kungah theina a sulang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thugen a um sih a, ham lah a um sih a, a aw uh bil a zah a hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabang hinapi in, a aw uh leitung pumpi ah akiza a, athu uh khovel kawlmong dongin akiza hi; Tuate lah ah, aman ni a dingin puon inn abawl pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ni khu mouneipa adantan a kipat a hing pawtdoh bang ahi a, mihat kitaidemna taiding bangin nuom asa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van mong langkhat akipat in ahing suoh a, Van mong langkhat zuon in apeikuol a, asatna akipat bangma a kiphuol thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa dan khu ahoibukim a hinna abawlhoi hi; Mangpa thuhilna khu amuonhuoi a, mimawl apil sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa thuguotte adih a, lungsim a nuomsah hi. Mangpa thupieh asiengthou a, mit avahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa zaudansiemna khu asiengthou a, kumtawn in a umden hi. Mangpa danthupiehte adih a, adihtat kimvel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuate khu sana sangin adeihuoi zaw a, ahi, sana sieng set sangin zong adeihuoi zaw hi. Khuoizu sangin ahum zaw a, Ahi, khuoi khaah a khuoizu luong khie sangin ahumzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, tuate zieh in, na suohpa vauhil in ka um a; tuate zui khu nuomman thupitah muna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh koi ahiei ama dihlouna theisiem thei ding? Dihlouna kiphuolte lah apat hing siengsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sil bawlkhiel teitei lou dingin na suohpa hing veng inlen, ka tungah khelna in thu neisah sin. Tuachi’n, tatkhielna thupitah apat genbanglou leh, mawna neilou in ka um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka suongpi leh ka hundampa, ka kam a thupawtte leh, ka lungtanga ka ngaituonate khu, na mitmu ah pomtah hi hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungkham Mangbat ni in, Mangpa’n hing dawng henlen, Jakob Pasian min in hing veng hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman a mun siengthou a kipat in, panpina hing sawl henlen, Zion a kipat in hing suhatta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman na sillat zousie thei ngitnget henlen, na halmang kithoinate hing sanpiehta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lungsim a na lunggulte hing pie henlen, na siltupte hing tangtung sahta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hundamna ah nuom in ka kikou ding ua, tualeh ka Pasian uh min in ka puonlapte uh ka zah ding uhi. Mangpa’n na ngetna zousie hing lawchingsah hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n asathau nupa ahundam chi tuin ka theita hi; akhut zietlam hundamna thahat in avan siengthou a kipat in, ama ahing dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khenkhat in sakollengte amuong ua, pawl khat in sakolte amuong uhi; hinanleh eite vangin, Mangpa i Pasian min i muong zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute kaikun in a um ua, apuata uhi hinanleh eite pen ithou ua, idingtang zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa Aw leengpa galzawna pie inlen, kang hat chiengun hing dawngin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na thahatna sungah, leengpa a nuom ding a, na hundamna ah nuomsana va-ia inchie!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Alungtang deilam nang na pie a, akam a angette na it sih hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen hoina guolzawlna toh ama nana lamdawt a, alutungah sana lukhu siengset na khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman na kung ah hinna ahing ngen a, ama na peta hi; kumtawm kumtawn a damna toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hundamna ah athupina alien hi, pahtawina leh thupina ama tungah na ngata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma’n kumtawn a thupha lienpen nga ding in, ama na bawl a, na umpina lungdamna toh ama nasatahin na kipahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen leengpa’n Mangpa amuonga, tualeh Tungnung pen khotuona zieh in akiling sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khutin na melmate zousie a suidoh dinga, na khut zietlam in nangma hing mudate amudoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lungthah hun chiengin amaute, haltuina meikuong bangin na bawl dinga, Mangpa thangpainain amaute avaltum ding hi. Tualeh mei in amaute akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma’n atate uh leitunga kipat na phietmang ding a, tualeh ahah asuonte uh, mihing tate lah akipat na sumang nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tungah silgilou bawl atum ua, sietna adap ngaituo uhi, tua lah asutangtung thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin nangma’n amauh na kinua hei sah dinga, thalpi gui a na thaltang te na thuozou diem chiengin, amaitanguh na ngim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa aw, na hatnate ziehin pahtawi in um in; tuachi’n na silbawltheina phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pasian, ka Pasian, bang dinga hing taisan na hiei? Bangdinga panpi ka ngetna leh ka thum, ka maunate a kipat a hichi talawm a hing gamlat na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pasian aw sun in ka kikou a, hinanleh na hing dawng sih a, zan in ka kikou a, tawldamna ka mutuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh nangpen na siengthou a, Israelte pahtawina Mangtoupha tungah na tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pule pate un nang ahing muong ua, tuachi’n nang na hunkhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang ahing han ua, tuachi’n humbit in a um zel uhi; ahing muong ua, tuachi’n zalatsah in a um ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei pen mihing mawngmawng ka hi sih a, tangtel giap ka hibou hi; mite gensiet leh simmaw ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hing mu zousie in simmawin ahing nuisan ua, ahing ne phen ua alutang uh ahing thinkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mangpa muong hiven; Aman hunkhe leh asih diei! A tung a akipah mama ziehin hunkhe leh avele,” ahing chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh nangpen naubu a kipata a hing lakhepa na hi a, Ka nu angsunga nawitep a ka um lai in na hing gingtasah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu naubu sung a kipat a nangma tunga kinga kana hita a, Nangpen Kanu gilsung a ka um lai in zong ka Pasian na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei apat in gamla sin, aziehpen lungkham mangbatna anai a, ahing panpi ding a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawngtal tampi in ahing im kuol ua Bashan bawngtal hatten ahing imchip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Humpibahnei humham bangin, kei ahing kamkah khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tui banga sunbuoh in ka um a, ka gu ka taang zousie akilawi siengta hi; ka lungtang khuoinun bangin, ka sungah azun gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hatna lah belphou bangin agawta a, ka lei zong ka dangtawng ah abehta a; shina leivui lah ah kei na hing lumsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen uiten ahing imkuol ua, migilou kikhawmten kei ahing im chimit ua, amaun ka khut leh ka kengte avut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka gu ka taangte zousie ka simthei a, amaun kei ahing du et uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka puonsilte akihawm ua, ka puonahtuol a dingin ai asan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh, Aw Mangpa, nang kei hing gamlat sinlen, Aw nang ka hatna, panpi dingin hing kinaw in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Namsau akipat in ka hinna hundam inlen; ui silbawltheina lah a kipat, ka hinna manphatah hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Humpibahnei kamsung apat in kei hing hundoh inlen, gam bawngtal kiite lah akipat in, na hing hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka unaute lah ah na min ka genzah dinga, mipi kikhawmte lah ah na min ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nou Mangpa zau mite aw, Ama phat un, Jakob hahlesuonte aw Ama pahtawi un, Israel tate aw, Ama giing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman suhgenthei mite, gimthuohna asimmaw sih a, kidah zong akidah sih hi, tualeh amai alah uah aphuol sih a, hinanleh a hat chiengin a ngaikhe zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kikhopna thupitah ah, ka phatna khu nangma ah ahi ding a, Ama giing mite masangah ka thuchiem ka tangtun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi zawngten ane ding ua, atai ding uhi; Ama sui miten Mangpa aphat ding uhi; Na lungtang uh kumtawn in ahing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kawlmong tan a miten athei ngitnget ding ua, Mangpa lam anga ding uhi, tualeh chichin namchin na mai ah akun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen Lenggam khu Mangpa a ahi; Ama pen namchin tunga vaihawmpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leitunga mihausate zousie in ane ding ua, Ama bie in akun ding uh a, Leivui a peisuhte zousie amasang ah ahing kun ding ua; koiman ahinna ahundoh theisih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khang sawnten Ama nna asem ding ua, Khang sawnsawn dongin Mangpa thu akigen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pieng nailou, hing pieng dingte kungah, atatdohna nasep thute aphuongzah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa khu kei hing chingpa ka belampu ahi a, ka tasam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman lou dawn dipdepna munte ah. Kei ahing lumsah a tui vei sip dide gei ah, ahing pui zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman ka hinna ahing bawlhoi pieh zela, Ama min zieh in dihtatna lampi ah ahing pui zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi, shina limguom tawn in pei nanleng; silgilou mawngmawng ka zau sih ding hi; Aziehpen nangman na hing umpi a, na khetbuh leh na chiengin ahing hamuon zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangman ahing doute mitmuin ka masangah, annkuong na lui a, ka lu sathau na nu a, ka nou adimlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pellou in hoina leh zangaina in, ka damsung tengin ahing zui dinga, tualeh Mangpa inn ah kumtawn in ka tengdenta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitung leh asunga um zousie Mangpa a ahi; Leitung leh asung tengte zousie toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen aman tua khu tuipi tungah amukhie a, tualeh luipite tungah asudet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa muol ah koi ahiei kaltou ding? Ahisihleh amun siengthou ah koi ahiei ding ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khut sieng leh lungtang siengthou nei mi leh, dihlouna lam a ahinna koi ngailou a, zuouthu a kichiem ngailou mite ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaun Mangpa akipat in guolzawlna amu ding ua, ahundamna Pasian akipat in dihtatna amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuakhu ama sui mi hahlesuon ahi, Jakob Pasian aw, na meel suite khu. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kotpite aw na lutang uh dom sang un, Nou tangtawn kotkhate aw, na kikhai sang un; thupina leengpa ahing lut theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thupina leengpa khu koi ahiei? Mangpa hattah leh sil bawlthei; kidouna a silbawlthei Mangpa khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kotpite aw na lutang uh domsang unlen, Tangtawn kotkhate aw na kikhai sang un; thupina leengpa ahing lut theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thupina leengpa khu koi ahiei? Galkapte Mangpa, Ama ngel khu thupina leengpa ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na kungah ka hinna ka hing domsangtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pasian aw, nangma ka hing muong hi, hing zalasah sinlen, ka galte ka tungah guolzousah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi, Nangma hing ngahte koima zala in umsah sinlen, aziehbei a giloute zalatah in um sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na lampite hing theisah inlen; Na lampi zuidan hing hilin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thutah ah hing pui inlen, hing sinsah in, aziehpen Nangma ka hundamna Pasian na hi a; sunnitum in ka hing ngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa aw na khotuona leh, na itna tullou thei ngitnget in, aziehpen tanglai a pat a na umsa mawng ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka khangdawnlai khelnate leh, bawsietnate thei ngitnget sinlen, Aw Mangpa na itna tultheilou leh, na hoina ziehin hing thei ngitngetin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa khu ahoi leh adih a hi a, tuaziehin mi khielte lampi ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman mi kingaingiemte vaihawmna ah apui ding a, mi kingaingiemte Aman alampi ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thuhun leh athutheipina zui poumate a dingin, Mangpa lampi zousie khu khotuona thudih leh ginumna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na min ziehin ka khelna ngaidam in; ka khelna alien sengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa zaudansiem mi koi ahiei? Aman alampi tel ding ahil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hinna nuomsatahin a um ding a, ahah asuonte’n lei gou aluo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa thuguh khu ama giing mite kungah a um a; a thuhun khu amaute kungah atheisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mitin Mangpa lam a en ngitnget a, aziehpen aman ka kengte len akipat in asutkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei lam hing nga inlen hing khotuo in; aziehpen khattanga genthei thuoh a um ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lungbuoinate ahing lien hi; ka gentheinate akipat hing lakhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka gimthuohna leh ka nat nate en inlen, ka khelnate zousie hing ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka galte ngaituoin, aziehpen tampi ahi ua, tualeh huotna kheltah toh ahing muda uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw ka hinna hing kep hoi pieh inlen, hing hunkhie in, zala in hing um sah sin; Nangma hing muong ka hi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungsim dihna leh hoina in hing humbit hen, aziehpen Nangma ka hing ngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasian aw alungkhamna zousie akipat in, Israel hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, vai hing hawmpiehin, lungsim hoitah puoin ka um hi, k Mangpa ka muongta a, ka taalpua sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing enchien inlen, hing endih in, ka lungtang leh ka lungsim Nang enkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen na itna tul ngailou ka masangah a um a; tualeh na thutah zui a um ngitnget ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi thulimloute toh ka toukhawm ngai sih a, mi lepchiete toh zong ka zawhkhawm sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sil gilou bawlte kikhopna ka huo a, migiloute toh ka toukhawm sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa aw, mawnabei in ka khutte kasil ding a, tuachi’n na maitam kim ah ka vahkoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kipah thugenna toh aw ngaitah a ka phuon theina dingin; Na silbawl lamdangte ka genzah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa na umna inn leh na thupina umna mun ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi khielte toh ka hinna la khawm sinlen, ka hinna zong sisan suohatte toh lakhawm sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuabang mite khut ah silgilou bawltupna a um a; azietlam khutte u’zong golguhna in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh kei pen genbanglou, lungsim hoitah puoin ka um ding hi; hing tandoh inlen hing khotuo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lei kituohna mun ah ka keng a ding a, mipi kikhawmte lah ah Mangpa ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa khu ka meivah leh ka hundamna ahi a, koi ka giing diei? Mangpa khu ka hinna kulpi ahi a, koi ahiei ka zau ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migilouten ka sa ne ding a ahing sui chiengun, ka galte leh kamelmaten ahing dou chiengun, akisui ua apua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Galkap honten hing dou ding in giehphuol satnan u’leh, ka lungtang azau sih ding a, ka tungah kidouna hing tung nanleh, ka kimuong nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa apat ka dei sil khat ka ngen a, tuakhu ka sui ding hi; Mangpa kilawmna mu ding leh, Abieh inn sunga thukan ding leh, Ka damsung teng Mangpa inn a, ka um ngitnget theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen mangbat ni chiengin abuhneu ah, kei ahing phuol ding a, akihumbitna biehbuh sungah kei ahing sel ding a; suongpi sang tungah kei ahing koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin ka kimvel a hing dou ka melmate, tunglam ah ka lu dop sangin a um ding hi; tuaziehin ken abieh inn sungah, lungnopna kikouna aw toh kithoina ka landinga, ginglawm toh Mangpa phatna la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, ngaitah a ka kikou chiengin, hing ngaikhie inlen, hing khotuo inlen, hing dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nang ka meel sui un” na chi chiengin, ka lungtangin Aw Mangpa, “Na meel ka suiding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei akipat in na mai phuol sinlen, na suohpa na lungthah man in kiheisan sin, nangpen kei hing panpipa nahi. Ka hundampa Pasian aw hing nuasie sinlen, hing taisan sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu leh ka pa’n ahingtaisan chiengun, Mangpa’n kei ahing keem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na lampi hing hil inlen, Ka galte ziehin lamphei ah hing pui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka galte deina bangin akhut uah hing pekhe sin; aziehpen theipitu dihloute ahing kipan ua, ka tunga tatsietna sekhe gigeten ahingdou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing gam ah Mangpa hoina mu ding, kigingtalou hileng ka lungke gawpta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa ngah inlen hangsantahin um in; Tuachi’n Aman na lungtang ahatsah ding hi. Kachi ahi Mangpa ngah in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa, ka suongpi aw, Nang ka hing han ding hi; hing dawng louin hing sipsan sin, aziehpen na sip dide leh, hankhuh a peisuhte bang ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang ka hing hat a na mun siengthou lam nga a, ka khut ka zah chiengin, ka ngetna aw te hing ngaikhieh pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migiloute leh silgilou bawlmite toh, hing puimang khawm sin; Amaun a innvengte u’kungah kilemna thu agen ua, hinanleh alungtang uah gitlouna aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asilbawlte uh dungzui leh, asilbawl giloute uh dungzui in, nangman thuh inlen, akhut nasepte uh thuh in; Agitlouna u’toh kikhom aman pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa nasepte leh akhut silbawlte, bangma a angailou ziehun, amaute aphelzah dinga alamtha kia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa phat in um hen, aziehpen aman ka ngetna aw te angaikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa khu ka hatna leh ka phaw ahi; ka lungtangin ama amuonga tuachi’n panpi in ka um hi. Tuaziehin ka lungtang in nuom asa mama a, tualeh ka lain ama ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa khu amite a dingin ahatna uh ahi a, asathau nupa a dingin hundamna kulpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mite hundam inlen, na goutante guolzawl in; amauh ching inlen, kumtawn in amauh pom in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou mi silbawltheitahte aw, Mangpa kungah pie unlen, Mangpa kungah thupina leh thahatna pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa kungah amin thupina pie unlen, siengthou kilawmna toh kivon in Mangpa bie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa aw khu tuite tungah a um a, thupina Pasian khu vanpi ging bangin, tuipi tampite tungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa aw khu silbawltheitah ahi a, Mangpa aw khu thupina a dim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa aw in sidar singkungte a sutan a, Ahi Mangpa’n Lebanon sidar singte atawng sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman Lebanon bawngnou bangin akidieng sah a, Lebanon leh Sirion zong gam bawngtal bangin, akitawm sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa aw in meikuongte akhenzah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa aw in gamdaite akiling sah a, Mangpa’n Kadesh gamdai te asuling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa, aw in sazuhpite nou atolsah a, gammang sing nate amutpul sienga akieusah hi. Tualeh abieh inn ah michin in a “Thupina” agen chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa khu tuisanglet tung a aleengtoupha ah atou a, Ahi, Mangpa khu kumtawn a dingin leeng in atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n amite kungah hatna ape ding a, Mangpa’n hamuonnain amite aguolzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangma ka hing pahtawi ding hi; aziehpen nangman na hing phong ding a, tualeh ka galte ka tungah nuomsain na koi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, hing panpi dingin nangma ka hing han a, tuachi’n na hing sudamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangman ka hinna, Sheol akipat in na lakhie a, kokhuh sunga lutte lah a kipat in, keima nang hingsah kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw nou a misiengthoute, Mangpa phat in lasa unlen, tualeh amin siengthou theizingna ah kipah thu gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen alungthahna khu mitphietkaal bep ahi a, adeisahna ah hinna aum hi, kaana pen zankaal khat aum thei a, hinanleh kipah na khu zingmawng chiengin ahing tung zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nopsah lai in keima “Suhling in, ka um ngaisih ding” ka na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa nang deisahna ziehin, ka taang na dingdetsah ta a, hinanleh na mai na phuol a, lungdongin ka umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangma ka hing han hi, tualeh Mangpa kungah panpina ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hankhuh a ka peisuh chiengin ka sisan ah, bang phattuomna a um diei? Leivui in nang ang phat diei mah? Na thutah zong aphuongzah ngel diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing ngaikhie inlen, hing khotuo in, Aw Mangpa kei hing panpi pa hi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangman ka kaanate lamna na suoh sah a, Ka sai ip puonte na hing sutpieh a, lungnopna puon na hing sil sahta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka hinna in siplou a, nangma ahing phat thei na ding in; Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, na kungah kipahthu kumtawn in kagen ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangma ah ka muonna ka koi hi, kei hing zalasah ngai sin len, na dihtatna in hing tandoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei langah na bil hingdaw inlen, manlangin hing hundoh in. Ka kibutna suongpi hi inlen, ka hundamna kulpi muonhuoi hing hiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi, Nangma ka suongpi leh ka kulpi na hi; na min ziehin hing makai inlen hing pui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka awhna dinga aguh a apha uh lenthang lah apat; hing kaidoh in nang ka hatna na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na khut sungah ka hagau ka hing keem sah hi; Aw mangpa thutah Pasian, nangman na hing tandohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mannabei milim thupi ngaite ka huo a, hinanleh ken vang Mangpa ka muong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na khotuona ah kipah leh nuom in ka um ding hi, aziehpen nangman ka mangbatna na ngaituo a, ka hinna lunggim a aum laiin zong, na thei ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh ka galte khut sungah, na hing pekhe sih a, ka kengte mun awngthawl ah, na ding sah zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw mangpa, ka tungah zangai in, ka lung adong hi; Lunggim na ziehin ka mitte a miel gawpta a; Ahi, ka hinna leh ka tahsa pumpi aba gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen ka damsung lunggimna in kamang zouta a, tualeh ka kumte khu thumlemauna in abeita hi; ka thulimlouna ziehin ka hatna aba a, ka gute a zawngkhalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahing doute zousie lah ah, adieh in ka innvengte lah ah, Ka meltheite adingin mizauhuoi ka suohta a, kholai a hing mute kei akipat akihemkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mishi kimanghil bang in manghil in ka umta a, leibel keh bang ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen mi tampite hing hehna ka za a, ka kimvel zauna in adim hi; hing tha ding thu akikup khawm lai un, ka hinna hing lah pieh atum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh “Aw Mangpa nangma ka hing muong hi,” nang ka Pasian nahi, ka hing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hunte na khut sungah aum hi; ka galte leh ahing bawlgentheite, khut apat in hing hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na mel vah na suoh tungah taangsah inlen; na khotuona zieh in hing hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing zalasah vawt sin, aziehpen nangma ka hing han ahi, Migiloute muolphou uhenlen, hankhuh sungah dai dide in um uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zuou genna kamte khu ham theilou in um uheh, kisathei leh simmaw kawm in, midihtatte douna thu agen leng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw na hoina khu kiningching hina va-ia e, Nangma hing zaute a dingin na kholkhawm a, mizousie mitmu a, Nangma hing muongte dinga na bawlpieh khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang amauh mihingten aphielguh tupna ua pat, na mitmu a humbitnain na phuol gu dinga, lei selhatte akipat amauh na buhneu ah na koidap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa phat in um hen, aziehpen ahepina lamdangtah khu, khopi dettah ah ahing musahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Patau in, “Na mitmu apat paimang in ka umta kana chita a,” Ahivang in panpina ngen a, Nangma han a ka kikouna aw te nana za leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw nou a misiengthoute zousie in, Mangpa it un; Mangpa’n mi ginumte akembit a, hinanleh kisatheitah a gamtate pen, buching tahin athuh kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mangpa a kinem zousiete aw, Hangsan tahin um unlen, na lungtang uh ahing hatsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tawnkhielna ngaidam a um a, a khelna liekhu a um mi ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n gitlouna nei a aselou mi leh, alungsim a zehemna umlou mi khu ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hamlou kei a ka um lai in, sunnituma ka maunate zieh in, ka gu katang zousie angawn suoh siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen sun leh zan in, ka tungah na khut agih mama hi; Ka thahatna zong nipilai nisa kahgaw bangin agaw gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka khelna, na kungah ka hing theisah a, ka gitlouna na kungah ka im nawn sih hi. “Ka tatkhelnate Mangpa kungah gendoh vang ka chi a,” tuachi’n nangman ka khel na thulim lounate na hing ngaidamta hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian ngaisah mi zousiein, mu bailam a na um lai in nangma kungah thungen uhen; Lunggimna tuipi ahing leet chiengin, amaute abanpha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma ka kibutna mun na hi a, lungkham buoina apat na hing humbit ding a; Na tatdohna late in na hing imkhum ding hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na peina ding lampi ka hing hil ding a, ka hing zilsah dinga, ka mit a, en kawm in ka hing thuhil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Theisiemna neilou sakol ahiei, ahisihleh sabiltung ahiei, bangin um sih un, amau’te pen kamkaina khau leh siabat atudet angai hi; tuachilou in ahing nai ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migiloute a dingin gentheina atam a, hinanleh Mangpa muongte pen khotuonain a im kuol ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou midihtatte aw, Mangpa ah kipah unlen, nuom un, tualeh Nou lungtang dihtah pozousiete aw; Nuom in kikou un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou mi dihtatte aw, Mangpa ah nuom un, midihtatte adingin Pasian phat akilawm mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kaigingin Mangpa phat unlen, pehging gui sawm nei in ama phat in lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pahtawi in la tha sa unlen, husa thupi toh siemtahin tum un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa thu adih a, anasep zousie muonhuoi tah a bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman dihtatna leh vaihawmna dih a it a, leitung Mangpa hoi nain adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa thu in vante siem ahi a, van a umte zousie zong a kama hu pawt a siem ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman tuipi tuite bangkhat koikhawm bangin akoi khawm a, tuipi thuhpi tuite koikhawmna inn ah akoikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitung pumpi in Mangpa giing henlen, khovel a tengte zousie ama zau in chiza uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen aman thu agen a, ahing umta mai hi aman thu apie a, tuachi’n ahing um detta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n namte lemguotna khu, bangmalou asuoh sah a, mite siltupte khu phattuomna neilou in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa lemguotna khu kumtawn in ading den hi; alungsim ngaituonate zong akhang akhangin, a um den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa a Pasian ua nei nam ahampha uh, aman a gouluo dinga atel nam khu nam hampha ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa’n van a kipat in a en suh a, mihing tate zousie amu suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n atouna mangtoupha apat in, leitunga tengte zousie a en ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman amaute zousie lungtangte abawlhoi pieh a, asilbawl zousie uh a ngaituo ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lengpa koima galkapte tam ziehin, humbitin a um ngai sih a, mihat zong athahatna ziehin hunkhieh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bitna dingin sakolte zong bangma aphatuom sih a; ahatna thupitah ziehin koima ahunkhe tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngaivawi, Mangpa mit khu ama giingte tungah atu a, A khotuona kinemte tungah atu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahinna uh shina akipat a hunkhe ding leh, kiel hun chienga amauh hingsah dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hinna un Mangpa angah ngitnget a, Ama khu ahing panpipa leh iphaw uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama ah ka lungtang uh anuom dinga, Amin siengthou ka muon zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na khotuona ka kinep na bang ngei un, ka tung uah hing umta hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangchihlai pouin Mangpa ka phat dinga, aphatna ka kam sungah a um den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna in Mangpa asuong dinga, mi kingaingiemten tami aza ding ua, akipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Oh! Mangpa hing pahtawipi unlen, amin itawisang khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa ka han a, tuachi’n aman ahing dawng hi; ka zauna zousie akipat ahing hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama en un na mai uh ahing taang ding a, tuachi’n na mai zum ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam mi genthei a kikou a, Mangpa’n azata hi; alungkhamna zousie apat in ahundamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama zau mite pen akimvel uah Vansawlsiengten, giehphuol bawl in a imkuol ua, amaute ahunkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Oh! Mangpa hoidan chiem unlen, en mawng vawi un; Ama muong miten nuom asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou amisiengthoute aw, Mangpa giing un, Ama giing mite atasam ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Humpibahnei lunlaite atasam ua a gilkiel zel uhi, Hinanleh Mangpa sui miten vang, silhoi mawngmawng atasam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tate aw! hing pei unlen, ka thu ngaikhie un, Mangpa giing dan kang hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lah uah hinna it a, damsung ni hoi tampi mu ding lunggul mi koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gilou lah ah na lei veng hoi inlen, zuou genna akipat na kam veng hoiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gilou taisan inlen, sil hoi bawl in, lemna sui inlen, adel in del zel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa mit khu midihtatte tungah atu a, akikouna uh ngaikhe dingin abil adaw ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Silhoilou bawlte tungah Mangpa amai guma, leitunga kipat in amaute thei zingna khu, aphietmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Midihtatte akikou chiengun Mangpa’n aza hi, tualeh abuoinate ua kipat in ahundoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lungtang hasete Mangpa’n anai a, tualeh hagau a kisiana neite ahundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Midihtat in thuohgimna tampi anei a, hinanleh tuate zousie apat in, Mangpa’n ahunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Agute zousie uh akembit a, khatbeh zong atawng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Silhoilou in migilou athat dinga, tualeh midihtat muda pouma mawpai ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa’n asuohte hinna atandoh zel a, Ama belte koima mawpai in a um sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa kei hing doute, nangman dou inlen, kei hing suolte nangman suolin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lum leh phaw la inlen, Kei hing panpi ding in dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Teipi zong zundoh inlen, “Kei hing nuadelte na dal inlen,” ka hinna kungah na hundamna kahi chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hinna lah tum a suite, zalasah inlen zum sahin, Ka sietna ding bawlte zong, lungkie in nua tai sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute busi hui mutleng bang uhenlen, Mangpa vansawlsiengin ama uh delmang hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lampi uh miel in naal henlen, Mangpa vansawlsieng in amaute nuadelta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun azieh beiin ka awhna dingin, lenthang adapsie ua azieh umlou pi’n, ka hinna matna dingin leihum atou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kiging manlouin atung uah, sietna thakhat in tung henlen, alenthangsie uah amaute mama awh uhenlen, manthaina lei hum sung ah amauh mama kie uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka hinna Mangpa ah anuom dinga, ahundamna ah akipah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka gu ka taangte zousie in, “Mangpa aw Nang bang mawngmawng, koi a um ei mah? Amaute sanga hatzawte akipat in, atha zawngkhalte na hunkhie a, mi zawngkhalte leh tasamte pen, amauh tomgam leh negamte apat in na hunkhie hi,” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Theipimi dihloute ahing kipandoh ua, ka theikhah ngailou silte ahing dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hoinate, hoilou in ahing thuh ua, ka hinna alungkhamsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh kei pen in achinat chiengun, ka puonsil sai ip ahia, ann ngawl in keima ka kisugenthei a. Ka thungetnate ka ang sungah ahing kinuale kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka lawm ahiei, ka sanggam ahiei, suun banga da ing a, mi anu suun a kap bangin, vul ningnieng in kunsa in ka vah kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh kei ka kipalpua chiengin, nuomsa in akikhawm uhi; mivuohhat gumtatte, kei hing dou ding in akikhawm ua, kenlah ka thei sih a, ahing bottel ua atawp sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawi bawlnate ah Pasian theilou misimmaw hatte toh, aha uh ahing gawtkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa aw bangtan ahiei nang sim et ding? ang bawlsietna ua pat in kei hing hunkhie inlen, humpibahneite lah a kipat in, ka hinna manphatah hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken mipi kikhawm thupitahte lah ah, kipahthu na kungah ka gen dinga, mi tampi lah ah nangma ka hing phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka galte dihloutahin ka tungah nuomsa sah sinlen, Azieh bei a kei hing mudate mit sih-at in kihousah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun kilemna thu agen sih ua, hinanleh gamsunga galmuonga um khin khiante, sol theina ding angaituo zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaun akam uh lienpipi in ahing kah khum ua, “Katei, katei! imit un muta hai e” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangman tami na muta hi, sip dide in um sin Aw Mangpa hing gamlat sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khanglou inlen kei hing hun dingin kisa in; ka Pasian leh ka Mangpa kei hing panpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, na dihtatna dungzuiin vai hing hawmkhum inlen, ka tungah amauten nuomsa sih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amauten alungsim un, “Nuom e, tambang hilou ahiei mah idei” chi sih uheh, amauh “I valzouta” zong chisih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka sietna tunga kipah a nuomsate khu, zum a buoi gawpin um uhenlen, Ka tunga kiliensahte, muolphouna leh zumna sil sahin um uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka dihtatna hing kipahpite pen, nuom leh kipah in kikou uhenlen, asuohpa vangphatna a kipah “Mangpa khu, pahtawi in um heh” chi ngitnget uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka lei in na dihtat na thu agen dinga, tualeh sun nitum in nangma phatna thu ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Migilou tatkhielna in, ka lungsim thuhtah sungah thu agen a, amitmu uah Pasian giingna malmal a um sih hi; achi hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen akhelna amudoh chiengun amuda sih dinguh, chiin ama mitmu ah ama leh ama akiphat ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akam ua thu pawtte khu gitlouna leh solna ahi a; piltah a nasep leh silhoi bawl atawpsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Alupna tung nangawn ah gitlouna ageel geel ua, lampi hoilou ah apei tei tei ua, gitlouna anuol sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na khotuona khu vante ah aum a, tualeh na gin umna in zong meipite a sun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na dihtatna khu taang thupitahte bang ahi a, na vaihawmnate khu tuipi thuh bang a hi a; Mangpa aw nangman mihingte leh, gamsate na humbit zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Pasian na khotuona khu manpha hina va-ia e; Mihing zousie in na halim nuoi abel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amauten na innsung kiningchinna toh, nuomsa in atai ding ua; na kipahna lui tuite na dawn sah nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen na kungah hinna tuikhuh a um a; na vah taangah vahna ka mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Oh! Nangma, hing theite tungah, na itna tulngailou umsah zel inlen, tualeh lungtang dihtahte tungah, na dihtatna langsah ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mikisatheite keng kei dou dingin kalsuonsah sinlen, tualeh migiloute khut in kei hing notmang sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khunah silgilou bawlte akipua ua, thalpaiin a um ua athouzou nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Silhoilou bawlte ziehin, kisulungkham nuom sinlen, dihloutaha bawlte zong eng sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />aziehpen amaute hampa banga at pua pai in aum ding ua, louhingte banga vuoi pai ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa muonginlen silhoi bawl in, tuachi’n gamsungah na teng ding a, bittah in na um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa tungah kipah inlen, tuachi’n aman na lungtang deilamte ahing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na umdan ding Mangpa tungah nga inlen, Ama muongin Aman abawl sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman na dihtatna vah bangin ataang sah dinga, tualeh na dihna thute sunlai nisa bangin, ataang sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa mai ah sip dide inlen, Ama ngah khinkhian inlen agamtatna ua, lawchinna mute zieh in kilunggimsah sinlen, a silgilou bawl tupte ua alawchin chiengun kilunggimsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungthah kideh inlen thangpaina taisan in, kisulunggim nuomda in, silhoilou a puilut in a um zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen migiloute sattan in a um ding ua, hinanleh Mangpa ngahten gam aluo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tomnou kaal in migilou a um nawn sih dinga, a umna mun uh hoitahin en nanlachin zong, a um nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh lungnemten gam aluo ding ua, nopsahna kiningchingin akipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Migilou in midihtat sietna ding ngaituo in, aha agawtkhum leng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n migilou a nuisan a, ani uh hing tung pai ding athei zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi gentheite leh tasamte luoi ngiem ding leh, umdan dihte that dingin migilouten namsau adoh ua, athalpite uh kuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anamsau un amauh lungtang asun dinga, athalpite uh akihiehtawng pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Midihtat in sil tawmnou khat anei khu, migilou tampite hausatna sangin ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen migilou bante akihiehtawng ding a, hinanleh Mangpa’n midihtatte atudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa’n midihtatte ni athei a, agouluo uh kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hun hoiloute ah a zala sih ding ua, kiel tun chiengin zong atai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Migiloute pen amangthang ding ua, Mangpa melmate zong loupa dawng dipdep bang ahi ding ua, suhmangthai in a um ding ua, meikhu bangin azammang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Migilouten aleitawi ua apekia nawn sih uhi; hinanleh midihtatte pen in, khotuona langsahin ape zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa guolzawl miten, gam aluo ding ua; hinanleh aman asamsiette pen, sattan in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi hoi kalsuonte pen Mangpa suhdet ahi a, alampi uah akipah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kipalpua nanleh abungbusip in atusah sih dinga, Mangpa’n akhut a ama atuh det zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Naupang kana hi a, tuin tehsie ka hing hita hi; hinanleh midihtatte taisan a a um lam, ka mukha nai sih a atate u’zong, khutdaw a vah ka mu ngaisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amauten mi akhotuo zing ua apie ua, aleitawi sah ngitnget ua, atate u’zong guolzawl in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gilou peisan inlen silhoi bawl in, tuachi’n kumtawn in na teng den ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n thudih a it a, Ami muonhuoite ataisan ngai sih ding a; midihtatte pen kumtawn a kepbit in a um uhi. Hinanleh migilou tate pen sattan ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Midihtatten gam aluo ding ua, khunah kumtawn in ateng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Midihtat kam in pilna thu agen a, alei un dihna thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Alungtang sung uah Pasian danthute a um a, akalsuon akitaal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Migilouin midihtatte abuhdap ua, tha dingin asui kawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mangpa’n amaute khutsung ah, midihtatte anuasie sih dinga, thukhenna mai ah amawpai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mangpa ngah inlen, alampi zuiin, tuachi’n gamluo dingin aman nang ahing tawisang dinga, Migiloute suhmanga aum chiengin, tuakhu na mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Keima’n migilou misugenthei leh, Lebanon muola Sidar sing bawhpha banga, mi nuoisie ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka hing pei kia lamin ana um nawn sih uhi; ka sui kawi vangin ka muzou nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Genbanglou mi khu melchi inlen midih en in, aziehpen tuabang mite tawpna khu, hamuonna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh mitawnkhielte pen, suhmang khawm ahi ding ua, migilou te tawpna khu suhmang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Midihtatte hundamna khu Mangpa a kipat ahi a, Amakhu alungkham chimaw hun chieng ua, akibutna uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mangpa’n amaute apanpi a, ahunkhie hi; Ama abel zieh un, Aman! Migiloute akipat in amaute ahunkhie ding a, ahundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa lungthah in hing phawh sinlen, thangpai in hing thunun vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen na thaltangten ahing kap pailet ua, tualeh ka tungah na khut ahing tusuh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lungthahna ziehin ka sa tungah, chidamna mal mal a um sih hi; ka khelna zieh in ka gu ka taangte ah, damna a umta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thulimlounate’n ka lujang ahing netkhum a, puohgihtah bangin kei dingin agih seng taluo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka motna ziehin, ka liemnate muot in a ui gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lunggim in ka kun khiukheu a; sun nitum in ka thum in ka tau hit hit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka kawng mei kah bangin a sa hethut a, ka tahsa pumpi ah chi damna, mun mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei pen zawngkhal gawpin, ka basamta a, ka lungtang natna ziehin ka tau tau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka lunggul teng, nangman na thei sieng hi, ka maunate zong nang akipat phuol ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungtang aphu dut dut a, ka thahatna abeita a, tualeh ka mit khomunate zong, kei a pat in apeimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thuohgimna apat in ka lawm kaguolte, akihemdoh zel ua ka sanggamte zong, gamlapi ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hinna lah tum a hing suiten, ka awhna dingin thang akam ua, Ka liemna ding suiten zong, manthaina thu ngen agen ua, tualeh sun nitum in solna thu ngen akikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Kei pen bilbing bangin khozalou in ka um a; hamtheilou thu gentheilou bangin ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi, kei pen mi khoza theilou leh, a kama dawng theilou bang in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa nangma hing kineppi ka hi, Aw Mangpa ka Pasian nangma’n na hing dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hing ngaikhie in kachi a, tuachilouin ka keng ateu khah chiengin, ahing otkhun ding ua,” ka tungah akiliensah kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei pua dingin kakisata a, ka lunggimna zong ka masangah aum ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thulimlounate ka phuongkhe dinga, ka khelnate ziehin lunggim in ka um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh umloupi a kei hing dou kamelmate, adamthei ua ahat uhi; tualeh dihloutah a hing mudate pung deu deu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hoina silhoilou a hing thuhte khu ka melmate ahi uhi, aziehpen ken ahoilam pouma ka zui zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing taisan sinlen; Aw ka Pasian kei a kipat gamla vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka hundamna Mangpa Aw, kei hing panpi dingin manlangin hing kinaw in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka lei a khelna thu kagenlouna dingin, ka umdante ka veng hoi dinga, migiloute ka masanga a um laisie uh, ka kam mugahna in ka gah ding,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hamlou in sip dide in ka um a, ahoi lam zong genlou a daidide a, ka um chiengin ka lunggimna tohthou in umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka sungah ka lungtang asa hut hut a, ka ngaisut sut chiengin, tuami mei in ahing kaang a, tuachiengin ka lei in thu agenkha zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mangpa ka hinkhuo bei hun ding leh, ka damsung bangtan ahi diei, chi hing theisah inlen, ka hinna bei kin dan hing theisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngaivawi, ka damsung khutpeh chie bepin na siem a, ka damsung kumte sawt dan zong, na mitmu ah bangma tham ahi sih hi. Mihing zousie ahoilai nite u’zong, bangmalou mai ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Adihtah in, mihing pen nihim banga vah kawi ahi a, abuoi thawn maimai uhi. Gou akhol khawm ua aluo ding pen athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa tuin kei bang ngah nalai ka hiei? Ka kinepna Nangma ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tatkhielna zousie akipat hing tandoh inlen, mi mote gensiet in hing umsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma bawl ahiziehin ka ham sih a, ka kam zong ka kaah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hing vuohna kei akipat lamang inlen, na khut hahna zieh a mangthai kahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihingte atatkhelna zieh ua, na phawhhil chiengin, akilawmna pen uh leikha bangin, na zunmangsah hi. Adihtah in mihing zousie tuihu. Bang ahi bou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa, ka thungetna ngaikhie inlen, ka kikouna lam ah na bil hing daw in; ka hitui luongte donlouin koi sin, aziehpen mikhuol ka hi a, kapu leh pate banga khuolzin taam bang mai ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam mun a kipat a ka pawtdoh a, ka um nawnlou masangin, ka haat thei kia na dingin, gumtah a nang etna mai kei apat in heimang in.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kukaltahin Mangpa ka ngah a, Kei lam ah ahing kihei a, ka kikou azata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman manthaina kokhuh leh, buonnawi lah a kipat in, kei ahing kaikhe tou a tualeh, suongpi tungah ka kengte a koi a, ka kalsuon a kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman ka kam ah la tha akoi a, i Pasian phatna la ahing pie hi, mi tampi in amu ding ua azau ding ua, tuachi’n Mangpa amuong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa a muonna nei a, kiliensahte lam ngalou a, zuou thu gente kiheisan mite ahampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, na nasep lamdang tahte leh, koute dinga na lunggeelte atam mama a, tuate na masanga suhlat seng guol ahi sih hi. Tuate phuongzah a gen ding hita leng, simseng guol ahisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kithoina leh sillat na lunggul sih a, ka bilte na hing vutvangta hi. Halmang sillatte leh khelna zieh a, sillatte na phuut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken “Ngaivawi kei tanah ka um hi; laibu ziel sungah ka tungthu akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian na deilam bawl khu ka kipahna ahi a, na danthute ka lungtang sungah a um hi;” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kikhopna thupitah ah dihtatna thupha ka genta a, Ngaivawi! Aw Mangpa, ka kam ka hum sih chi nangman na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hundamna panpina kalungtang sungah, ka imden sih a na gin umna leh, na hundamna thu ka phuongdoh zaw hi. Na itna tulngailou leh na gin umna, khawmpi thupitahte ah ka im mang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na khotuona nemtah it sinlen, na itna tulngailou leh na gin umna leh, na thutahin hing humbit ngitnget zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen silhoilou simseng louten, kei ahing imkuol uhi. Ka khelnaten ahing nuaphah ua, ka dahdoh ngamta sih hi. Ka khelnate ka lutunga samzangte sangin, atamzaw a ka lungtang abaa gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, ka hundamna ah kipah inlen; Aw Mangpa, kintah in hing panpi mengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hinna lahmang tum a suite zousie, buoigawp leh zumsah in um uhen; ka sietna ding dei mite zousie, zalah leh maizum in nuakia sah in um uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Awi ngel ing e, Awi ngel ing” chia hing koute’n azalatna zieh un, mangbang tahin um uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh nangma hing suite zousie pen, nangma ah nuom in kipah uhenlen, na hundamna ngai poumaten, “Mangpa pahtawi in um heh,” chi ngitnget uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei pen mi genthei leh tasam ka hi a, hinanleh Mangpa’n ahing ngaituo ngitnget a, nang pen ahing panpipa leh, ahing tandohpa na hia; Aw ka Pasian hing kiheh vawt sin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gentheite khotuo mite ahampha uhi, amangbat ni chiengun Mangpa’n ahunkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n amauh ahumbit dinga, ahingsah ding hi; leitungah guolzawl in aum ding ua, agalten aut ut a abawl ding un, a pekhe sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Alupna tung ua china a alup chiengun, Mangpa’n ahatsah dinga, adamllouna uleh ahatlouna zousie uh zong, na damsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ken, “Aw Mangpa hing khotuo inlen hing sudam in, na tungah ka khielta hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka melmate’n “Bangchih chiengin, ashi in a min amangthang diei?” chiin ahing gensie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh kei ve a ahing pei chiengun, thuginalou pou a gen ua, alungtang uah thulimlouna akholkhawm ua, apawtdoh chiengun mi ahil zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei hing mudate zousie’n kidaphou in, ahing gensie ua ka sietna ding lemtang angaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute’n “Shi theina natna in aman detta a, alupna akipat athoudoh sih ding” ahing chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka muon mama ka annkuong impi, ka lawm it pen nangawn in zong, ka tungah aketul alehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa, hing khotuo inlen, amaute ka thuh theina dingin hing kaithou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tungah lungdam nahi, chi ka theina tami ahi; ka melmate ka tunga aguolzaw lou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh keipen lungsim dihtah ka puoh ziehin, na hing tudet a tualeh kumtawn in na masangah, nang koidenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa Israel Pasian khu, kumtawn akipat kumtawn tanin phat in umta hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sakhi in lui tui luong dieldiel alunggul bangin, Aw Pasian, ka hinna in nangma ahing lunggul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna in Pasian angai a, Pasian hing ngai in adangtah hi, bangchih chienga Pasian kunga tungin, Amasang ah ka kilah thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miten ka kungah “Na Pasian hei a um ahiei?” Ahing chi lai un sun leh zan in ka hituite, ka ann ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam silte ka geeldoh chiengin, ka hinna ka sungah ka sungbuo a, mipite lah ah ka pei a; lasa a kikou aw toh lungdam kipahna leh, phatna ging toh Pasian biehinn lam zuon in, ama uh kai in ka pei zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw ka hinna bang dinga lungkham a kun na hiei? bang ding a ka sunga lungmuong maw na hiei? Pasian ah kinem in, aziehpen amel a panpina ziehin, ama ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Ka Pasian, ka hinna ka sungah akuun denta hi. Tuazieh in Jordan gam leh Hermon leh Mizar muol akipat, Nangma ka hing geldoh ngitnget ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na teutui luong zuozuote ah, tuithuh leh tuithuh akihan tuo ua, na tui kihotte leh tui kinawng zousie in, kei ahing tum ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sun chiengin Mangpa’n a itna tulngailou khu, thu ape dinga zan chiengin, a la in ahing umpi ding hi. Tuakhu ka hinna Mangpa kunga ka thumna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka Pasian ka suongpi kung ah, “Bangdinga kei hing manghil na ahiei?” Bangdinga ahing doute zieh a, lunggim a mau mau ka hiei? ka chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka tahsa tunga shi theina khop liemna bangin, kei hing doute’n “Na Pasian hei a um ahiei?” chiin ahing phin ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw ka hinna bangdinga da a kun na hiei? Bangzieh a ka sunga lungmuong maw na hiei? Pasian ah kinem in, aziehpen ka hundampa leh, ka Pasian phat nalai ding ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian vai hing hawmpieh inlen, Pasian ngai sahlou namte lah ah, ka tungtang thu hing genpieh inlen, migilou leh solhatte lah apat in hing hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen nang ka bitna Pasian na hi; bangding a nang pampai ahiei? Bangzieh a ka galte nuoisiena zieh a, kap kawm a vah kawi ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw na vahna leh na thutahna hing sawlkhie inlen, tuate’n kei hing zawpi uhenlen; na muol siengthou leh na tenna mun ah, hing puitung uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian maitam ah ka peidinga, ka kipahna mama Pasian kungah ka pei ding hi, Aw Pasian ka Pasian nangma tumging toh, ka hing phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw ka hinna bangdinga da a kun na hiei? Bangdinga ka sunga lungmuong maw na hiei? Pasian ah kinem in ka hundampa leh, ka Pasian phat nalai ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian, adamlai hun ua, na sil bawlte ka pu ka pate un ahing hil ua, ka bil un kaza ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma’n na khut ngei in namte na notdoh a, hinanleh amauh na phudet dante. Namte na sugenthei a na paidoh dante ahing hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen agam luo uh amauh, namsau a alah uh ahi sih a, tualeh amauh bantha hat a, kihundam zong ahi sih uh hi; atung ua na kipah zieh a, na khut zietlam leh na banthahat leh, na meel vah in ahundam ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Pasian Nang ka leengpa na hi, Jakob guolzawna dingin thu pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma vangin ka galte uh ka sawnpua ding ua, Nangma min zal in ahing doute ka tuonchil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen ka thalpi ka muong sih ding a, tualeh ka namsau in ahing hundam zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh ka galte akipat in nang hundamta a, kou hing mudate khu na zala sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sun nitum in Pasian ka suong ua, kumtawn in na min ka phat ding uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi hinapiin tuin koute na hing paidohta a, tualeh na hing zumsahta hi; tualeh ka galkapte utoh, na pawtdoh khawm nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka galte uh masang ah nang nuatai sah a, kou hing mudate’n galsum lahte, a dei dei un akilahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang koute belam thadingte bangin, na hing bawlta a tualeh namte lah ah, nang thethangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mite bangmalouin na hing zuata a, a man ding un tampi na ngen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka innvengte uh bawlsiet in na hing umsah a, ka kim ka vel ua umte simmaw leh, nuisat in na hing umsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Namte lah ah aselam a paunah, na hing suoh sahta a mite lah ah, nuizatbuh na hing hisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka zalat na khu sun nitum in, ka mai ah a um zinga, ka mai zumna in ahing tuom zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahing phinte leh ahing gensete thu zieh leh, melmate leh phuba la mite zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamte zousie ka tung uah ahing tungta a, hinanleh nang ka hing manghil ngai sih ua, na thuhun zong ka zuoutatsan ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungtang uh akinuahei kia sih a, ka kalsuonte un na lampi apielsan ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hinapiin Nang koute na hing kehgawp sah a, si alte umna mun na hing suoh sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kouten ka Pasian min uh ka manghil ua, gamdang pasien lang a ka khut uh ka zah ua ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasian in asuidoh sih ding amah? Aziehpen Aman lungtang sunga thuguhte athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma zieh in sun nitum a tha in ka um ua, gaw ding belam banga simtha ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing thoudoh in, bang dinga imu na hiei? Thou inlen, kumtawn a dingin hing paimang sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangding a na mai phuol na hiei? Bangdinga ka thuohgimna uleh, nuoisie a ka umnate uh manghil na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen ka hinna uh leivui suin akuun suh a, ka tahsa uh tuol ah abehdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thou inlen hing panpi in, na khotuona ziehin hing tandoh in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lungtang sungah la ngaitah aluong let a; Lengpa tungtang thu a ka laphuo ka gen ding hi; ka lei zong laigel siem mi laikung bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tate sangin nang na mel ahoi zaw hi, na nephu ah khotuona buohkhum ahi a, tuaziehin Pasian in kumtawna dingin, nang ahing guolzawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw mihatpa na kawngah na namsau kuo inlen, na thupina leh na kilawmna toh hing kizem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thutah leh kingaingiemna leh, dihtatna ziehin na kilawmna sil in, lamzangtahin sakol tungah tuongin kuonkhie in; tuachi’n na zietlam khut in sil chizat huoite ahing hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thaltang khu leengpa melmate lungtang ah ahiem a, namte na keng nuoi ah apua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Pasian na leengtoupha khu kumtawn kumtawn in, aumden dinga; na lenggam lengchieng lah dihna lengchieng ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangman dihtatna na it a gitlouna na huo hi. Tuaziehin Pasian na Pasian in, na lawm na guolte tunglam peh ah ahing koi a, lungnopna sathau ahing nuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na puontuolsilte zousie gimnamtui mirrah, aloe leh sing gimnamtui kibuoh ahi, Saiha a kibawl leng innpi akipat, tumging gui neiten nang ahing kipah sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na numei zatathuoite lah ah leengpa tanute atel uh a, na zietlam ah Ophir sana a kizem in leengnu ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tanu aw, ngaikhie inlen ngaituo inlen, na bildawin; na mite leh napa innkuonte manghil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n na melhoina Lengpan alunggul ding hi; ama na mangpa ahi a ama zatatin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tai-ar tanuten silpieh tawi in na deisahna asui ding ua, mite hausaten na deisahna angen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa inn sungah leengpa tanu khu athupi mama a, apuonsilte sana toh kigankhawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puonkhui kilawmtah silin leengpa kunga pui in, aum ding a ama zui nungah siengthoute khu, na kunga pui ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungnuom leh kipahtah in apui ding ua; leengpa innsungah alut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na pu na pate mun na tapaten aluota ding ua, nangman amaute leitung zousie ah, leeng tapate in na bawlta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na min pen akhang akhanga theizing dingin, ka bawl dinga tuachi’n michin in kumtawn in, nang ahing pahtawi zingta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian iki humbitna leh i hatna, mangbat lai a hing panpi paipai, nai ngitnget ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaziehin leitung pumpi hing kiheng lamdangin, taangte tuipi sunga tumsuh dingin, kiling nanleh izau sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atuite mau vengvung in phul noi noi nanleh, tuipi kilohten taangte ki lingsah nanleh, izau sih ding uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lui khat a um a tuami luikaten tungnung pen, tenna mun siengthou Pasian khopi akipahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuami khopi lai ah Pasian a um a, akiling sih ding hi. Pasian in zingmawng phalvah in ama apanpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Namte lungthah in akitom ua, leenggamte akiling uhi, Aman a aw asuo a leitung azunmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa eite toh a umkhawm a, Jakob Pasian khu eite kibutna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hing pei unlen, Mangpa nasepte hing en un, Aman leitung asuhsiet dante en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman leitung pumpi a kidounate atawpsah a, thalpite akuoitan a, teipite ahiehtawnga sakollengte mei in ahaltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Dai dide unlen Pasian ka hi chi thei un, namte lah ah pahtawi in ka um dinga,” Leitungah pahtawi in ka um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa eite lah ah a um a, Jakob Pasian khu eite kibutna ahi. Selah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou michinte aw, na khut uh beng unlen, guolzawna aw toh Pasian kungah kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen tungnung pen Mangpa khu azauhuoi a, leitung pumpi ah leeng thupitah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman nam zousie inuoi uah akoi dinga, nam zousie ikeng nuoi uah akoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman, igouluo ding a hing tel pieh a, a it Jakob thupina ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian khu lungnopna kikou aw toh apeitou a, Mangpa pengkul ging toh apeitou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian phat in la sa unlen phatna la sa un; I leengpa phat in la sa unlen phatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian khu leitung pumpi leengpa ahi; theisiemna toh phatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasian khu nam zousiete tunga leengpa ahi a, Pasian khu Amangtoupha siengthou, tungah atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Michin lah a leeng tapate Abraham Pasian mite khu, akikhawm khawm uhi; Aziehpen leitunga galdouna lum leh phawte, Pasian a ahi Ama khu thupitah a, pahtawi in a um hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa khu athupi a, i Pasian khopi a, amuol siengthou ah thupitah a phat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua khopi sanna akilawm mama a, leitung pumpi kipahna Zion muol ahi; Mallam a um Zion muol khu leeng thupitah khopi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua leeng innpi huongsungte ah, Pasian khu kihumbitna ahi chi’n akithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen En in leengte akikhawm ua, ahing pei khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khopi amu ua lamdang asa ua, chiza sengin ataimangpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuanah zauna in amauh aman a, numei nauvei bangin, natna in amauh amanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangman suolam hui in, Tarshish tembaw liente na susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kouten ka zahtah mabangun, galkapte Mangpa khopi ah ka muta uhi; i Pasian in tua khopi khu kumtawn a dingin, asukip ding hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Pasian na biehinn sunggil ah, na itna tulngailou khu ka ngaisut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pasian na min dungzui in, nangma phatna kawlmong tandong ah a um a, Na khut zietlam dihtatna in adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na vaihawmnate ziehin Zion muol khu, nuom in kipah henlen Juda tanute kipah uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zion khopi sungah vah kawi unlen, akimvel ah pei kawi unlen; agal venna innsangte sim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Akulpi bangte chiemte hoi unlen, aleeng inpi huongsungte lungin geel un, khang sawn sawnte kunga na hil theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami Pasian khu kumtawn kumtawn a, i Pasian uh ahi a, Aman shitan dong in ahing pui ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou mi zousiete aw, tami za unlen, Nou leitunga tengte zousie aw, na bil uh daw chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi neu leh mi lien azawng leh, ahauten kibangin ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kam in pilna thu agen dinga, Ka lungtang ngaituonate khu, theisiemna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paunah ah ka bil kadaw dinga, tumgingin ka thu hasate ka genchien ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni hoilou ahing tun chienga, kei hing sugentheite thulimlouna in, ahing im kimkot chieng in, bang dinga zau ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahausatna uh muongte ahi ua, Ahausatna kisahtheipite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adihtah in mihing koima’n, a unau atandoh thei sih dinga, tatna zong Pasian kungah ape thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen hinna tatna man atam sengsenga, pieh sengguol ahi ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumtawn a ahinden ding leh, muotna amulouna dingin, tatdohna man kiching umlou ding a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipilte ashi ua mimaw leh mimawlte zong, ashi tuoh tuoh ua, ahaunate uh midangte kungah a nuasie zel uhi, chi ama’n amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A innte uh kumtawna umden ding leh, atenna munte uh khang sawnsawn dong a, umden dingin alungsim un angaituo ua, agamte uh amauh min avaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahivang in mihingte khu pahtawi in, a um ngitnget sih a, amangthai thei gamsate bang ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam khu mi kimotmuonte tan ahi a, hinanleh anua chiengun miten, athu gen uh hoi asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Belamte banga hankhuh tung dinga guotsa ahi ua, shina khu belam chin bang a amauh chingtu ahi a; tangtah in hankhuh azuonsuh ding ua, alim amelte uh a muotmangta dinga; hankhuh khu a inn uh ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in hankhuh thahatna a kipat in, ka hinna atandoh dinga, aziehpen aman ahing na pom ding hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi ahing hausat chienga, a innsung thupina ahing khan chiengin, zau sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen ashi chiengun, bangma akeng sih ding ua, athupina in amauh zuisuh theilou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adamsung un nuomsa nan uleh, nangma a dinga silhoi na bawl chiengin, miten hing phat nan uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Apu apate uh kungma a pei ding ahi ua, tuaten khovah amu ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihing pahtawi a um a theisiemna neilou mi pen, amangthai thei gamsa bang bep ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangkimbawlthei Mangpa Pasian in thu agenta a, ni suona lam a kipat ni tumna lam tan in leitung ahanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kilawmna bukim Zion a kipat in, Pasian ataang kheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Pasian uh ahing pei dinga, asip khinkhian sih ding hi; amasangah haltumna mei a kuonga, akimkot ah huipi hattah alaang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amipite tunga thukhen theina dingin tunglam akipat, van leh lei ahan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka misiengthoute ka kungah hing puikhawm unlen, kithoina a keima toh thuhun bawlte.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanten adihtatna phuongzah uhen, aziehpen Pasian ama ngel khu vaihawmpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka mite aw ngai un, thu gen ding ka hi. Aw Israel ngaikhie un, ka hing hilchien ding hi; Kei Pasian, na Pasian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kithoinate uleh na halmang sillatte uh ka masanga, a um ngitnget zieh in ka hing house sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na inn ua kipat bawngtal ka pom sih dinga, na ganta huong akipat keltalte ka pom tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen gamlah a gamsate zousie kei a ahi a, muol tulkhat tunga um ganta zousie zong kei a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vanlaizawl a vate zousie ka thei suoh a, gamlah a vah gamsate zousie kei a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka gil akiel a ahileh, nang kang hil sih ding hi, aziehpen leitung leh asung a um zousie kei a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawngtalte sa ka ne in, ahisihleh kelte sisan ka dawn ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasian kungah kipahthu genna sillatte laan unlen; Tungnung sangpen kungah na thuchiem uh tangtungsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh na mangbat ni chieng un hing han un, keiman ka hing hunkhe dinga, tuachi’n na hing pahtawi ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in migiloute kungah; “Ka danthupiehte gen dinga bang thuneina nei na hiei mah? Ahisihleh ka thuhun na kam a gen ding a, bang thuneina nei na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thununna na huo a ka thute na nualang sena’n na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Guta na mu leh phaze sa in na zui a, angkawm mite toh na kigop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na kam zong thuse genna ngen in na zanga, na lei zong zuouthu bawlna in na zang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toukawm in na sanggamte na gensie a, Na nu tapate nangawn hehsie in na pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam silte na bawlta a, kei pen ka sip ding deng hi. Nangma bang giap dingin na hing ngaituo a, hinanleh ka hing phawhhil ding a, na maitangah akizom zelin ka sulang sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tami kimelchi un nou Pasian manghilte aw, ahisihleh ka hing bottel dinga koiman ahing hunkhe thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Koipou kipah thugenna kithoina laan miin, Kei ahing pahtawi a tualeh ahinna lampi dihtah a, peipi pouma kungah Pasian hundamna ka ensah ding hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian na itna tulngailou dungzui in, ka tungah zangai inlen, na khotuona kiningching dungzui in, ka tawnkhelnate hing phietmang pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thulimlouna apat in hing sawpsieng kilkel inlen, ka khelna apat hing siengsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen ka tatkhielnate ka thei ngitnget a, ka khelnate ka masangah a um den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang tungah Nangma tung bou ah kana khielta hi; Na mitmu ah tam silgilou kana bawlta hi; Thu nagen a siem na tangsah thei a, na vaihawmnate zong gensiet bei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngaivawi, thulimlouna a suhtuo in ka um a, ka nu’n ahing pai lai a khielsa kana hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngaivawi, Nang sunggil lam a thutahna na dei a; tualeh ka sung gil lam ah pilna theithei na hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hissop in hing silsieng in, tuachi’n ka siengthou ding hi; hing silsieng inlen, tuachi’n vua sangin ka vam zawding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nuomna leh kipahna hing zasah inlen, na suhtansa gu leh taangte nuom a akipah theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka khelnate apat na mai phuol inlen, ka gitlouna zousie hing phietmang pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pasian keima ah lungtang siengthou siem inlen, ka sungah lungsim dihtah siemtha kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na umna apat hing paimang sinlen, Keima akipat Na Hagau Siengthou lakhe sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hundamna kipahna hing pe kia inlen, Hagau thanopna toh hing tudet zing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n takhielte kungah na lampite ka hil dinga; mikhielte nang lam ah ahing kihei kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Pasian, nang ka hundamna Pasian aw, sisan suote lah apat in hing hunkhie inlen, tuachi’n ka lei in na hundamna, la in kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka kamte hing honpieh inlen, tuachi’n ka kam in na phatna atheisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen kithoina sillalte ah na kipah sih a, tuachilou hileh ka hing peta ding hi, halmang sillat tungah kipahna mawngmawng na nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian deilam kithoina sillat pen, Hagau kisia a hasie lungtang keh gawp khu ahi. Aw Pasian hagau hasie leh, lungtang kisiate na simmaw ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na lungdamna bangin Zion tungah silhoi bawl inlen; Jerusalem kulbang te lem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n dihtatna kithoina sillatte tungah na kipahta ding a, tualeh halmang Kithoina leh haltum pumpiehna sillatte ah zong, na kipahta dinga, tuachi’n na maitam ah bawngtalte kalanta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihat Aw, bang dinga silgilou bawl suong na hiei? Pasian hoina khu a um ngitnget ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mulmetna temhiemtah bangin na leiin, zuou thu gen in silgilou angaituo leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hoina sangin gitlouna na dei zaw a, thudih gen sangin zuou thu na gen ut zaw hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang lei misol hat aw, mi valtum thei thute ngentang na dei lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian in tuachibangmain kumtawn a dingin, Nang ahing suse dinga ahing lamang dinga, na umna apat in ahing luoikhe dinga, mihing gam akipat in ahing botdoh ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midihtatten amu ding ua, a zau ding ua anuisan ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“En un, Pasian a hatna a nei lou a, a hausatna thupitah muong a agitlouna a ama leh ama, kisuhat zopa khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Kei pen Pasian inn a, Olive singkung kiduo ngihngeh bang ka hi a, Pasian khotuona kumtawn kumtawn in ka muong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tambang silte na bawl ziehin, kumtawn in ka hing phat ding hi. Na mi siengthoute umna mun ah, na min ka phuongzah ding hi; aziehpen tami ahoi ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mimo in alungtangin “Pasian a umsih” achi hi. Amaute asegawpsa ahi ua, sil hoilou kidahhuoitah abawl ua; koima silhoi bawl mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Theisiem a Pasian sui mi a um uoi mah chi mu tum in, Pasian in van akipat mihing tate ahing ensuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Michin alelam anga chiet ua, a bawn un asegawp siengta uhi; koima silhoi bawl mawngmawng a um sih uh; khat zong a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sil hoilou bawl miten, theina mawngmawng neilou ahi uoi mah? Tanghou aneh bangun ka mite anezouta uh. Pasian min lah alou ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zauna umlouna mun ah, nasatah in azau ua. Aziehpen Pasian in nangma hing dou ding a, hing imsuohte gu leh taangte a thethang ta hi. Pasian in amauh anuoltah ziehin, nangma’n amauh na zumsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Oh, Zion a kipat in Israelte hundamna, hing tung mai leh izaw! Pasian in amite vangphatna apieh kia hun chiengin, Jakob anuomta dinga Israel akipah ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian na min in hing hundam inlen, na hatnain vai hing hawmpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Pasian ka thumna ngaikhie inlen, ka kam a ka thugente ah na bil hingdaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen gamdang miten kei ahing dou ua, mi gumtatten ka hinna suhmang tum in asui ua; Pasian amasuon sih uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai vawi, Pasian khu keima hing panpipa ahi a; Mangpa khu ka hinna tudette toh a umkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman ka melmate gitlouna athuh dinga, Na thutah zieh in amauh sumang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima kiphalna toh na kungah, kithoina sillat ka lan ding hi; Aw Mangpa na min ka phat ding hi, tambanga bawl ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama’n ka mangbatna zousie lah a kipat in, ahing hunkheta a ka melmate tunga, ka dei pen ka mitin ahing musahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian ka thungetna ah nabil hing daw inlen, ka ngetna apat hing kiphuolsan sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hing ngaipieh inlen hing dawngin, ka buoina in ahing tawlnga sah thei sih a, thum in ka maumau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka melma husa leh migiloute hing nuoisiena zieh in. Amau’n ka tungah lunggimna ahing tun ua, tualeh lungthah in ahing huo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sungah ka lungtang ana sengseng a, ka tungah shina zauna in ahing netkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tungah zauna leh chitutna ahing tunga, zauna chizathuoiin ahing pumtuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh keiman “Vakhu bang a hanei hi mai leng aw! Ka lengmang dinga ka khawldamta ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adihtah in, gamlapi ah ka leengmang dinga, gamdai ah ka gieh ding hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huipi leh guopi apat kintahin kakihemkhe ding a ka suohta ding,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ahamte uh subuoi inlen khenthangin, khopi sungah thagumsuona leh kihauna ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sun leh zan in khopi kulbang tungah avah kawi kawi ua; thulimlouna leh buoina lah ah ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualaitah ah sietna a um a; kinuoisiena leh lepchiena in kholai anuasie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei hing gensete ka melmate ahi sih ua, hilehvang thuohzou ding hi ing a, ka tunga kiliensah lah ahing mudate ahi sih ua; hileh vang ka kibuhmangsanta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh, nangpen ka kibahpi ka kigoppi, ka kitheipi, ka lawm na hibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kam humtah in i kihoukhawm zel a, Pasian biehinn a mipite lah ah, kigop in ivah khawm kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Shina atung uah thakhat in tung henlen, ahing in hankhuh ah peisuh uheh; aziehpen atenna mun lah uah, gitlouna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ken vang Pasian ka han ding a, Mangpa’n ahing hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nitah leh zingmawng leh sunlai in thu ka ngen dinga, tualeh ngaitah in ka kikou dinga Aman ka aw aza ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tunga kidouna apat in, Aman ka hinna hamuongtahin ahunkheta hi; Kei hing doute lah tampi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tanglai apat ana um ngitnget Pasian in aza ding a amauh asungenthei ding hi. Selah amauten kihen lamdanna anei lou zieh un, Pasian zong a giing sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amatoh lungmuongtah a kigopte tungah, akhut aha a athuhun abot seta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kam a thupawtte bawngnawidat sangin, aneem zaw a hinanleh alungtang sungah, kidouna a um hi. Athugente sathau sangin azol zaw a, hinanleh namsau dohte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na puoh gih Mangpa tungah nga in, Aman na hinna akem ding hi; Aman midihtat apua ding aphal ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Pasian nangman amauh khu, manthaina kokhuh ah na puisuh ding a, sisan suohatte leh lepchiete khu, adamsung kimkhat u’zong adamzou sih ding uhi. Hinanleh ken vang nangma ka hing muong ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian, hing khotuoin miten hing nomval atum uhi, ni chin in ahingdou ua ahing bawlgenthei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sun ni tum in ka galten ahing tuonchil ua, Aw Tungnung pen, kei hing doute atam seng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka zau hun chiengin nangma ka hing muong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thu ka phat Pasian ka muong a, ka zau sih ding hi. Mihing in bang ang law thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni chin in ka thute alakawi ua, angaituona zousie uh ka sietna ding ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kikhawm ua akiphuolmang ua, ka kalsuon a chiemte ua ka hinna abuhdap uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thulimlouna gawtna apumpel thei ding uh amah? Aw Pasian Na thangpaina ziehin mite paimang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma’n ka vahvainate na melchi zel a, ka hituite na savun thawl ah thun in, Na laibu a na chiemtesa ngen hinalou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma han a ka kikou ni chiengin, ka galte anuatai kia ding uhi tami ka thei hi, tuakhu Pasian kei lamah apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian thu ka pahtawi dinga, Mangpa thu ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa ka muonga ka zau sih hi; Mihing bep in kei bang ahing law thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Pasian na kunga ka kichiemnate ka tangtung sah dinga, Na kungah kipahna sillat in ka hing thuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen shina akipat in ka hinna na hunkheta a, kipalpuana apat ka kengte na hunkhezel sih amah! Tuachi’n Pasian masanga hinna khovah ah, ka kalsuon theita ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hing khotuo in Aw Pasian hing khotuoin, kahinna in nangma ahing muong hi; vangsietnate abei sieng masang sie in, Na halim nuoi ka hing bel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei dinga bangkim hing bawlpiehpa, Tungnung pen Pasian han in ka kikou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman van a kipat in panpi ding ahing sawl dinga, ahing nawmval tumpa simmawna apat in, ahing hundam ding hi. Selah. Pasian in a khotuona leh athutahna ahing sawlkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hinna humpibahneite lah ah a um a, gamsa gongsan bang mite lah ah alum hi; a hate uh teipi leh thaltang hiem ahi a, aleite uh namsau hiemtah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pasian nang pen vante tunglam peh ah, tawisangin um inlen; Na thupina khu leitung pumpi ah umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaun ka kengte awhna dingin lenthangte akam ua; ka hinna akun khiu kheu hi; Amaun ka lampi ah hum atou ua, amaute mama tuami sungah akie uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lungtang akip hi Aw Pasian ka lungtang akip hi. La kasa dinga phatna ginglawm ka gingsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thou in ka thupina thou in peging leh tumging, kei zingmawng phalvah in ka thou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Mangpa mite lah ah nangma ka hing phat ding a; namte lah ah nangma phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen na khotuona khu vantung bangin asanga; Na thutahna in meilumte asuntou tabou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Pasian nang pen vante tunglam peh ah, tawisangin um inlen Na thupina khu, leitung pumpi tungah ah umta hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw! nou mipi dai dide te, dihtatna thu nagen na uh amah? Nou mihing tate aw, thudihtah in vai nahawm na uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hilou, na lungtang uah, gitlouna na bawl leng ua; leitunga na khut un gumtatna na uh na te zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migiloute pen anu gilsung akipat, nangawn a Pasian apat khentuom in a um ua, apienkhieh ua kipata zuou gen a lampiel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Agu uh gulgu bang ahi a, thangtom bilbing khozalou bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabangmiten gul ai tawite aw angaikhe sih ding ua, Bangchikhop a siem in him nan uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Pasian akam sung ua a hate uh, suhtawng pieh inlen, Mangpa aw humpibahnei lunlaite hapite, suhtawng pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute khawllou a luongmang, tuibangin luongmang uhenlen, loupa bangin amaute kituonchil henlen, vuoigawp uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tohtawl banga apei lai un, zunmang uhenlen a hunlou a pieng bangin, ni mu ngailouin shigam uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na belte un lingsing kuong sat dan, atheimasangun, Aman pingpei in amauh alamang ding a, ahing nalai leh akuong nalaite zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midihtatten phuba lahna amu chieng un, akipah ding ua migloute sisan in, akengte uh asil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten “Midihtatte ading in, kipahman a um ding mawng ahi; Leitunga thukhenpa Pasian hitah tah na e;” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian ka galte lah a kipat hing hundoh inlen, kei hing dou dinga kisate apat hing humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gitlouna nasemte lah akipat in hing hundoh inlen, sisan suohatte apat in hing hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Envawi tunasan in zong ka hinna abuhdap ngitnget uhi; Aw Mangpa, ka tatkhelna zieh hilou a, ka khelna zieh zong hilou in. Mi hatte ahing dou dingin akikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka dihlouna umloupi in atai ua, kei hing dou dingin akisa uhi. Hing panpi dingin hing thou inlen, en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang galkapte Mangpa Pasian, Israelte Pasian aw; Nam zousie gawt dingin hing kisa inlen; Migilou takhielte tungah zangai sin. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nitahlam chiengin ahing kinuale ua, ui bang in ahing ngih ua, khopi kimvel ah avah kawi khienkhuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Envawi, akam uah asa-ih khie ua, a kam uah namsau banga hiem thute agen ua; “Koiman eite thugen za sih va,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa nang amauh na nuisan ding a; namte zousie na simmaw in na nuisan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hatna ziehin Nangma ka hing ngah ngitnget ding hi, aziehpen Pasian ka kihumbitna kulpi nahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei hing khotuona adim ka Pasian in ahing kimupi dinga, ka melma tunga ka dei ka Pasian in ahing musah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amauh that sin, tuachilouin ka miten amanghil kha ding uhi; na silbawltheina in amauh thezah inlen, sungiemin Aw Mangpa ka phaw uh na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Akam ua akhelna zieh u’leh, amuh ua a thugente uh ziehin tualeh, ahamselawna u’leh a zuouthu gente zieh un, akisahtheina ngei uah awh uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasian in Jakob tunga vaihawm ahi chi, lei mong donga akitheina dingin tualeh, amaute um nawnlouna dingin lungthah inlen, amauh ka tumsah in Ahi, ka tumsah in. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitahlam chiengin ahing kinuale ua, ui bangin ahing ngih ua; khopi kimvel ah avah kawi khienkhuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaute ann neh ding suiin, suh dien tou dien uhenlen; agilva zoulou chieng un, ham nguou nguou uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh ken vang na silbawltheina la in kasa ding a, zingmawng chieng in na khotuona phat in, nuomtahin la ka sa ding hi. Aziehpen Nangma ka mangbat ni chienga, ka kibutna kulpi na hia ka kihumbitna zong na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw ka hatna nangma phat in la kasa ding hi. Aziehpen nangma ka kulpi na hi a, khotuona hing musahpa Pasian na hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian Nang koute na hing paikheta a, nangman ka bitna uh kulpi na suseta a, na lungkimta sih hi. Tuin kou lam ah hing ki nuale kia mai inlen, hing siemtha kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang leitung na kiling sah a na susegawpta hi. Tuin apohkehnate siemtha kia inlen, akiling nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mite sil hasa tatah na thuohsah a; buoigawpna uoin na hing dawnsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma hing giingte kungah puonlap na peta a, thutah zieh a zahpal ahi theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangman na it mite hutkhiet a, a um theina dingun, na khut ziet lamin hundam inlen, ka ngetna hing dawngin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian in asianthouna toh thu agenta a, “Ka nuom ding a Shekem ka khenzah dinga, Sukkoth phaijang ka hawmzah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead kei a ahi a, Manasseh gam zong kei a ahi; Ephraim ka sia lukhu ahi a, Juda khu ka danpetu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab ka kisilna kuong ahi a, Edom tungah ka kedap ka pai dinga, Philistin aw Keima zieh a guolzou in kikou in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khopi kulpi nei sungah kei koi in, hing puilut ding adiei? Edom ah koiin ahiei ahing pui tung ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pasian koute hing paikhepa? Nangma hilou na hiei mah, Aw Pasian Nang hilou na hiei mah, ka galkapte utoh gal kuonkhawm ut nawnlou?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Melmate douna dingin panpina hing pie in; aziehpen mihing panpina khu, bangmalou ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasian zal in hangsan tahin ka dou ding uhi; aziehpen Ama ahi i melmate uh tuonchil ding pa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian ka kikouna ngaikhie inlen, ka thungetna hing ngaikhieh pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungtang a bagawp chiengin, kawlmong akipat in ka hing han ding hi; kei sanga sangzaw suongpi ah hing pui in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Nangma ka kibutna na hi a, ka galte apat a ka kihumbitna galvenna, innsang kiptah na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na bieh buh ah kumtawn in ka um dinga, na ha lim nuoi kibutna ka bel ding hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian aw nang ka thuchiemte na zata a; na min zaudan siemte gouluo khu na hing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangman leengpa damsung nite na suh sau pieh dinga, adamsung kumte zong khang tampi bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama khu Pasian masangah, kumtawn in aum ngitnget ding a, ama humbit dingin khotuona leh thutahna siempieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka thuchiemte ni sim a, ka suhtangtung theina dingin na min phat in, kumtawn in la kasa den ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adihtahin Ka hinna hamlou a sip dide in, Pasian angah zing a Ama a kipat, ka hundamna ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama bou khu ka suongpi, ka hundamna leh ka kulpi ahi a, linthaw guol ka hi ngaisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khat dou dinga bangtan vei ahiei, silhoilou na ngaituo ding uh? Na bawn un thain na um ding ua, bang awn diaiduai leh dai pua dihdih, bang na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Athupina akipat a sawnkhe dingin akikum ua, zuouthu gen nuom asa ua, akam un aguolzawl uh a, hinanleh asunggil lam uah ahamsiet uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hinna in sip dide in Mangpa bou angah hi; ka kinepna khu ama ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama bou ahi ka suongpi leh ka hundamna, Ama ka kihumbitna ahi a ka kiling sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hundamna leh ka thupina khu Pasian, ka hatna suongpi ahi a, ka kihumbitna Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nou mipite aw bangchih laipouin ama muong unlen; Amasangah na lungtang uh sungbuo un; Pasian khu eite kihumbitna ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adihtahin mi ngiemte khu bangmalou ahi ua, mi nam sangte lah zuou leltah ahibou uhi. Buhnain kibuh khawmtaleh ani ua kigawmin, tuihu sangin azang zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pauhat thu a mi neisa lahpieh muong sinlen, kisuomna vante ah zong kinem sin, Hausatna ahing pun leh, atungah na lungtang uh nga sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian in khat vei thu agenta a, tami nivei ka zata hi; silbawltheina pen Pasian a ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Mangpa khotuona khu nanga ahibou hi. Aziehpen michin anasep dungzui un na thuh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian nangma ka Pasian na hi, zingmawng matahin Nangma ka hing sui ding hi, ka hinna nangma ngai in adangta hi, gamgaw tui umlouna leh gimna gam ah ka tahsain Nangma ahing ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n na silbawltheina leh, na thupina mu dingin munsiengthou ah, nangma ka hing sui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na itna tulngailou khu hinna sanga hoizawh, ahiziehin ka kam in Nangma ka hing phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka damsung tengin nangma ka hing phat dinga, na min in ka khutte ka zahtou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hinna khu chintuigu leh, thauna a tai bangin atai dinga; Ka kam in kipahna muh toh, nangma ahing phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lupna tunga nangma, ka hing geldoh hun chiengin, zan ven sung tenga na tungthu, ka ngaituo hun chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma a hing panpipa na hizieh in, na halim nuoi ah nuom in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hinna in nangma ahing zui chinten a, na zietlam khut in ahing tudet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hinna suhmang tum a suite pen, lei nuoi mun thuhpi ah apeisuh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute namsau in apua ding ua, si alte tanvou ahita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa pen Pasian ah anuom ding hi; Ama min lou a kichiem pouma in amin aphat ding ua, hinanleh zuouthu gente kam pen akihumpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian, ka mangbatna thu ka gen lai in, ka aw na za inlen, Ka galte ka zauna apat in, ka hinna humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migiloute kihouguhna apat leh, silgilou bawlte buoina bawlna apat in hing phuol in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaun alei uh namsau bangin ataat hiem ua, thusie thaltang banga kap dingin athalpite uh aluoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ami dapbuh na ua kipat in, genbanglou mite kap dingin akisa ua, thakhat in akap ua azau sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Silgilou bawl dingin akihantawh ua, aguh a thang kamdap dingin akithukup ua, “Koiman tuate mu sihva” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thulimlou na a suidoh zel ua, kukal tahin isui zouta achi ua, asunglam ngaituona uleh, alungtang ulah a thuhtah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in amauh athaltangin akap dinga, thakhat in aliem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman amauh lei ngeiin akipalpuasah dinga, amauh mu zousie’n chiza sengin alu uh athing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n michin in azau chiet ding ua, amaun Pasian nasepte agen ding uhi, tualeh a silbawlte piltahin angaituo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midihtatte Mangpa ah akipah ding ua, Ama amuong ding uhi, Lungtang dihtah po zousie tungah thupina tungta hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian phatnain Zion ah nang ahing ngah hi. Na kungah thuchiemte tangtun sah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw nang thungetna sangpa na hi a, nangma kungah tahsa mi zousie ahing pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thulimlounate’n koute ahing pumtuom lai in, nangman ka tawnkhielnate uh nang na silsieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na biehinn huongsunga aum theina ding a, na tel leh na kung na naisahte mi hampha ahi uhi. Na inn leh na bieh inn siengthou, hoina toh tai ding ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hundampa uh Pasian aw, na sil chizat huoi bawltein na hing dawng dinga a. Nang kawlmong tan a um mi zousie leh, tuipi tunga gamlapi a um zousie muon leh kinepna na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thahatna in muol leh taangte na phutdet a, thupina in na kigah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang tuipi kihot ging honhonte, tuihuol ging zuazuate leh. Mipi buoi husa ging vengvungte daisahpa na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kawlmong gamlapi a umte’n zong, na chiemtenate azau ua zingmawng leh, nitahlam pawtdohnate nuomin na kikou sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang leitung na ve a tui in na tapnou a, nasatah in na hausa sah hi; Pasian luidungte tui a dim a; leitung tuabanga na bawlzou in, mihingte a dingin bulebal na siem pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Loukaina leitangte tui kiningching tahin na buoh a, leikhalte na zel jang pieh a, guotui in lei na nip sah a, haichi hing poudohte na guolzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumte na hoinain na khusah a, na lampite ah nieng leh taina na takhe sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamdai gantatna munte ah atakhie a, muolneute zong nuom in akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gantatna loupa munte ganhon in atuom a, Phaizangte zong haichi in adim a. Nuomin akikou ua la zong asa uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitung gam zousiete aw Pasian kungah, nuomin kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amin thupidan lain sa unlen, a phatna thupisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasian kungah, “Na nasepte chizat huoi hina va-ia e, Na silbawltheina thupina ziehin, Na melmate na kungah akipelut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung pumpi in nangma ahing be ding ua, Na min phat in la asa ding uhi” chi un. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hing pei unlen Pasian nasepte hing en un, mihingtate lah a asilbawlte chizat huoitah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman tuipi gamgaw asuohsah a, amaun kengin tuipi apal galkai uhi. Khunah eite Ama ah inuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman a silbawltheina in kumtawn in vai ahawm a, amitte gel in namte a en ngitnget hi; mihelhatte amauleh amauh kipahtawi sih uheh. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Michinte aw i Pasian pahtawi unlen, Ama phatna aw ging kiza sah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’n ihinna uh ahing asuhing pieh ngitnget a, i kengte uh kitawl aphal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Aw Pasian nang koute na hing enchien a, dangka sia etchien bangin na hing en chien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangman len thang sungah na hing puiluta; Ka el uah hasatna vangih na hing posah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka lutung uah mite na tuong sah a, meikuong leh tuite kantan in ka pei ua; hinanleh zong mun hausatah ah na hing puilutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Halmang sillatte toh na biehinn ah ka hing lut ding a; ka thuchiemte na kungah ka tangtun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi, lungkham mangbang a ka umlai a, ka kam in aphuondohte leh ka kam in, agendohte khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kungah ganthautah halmang kithoinate ka lan dinga, belamtal kithoina meikhu gimnamtui toh ka lan dinga; bawngtalte leh kelte zong ka lan ding hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nou Pasian zaudan siemte zousie hing pei unlen, hing ngaikhie un, ka hinna dinga asilbawlte ka hing theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Akungah ah ka kam in ka kikou a, Ka lei a pahtawi in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungtanga gitlouna ka ngaituo leh, Mangpa’n ahing ngaikhe sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in ahing ngaikhe tahtah a, ka thungetna aw gingte angaikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasian phat in um hen, Aziehpen aman ka thumna aniel sih a; a khotuona zong ahing it sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian in eite hing khotuo henlen, hing guolzawl henlen, eite tungah amai tangsah hen. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lampi khu leitunga mithei ahitheina dingin leh, nam zousiete lah ah na hundamna akitheina ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Pasian, miten nangma hing phat uhenlen, namte zousie in nangma hing phat uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw namte kipah uhenlen nuom in la sa uhen, aziehpen dihtattah in namte vai na hawmpieh dinga, leitung nam zousie tungah thu na nei ding hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pasian miten nangma hing phat uhenlen, mi zousie in nangma hing phat uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n leitungin ga tampi asuong dinga, Pasian i Pasian ngei un ahing guolzawl ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasian in ahing guolzawl ding a, Tualeh kawlmong tana mi zousiein Ama agiing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian thou henlen, amelmate thethang henlen ama mudate, zong amasangah taizah uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meikhu semmanga a um bangin amauh semmang in, khuoilu meisa a azunmang bangin, migiloute Pasian masangah mangthai uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh midihtatte vang kipahtahin um uhenlen, Pasian masangah nuom uhen Ahi kipahtah in nuom uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian pahtawi in la sa unlen, amin phat in la sa un; meilum tunga tuongpa a dingin la ngaitah sa un. Amin MANGPA ahi amasangah pahtawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian a umna Siengthou a um khu; Pa neiloute Pa leh meithaite kembitpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian in mitangkhatte innkuon ding abawlpieh a; Aman hentate zong lawchinna mun ah apuidoh zel a, helhatte pen gamgaw ah ateng sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Pasian na mite pui a amasang ua, na hing pawtdoh lai in, gamdai gamgaw a na peisuohpi lai in. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitung akilinga vanten zong, Pasian mai ah guo azu sah ua, Sinai muol nangawn zong, Pasian masangah Israelte Pasian, masangah akiling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Pasian nangman guo tampi na zu sah a, tuakhuin nagoutan basama athatawl lai un na sudet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nami pui mipite tua mun ah ateng ua, Aw Pasian Nangman na hoina in, gentheite a dingin na bawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n thu apie a, tuami thuphuongzahte khu pawl thupitah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Galkapte leengte ataizah ua atai mang ua,” inn ngah a um numeiten galvanlahte akihawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Belam kul sungah lum nan u’leh zong, vakhu ha dangka tui a luonkhum a ahamulte zong, sana eng tui a luonkhum bang na hing hiding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkimbawlthei pa’n tua mun a leengte athethang lai in, Zalmon taang a vua kia bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasian taang khu Bashan muol ahi a, Bashan taang khu muolsang tampite umna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nou muolsang tampite aw bangdinga Pasian in, atenna dinga alunggul muol khu thangsiet na hi uoi, Tami taang khu Pasian in atenna ding a adei taang khu ahi. Khunah Mangpa kumtawnin ateng den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian sakollengte tul sawmni, tualeh atul atul atam ahi uhi. Mangpa khu Sinai muola a um bangin, alah uah mun siengthou ah aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang muol tungsang lamah na kaltou a, na galhing matte sal in na zawpi a, mihingte dingin silpiehte na mu a; mi helhatte lah nangawn ah zong, tuachia Mangpa alah ua aten theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa nichin a sil phatuom hing guonpa i hundamna Pasian ngel khu phat in umta hen. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eite Pasian khu hundamna Pasian ahi a, tualeh Mangpa Pasian kungah, shina akipata suotatna thute a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in amelmate lutang leh, atatkhelna lampi ua pei nalaite, samphatna luvunte asuliem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa’n, “Bashan a kipat amaute ka puikia dinga, tuipi thuhpi tah akipat in amauh ka puidoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachia, na kengte uh na melmate sisan a, na die theina ding uleh na uite un zong, na melmate uh sisan alieh theina ding in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Pasian mi honpi kizui a na puidan a muta ua; ka Pasian ka Lengpa, amun Siengthou a apei laite amuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lasa pawlte amasangah apei ua, tumging tumten a zui ua alah uah nungahten, khutbeh gingtheite tawi in apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mipi kikhopnate ah Pasian phat unlen, Israel tuinah akipat in Mangpa phat un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amaute lamkai in nautum Benjamin apanga, Juda phung a miliente, Zebulun miliente leh Naphtali miliente, tampi zong alah uah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasian in na hatna thu apeta hi. Aw Pasian, koute dinga na bawlsate suhat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jerusalem a na biehinn ziehin, leengten na kungah nuomman silpiehte, ahing tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pumpeng lah a gamsate, bawngnoute lah a bawngtal honte, mite bawngnoute leh dangka tang tawi a, ahing kipiehlut masangsie un phawh hil in. Kidou lunggul mite nangman thelthang sahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Izipt apat miliente ahing pawt ding ua, Ethiopia in Pasian langah kintah in, akhut uh azah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nou leitung leenggamte aw, Pasian kungah pahtawina la sa unlen. Oh! Mangpa phat in la sa un. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vante van taanglai vante tunga tuongpa’n, ngai in aw asuo a aw thahattah, ahing sawlkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pasian kungah vangletna pie un, athupina chizat huoi Israelte tungah a um hi. Asilbawltheina vanmeipi tungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aw Pasian nang pen na amunsiengthou sangin, na zauhuoi zaw hi, Israel Pasian in amite kungah, silbawltheina leh hatna apie hi. Pasian phat in um hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian hing hundam in, aziehpen tuiten ka ngawng tan chieng ahing tumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Buonnawi thuhpi sungah ka tum a, pansie ding um vawtlou hi; tui thuhpi sung ah ka kie a, tuilet in ahing vuakhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kikou kounain ka gimgawpta a, ka dang zong a gaw gawpta hi. Ka Pasian ka ngahna lam in, ka mitte a miel gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh bei a hing mudate lah ka luzang a, samzangte sangin atamzaw uhi; dihloutah a hingdou a, suhmang hing tumte atam mama uhi, ka guhloupi zong ahing dinsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pasian Nangman ka motdan na thei hi, ka khelnate na masang ah phuolguh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Mangpa galkapte Pasian nangma hing ngahte, keima zieh in maizum sahin um sih uheh; Aw Israelte Pasian nangma hing suite khu, Keima ziehin zala in um sih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma ziehin gensietna ka thuoh a, zumna in ka mai akhuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka unaute lah ah zong khuolzin mi bang kana hita hi, ka nu tate lah nangawn ah gamdang mi ka suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na inn a dinga ka phattuom ngaina in ahing nebeita a; Nangma hing gensete hing gensietna khu ka tungah, akibungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kap a tualeh ka hinna ann ngawl a, ka ki suhgim chiengin lah gensiet a ka umna giap ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puonsila Sai ip ka zah chiengin, ama ua dingin houlim nopna bep ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kulpi kotkha a toute houlimna leh gensiet ka hi a, zukhamte la kana hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa kei pen hun kipahhuoi ah, Nangma kungah ka hing thum hi. Aw Pasian na khotuona thupitah leh, Na hundamna thutahin hing dawngin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Buonnawi lah a kipat in hing kaidoh inlen, hing tumsah vawt sin, ahing mudate leh tui thuhpi akipat in hing hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tui lien in hing tummang sih henlen, tui thuhpi in zong hing valmang sih heh, kokhuh in zong akam hing chikhum sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing dawngin, Na itna tulngailou ahoi hi, na khotuona kiningchingtah dungzui in, kei langah hing kihei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na suohpa akipat in na mai phuol sin, aziehpen chimaw a mangbang ka hi, hing dawng meng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hinna hing nai inlen hing tandoh in, ka galte zieh in hing hundoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangman mite hing gensietna ka zumnate, mi hing simmawnate na thei hi, ka melmate zousie na masangah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mite hing gensietnate in ka lungtang hasie in akehzah a, tualeh lungkham mangbangin in ka um hi; ahing hepi ding mi ka sui a hinanleh ka mu sih hi; tualeh ahing hamuon ding mi ka sui a, hinanleh koima ka mu zou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ann dingin shitheina gu ahing pie ua, ka dangtah chienga ka dawn dingin, zupawng thuapi ahing pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amasang ua adawkan uh thang hing suoh henlen, anopsahnate uh zong ama ua dingin piel suohta heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Akhomu theilouna dingun amitte uh hing miel henlen, akawngte uh kithingsah ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na thangpaina amaute tungah sungbuo inlen, na lungthahna meikuongin amaute man heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Atenna munte khogemnua suoh henlen, apuon innte uah koima teng sih u heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen nang na vuohpa amauten asuhgenthei ua, nang na liemsah mite lungkhamna khu houlim na’n anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A gitlouna tung uah gitlouna belap inlen, na dihtatna ah lut sih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinna laibu apat thaimangin um uhenlen, midihtatte lah ah gel tel hi sih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh kei pen genthei leh lunggim ka hi a, Aw Pasian na hundamna in kei mun sangah hing koi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pasian min lain ka phat dinga, kipahthu genna toh amin ka pahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tami’n, kii leh chin nei bawngtal leh bawngpa sangin, Mangpa alungdamsah zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mikingaingiemte’n tami amu ding ua akipah ding uhi. Nou Pasian suite aw na lungtang uh ahing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n tasamte aw aza a, ami saltangte asimmaw ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lei leh van in ama phat henlen tuipi leh asunga, ganhing pia thei poumain ama phat hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in Zion ahundam dinga, Juda khopite alamtha kia ding hi; khuna amite aten ua, a nei theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A suohte hahlesuonte’n tua mun aluo ding ua, tualeh Ama min itte asungah ateng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian kei hing hunkhe dingin hing kin mengin, Aw Mangpa ang panpi dingin hing kinawin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna lahmang tum a suite maizum uhenlen, buoizah uheh, ka liem ding lunggulte khu, nuakia sah in um uhenlen, zalatah leh chimaw tah in um uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tuohkha e, tuohkha e,” chite a maizum zieh un kinuale sah kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma hing sui poumate, nangma ah nuomin kipah uhen, Na hundamna it poumaten, “Pasian pahtawi in um hen;” chi ngitnget uhen chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh keipen genthei leh tasam ka hi a, Aw Pasian ka kungah hing pei mengin, Kei hing panpipa leh ka tanpa Nang na hi, Mangpa aw hing kiheh sin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangma ah ginna ka koi hi, maizum in hing um sah ngai vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na dihtatnain hing hunkhie inlen hing suotasah in, kei langah na bil hingdaw inlen hing hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei a dingin kibutna suongpi leh kulpi dettah, hi inlen hing hundam dingin thu pie in; aziehpen nang ka suongpi leh ka kulpi na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian, migiloute khut apat in, midihtatlou leh, mitatsete khut a kipat in hing hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pasian nangma ka kinepna na hi a, ka khangdawn lai a kipat a ka muon na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka pien a kipat in Nangma tudet in ka um a, ka nu gilsung a kipat a hing lakhie nangma na hi. Nang ka hing phat den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tampite’n lamdang ahing sah uh ka hi a, hinanleh nangpen ka kihumbitna dettah na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kam nangma phatnain dim henlen, sun nitum in nangma pahtawina in dim hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tehsiet chiengin hing paikhe sinlen, ka thahatna abei chiengin hing taisan sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen ka melmaten ahing gensie ua, ka hinna lahmang sawma ngahte akikumkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pasian in ama anuasieta, nuadel unlen man un, ama hunkhe ding koima a um sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Pasian hing gamlat sinlen, Aw ka Pasian kei hing panpi dingin kin mengin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hinna hing doute suhmangin um uhenlen, ka liemna ding sui mite khu gensietna leh, zumna in tuomkhumta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh kei vang ka kinem ngitnget dinga, tualeh ka hing phat sem sem nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka kam in na dihtatna nasepte ka gen dinga, sun nitum in na hundamna nasepte ka gen ding hi; atamdan ka pilna in theizou sih nanlehzong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian hatna in ka hing pei ding a, na dihtatna nangma a bou khu ka genzel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Pasian ka naupan lai akipat in, nangman na hing hilta a, tuni tan in na sil lamdang bawlte, ka phuongzah nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka hing tehsiet a, ka sam ahing kaan chiengin zong, Aw Pasian hing taisan sin, Na hatna leh na silbawltheina, khangtha hing um nalai dingte kunga, ka phuonzah masangsie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Pasian na dihtatna zong asang mama a, Nang sil thupitahte bawlpa na hia, Aw Pasian nangma bang koi ahiei um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang lungkham buoina leh vangsietna, tampi hing musahpa’n na hing halthasah kia dinga, leimun thuhpi apat in na hing puidoh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangman ka thupina na khangsah dinga, mun chin ah na hing hamuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian na gin umna zieh in, tumging toh ka hing phat dinga, Aw nang Israel Misiengthoupa; pehging toh nangma phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangma phatna la ka sah chiengin, ka kam nuomsa in akikou ding hi; Na tatsa ka hinna mama zong akipah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka lei in zong sun nitum in, na dihtatna thute agen ding hi, aziehpen kei hing liemsah tumte, zalatsah leh maizum sah in aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian na vaihawmna dihtah khu, leengpa pie inlen, na dihtatna khu leengpa tapa pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman na mipite tungah, dihtatna toh vaiahawm pieh dinga, na migentheite thudih in vaiahawm pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Taangten mipite kungah, hamuonna atungsah dinga, muol neuten dihtatna atungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman mite lah a gentheite vaiahawm pieh ding a, mitasam tate ahunkhe ding hi, tualeh mi nuoisiehatte a gawt guoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaun, ni leh ha um sungsie akhang akhangin, Nang ahing giing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama khu hampa ki metmai tunga guozu bang leh, leitung tapnou guomal phin bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama damsung nite in dihtatna akhanglien dinga, hapi um nawnlou tan dongin lemna leh, muonna akhang lien ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman tuipi akipat tuipi langkhat tan dong tualeh, luipi akipat leimong tawp dong vai ahawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamdai a tengte amasangah akun ding ua, tualeh amelmaten leivui alieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tarshish gam leh tuikuolkhum gam leengten, silpiehte ahing tawi ding ua, Sheba leh Seba leengten silpiehte ahing tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi, leengte zousie amasangah akun ding ua, nam zousie’n ana asem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen mitasamten ahat chiengun aman ahunkhe dinga, mi genthei leh panpi ding neiloute zong ahunkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman mi zawngte leh tasamte akhawi dinga, tasamte hinna a hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Suhgentheina leh hiemngamna a kipat in, amauh hinna ahunkhe dinga, ama mitmu ah asisan uh amanpha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama ahing dinga, akungah, Sheba gama sanate pieh ahi ding hi, Ama a dingin thunget tawp louin akinei pieh zing dinga, Ni chin in ama phat in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leitung ah butang kiningchingtah in a um ding a, taangte tungah bu vuite Lebanon bangin akiil ding ua, tualeh khopi mite khu leitunga hampa bangin, aphung pha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amin kumtawn in a um dinga, ni ataan laisie aminthang tawntungta ding hi. Nam zousiete ama vangin guolzawl in a um ding ua, Nam zousie in ama hampha achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian Israelte Pasian phat in um hen, Ama bou in sil lamdangte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama min thupitah kumtawn a phat in um henlen; leitung pumpi ah athupina dim sah in um hen Amen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesse tapa David thungetna abeita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adihtahin Pasian Israelte tungah ahoi a, lungtang siengthoute tungah ahoi tahtah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh kei pen ka kengte akipalpua dihdih a, ka kalsuonte akitaal dihdih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen migiloute vangphatna ka mu chienga, mi kisatheite eng kha zel ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen tuabang miten ashi chiengun, thuonatna mawngmawng anei sih ua, ahatna uh adet zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midangte bangin lungkhamna atuoh khasih ua, midangte bangin vangsietna zong atuoh khasih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuazieh in kiletsahna in khi bangin a ngawng uh aviel a, hiemngamna in puon bangin atuom khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thauna zieh in amitte uh apawngdoh lelaw a, alungtangin adei sanga tamzaw anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amauten suhgentheina thuohte giloutahin asimmaw ua, ki uongsahtah in aham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kam un vante douna thu agen ua, alei un leitung pumpi atuonsuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin mite tamlang ah anua kia ua, Tui nou a dim khu amauh dawnkangin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh aman Pasian in “Bang achithei diei? Tungnung pen in theina anei amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Envawi, tamte khu Pasian phawhkhalou a, mivangpha leh nuomsate ahi ua, ahausatna uh apung semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adihtahin athawn giap in ka lungtang, ka susienga ka khut gensiet bei in ka silsieng hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen sun nitum in gawt in ka uma, zingmawng chin in thunun in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ken tambangin thu gen vang na chita leng,” Ngaivawi, nahah nasuonte tate tunga thudihlou ka na hita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami theisiem ding dan ka ngaituo chiengin, kei a dingin ana seng taluo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian mun siengthou ka lut a abeina ding uh, ka theidoh masangsie’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adihtah in nang amaute anaalna mun ah na koi a, manthaina ah na kesah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangchidan a mitphiet kallou a ingam sieng atamawh di uoi; gimnei leh chizathuoi tah a suhmangthai in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi akhahlaw chieng a amang uh bangma ahilou bangin, Aw Mangpa na khahlaw chiengin alim ukhu, Bangma nasa sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabanga ka hinna agenthei chiengin, ka lungtang sut bang in ana hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei pen mimawl leh, bangmatheilou gam sa bang giap ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahivang in kei pen na kungah ka um ngitnget a, ka khut zietlam na hing tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangman na lemguotna in na hing pui dinga, tuazou chiengin thupina ah na hing latou ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Van ah nang chilou koi ahiei ka nei? Leitungah zong nang chilou koima ka lunggul sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka tahsa leh ka lungsim gim in aba ta hi, hinanleh Pasian khu kumtawn a ka lungtang hatna leh ka goutan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngaivawi, nangma hing gamlatte amangbei ding ua, nang hing nuasie a hing ang kawmsan poumate, na sumangthang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh kei a dingin vang Pasian nai ahoi hi; Na nasepte zousie ka phuondoh theina dingin, Mangpa Pasian nangma ah ka ginna ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian, bangdinga koute hing paimang den na hiei? Bangdinga na gantatna mun a belamte tunga, na lungthahna meikhu ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nidang lai a na leisa na mikikhawmte, na goutan nam hidinga na tatsate leh, na umna Zion muol thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumtawn sietna lam ah kal hing suon in; melmaten munsiengthou ah silgilou chinteng abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na melmate na mite kikhopna munte lah ah akikou ua, apuonlapte uh chiemtena dingin azah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi gammang sing heipi a satding a ngimte bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang akhuohthaw a kilawmtah a kizem zousiete, heitang leh sehta in asuse sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na munsiengthou mei in ahaltum ua, na min umna mun leilah a paiin asubuata uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amauten alungtang un, “Mangthaisah sieng vai” akichi ua, gamsunga Pasian mina kikhopna inn zousie, ahaltum sieng keei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka chiemtenate uh ka mu nawnsih ua, guolnei mawngmawng lah a um nawn sih a, tambang gentheinate bangtan a sawt ding ahiei chi, athei mawngmawng ka lah uah koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pasian bangtan vei ahiei melmaten ahing gensiet ding uh? Melmaten na min agensiet kumtawn ding uh ata diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangdinga na khut, na zietlam khut nangawn na nua lahkia ahiei? Na awm a pat in zandoh kia inlen amaute sumang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian khu nidanglai peh a kipat a ka leengpa ahi a, leitunga hundamna siempa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangman na hatna in tuipi na kikhen sah a, tui sunga um gulpi lutang na satkeh pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leviathan lutangte na satguoi pieh a, gamdai a mi umte ann dingin na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang tuikhuh leh luipi nahte na khen a, kang ngailou luipiliente na kangtansah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sun nanga ahia zan zong nanga ahi, nang khovah leh ni na siem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangman leitung gamgi zousie na hun pieh a, Nipi leh phalbi zong na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, tami thei ngitnget in, melmaten ang simmaw dan uleh, nam moten na min asuhsiet dan uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Oh! na vakhu hinna gamsahangte kungah pe vawt sinlen, na migentheite hinna zong kumtawn in manghil den sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thuhun zatat inlen, aziehpen leitung khomielna munte ah, bawlsietna umna in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Oh! nuoisiena thuohte khu zala in nuakia sih uhenlen, mizawngte leh tasamten na min phat u’hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Pasian thou inlen na tungtang thu ki gen in; mi moin sun nitum a ahing gensiet dan thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na melmate aw suoh khu manghil sinlen, nang hing doute kikou husa dailou in aging tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian na kungah kipahthu ka hing tut uh a, nuom thu Ka hing gen uhi, na min anai ngal a. Na sil lamdang bawlten na min anai hi chi’n aphuong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hun lemtang ka muchiengin dihtahin vai ka hawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leitung leh asunga umte zousie azunmang siengta, akhuompite phutdetpa keima ka hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ki uongsahte kungah “Kiuongsah sih un” kachi a, migiloute kungah zong “Na kii uh sangsah sih un, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kii uh vanlam ah vihsang sih unlen, tualeh ngawng vaipuohin thu gen sih un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen kaisangna khu suolam ahiei, tumlam ahiei simlam ahiei ahisihleh gamdai ahiei a, hing kipan zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian khu vaihawm thukhenpa ahi, Aman khat angiemsah a adang khat adomsang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa khut ah nou khat a um a, uoin khu asan hi hoitah a kitohhal ahi a, Aman tuakhu asungkhe dinga leitunga migiloute zousie in, a hineng nasan adawn sieng kiukiau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh ken vang kumtawn in, nuomtahin ka phuongzah ding a, Jakob Pasian phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migiloute kii zousie ka sattan dinga, hinanleh midihtatte kii khu tawisang in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judate lah ah Pasian thei ahi a, Israelte lah ah amin athupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Salem ah zong abiehbuh a um a, Tualeh Zion ah a umna mun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khunah Aman thalpi thaltangte asutana a, lum leh namsaute tualeh galvante toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang pen sabehna taangte sangin, na thupi zaw a tualeh na hoi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungtang khaute pen gallah in a um ua, a imu ua a imu denta uhi; tuachi’n a mihatte uh koiman akhut uh, aphongdoh zou nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Jakob Pasian na phawhhilna ziehin sakolleng leh, sakolte ashi banga imutsah in a um tuohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma mama giin ding na hi. Na lungthah chienga na masanga ding ngam ding koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang na vaihawmna thu van a pat in, naza sah a leitung pumpi zau in asip dide ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitunga suhgenthei a umte hundam dinga, Pasian thu khenna bawl dinga ahing kipatdoh lai in. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pellou in mihing lungthahna in nang ahing phat ding a, lungthahna vaal in na kigah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian kung uah thuchiem bawl unlen sutangtung un, akimvel a mi zousie in a zaudingpa Ama kungah silpieh hing tawi uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman leengtapate kideikhopna lungsimte asattan dinga, leitung leengte a dingin ama azauhuoi ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka aw in Pasian ka han a, ka aw in Pasian ngei ka han a; Aman kei lam ah abil ahing daw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lungkham ni chiengin Mangpa ka sui a, zan tungtawn in ka khutte lakhelou in ka zah den a, ka hinna in hamuongtah a um adei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasian ka thei ngitnget a ka buoita a, ka lungkim sih a ka hagau abata hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang ka mitte na hahsah a, ham theilou khop in ka buoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nidanglai hunte ka ngaituo a tanglai kumte khu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zanlai a ka lasahte ka geldoh a, zanlai in ka lungsim toh kaki houlim a, ka hagauin phatuomngaitahin a kansui zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mangpa’n kumtawn in apaikhe den ding adiei? Bangchihtan a deisah kia nawn lou ding ata diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A khotuona khu mangden ding ata diei? Athuchiemkhu kumtawna tangtunglou den ding ata diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasian in ahepisiemna manghil ata diei? Alungthahna in ami khotuona nemnou a khahkhum ahita diei?” Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh ken “Tam pen ka lungkham man hibou; hinanleh Tungnungpen zietlam khut kumte ka thei ngitnget ding hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa nasepte ka thei ngitnget dinga, nidanglai a Na silbawl lamdangte ka geldoh zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nasep zousiete zong ka ngaituo dinga, Na silbawlte houlimnain ka nei ding hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Pasian na lampite khu munsiengthou ah aum hi. Eite Pasian banga thupi koi pasien ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang pen sillamdangte bawlpa Pasian na hi a, michinte lah ah na hatdan na phuongdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang na banthahat in na mite na tandoh a, Jakob leh Joseph hahlesuonte. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Pasian tuiten nang ahing mu ua, tuiten nangma ahing mu chieng un azau ua, tuithuhpite na ngawn zong akiling uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Meilumten tui asungbuo ua, vanten aw asuo ua na thaltangte akikap phe zotzot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na vanpi ging khu pingpei lah ah a um a, kawlphie in leitung atanvah zotzot a, leitung ling in, akithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na lampi tuipi tungah akihunga, na keng lampi zong tuipi thupitah tungah apei a, hinanleh na ketotte koiman a mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangman Mosi leh Aaron khut in na mipite belamhon bangin na pui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mite aw, ka danthu ngaikhie unlen, ka kam a thupawtte ah na bil uh daw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gentena thu gen in ka kam ka kah dinga, nidanglai a thugil kigente ka gendoh dinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I bil ua izahsa u’leh itheisate, ipu ipaten ang na hilsate uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuate khu atate lah uah i im sih ding ua, khangtha hing um dingte kungah, Mangpa phatna thu leh athahatdan leh, asillamdang bawl dante ihil zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Jakobte lah ah athutheisahte asukip a, Israelte lah ah dan aguot hi. Tuakhu Aman ipu i pate kungah, atate uh kunga ahilsawn ding un thu ana pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuakhu khangtha hing um dingte leh, naupang hing pieng dingte nangawn in atheina dingun, tualeh amaute athaw ua atate uh kunga ahil sawn zel ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Pasian a akinepna uh akoi theina ding u’leh, Pasian nasepte amanghillou ua, athupiehte azui theina dinguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh apu apate uh banga khang genha leh helhat, lungtang dihlou nei khangte leh ahinna hagaute uh, Pasian a dinga gin umlou ahilouna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraim tate thalpi tawikawm a kigal thuom hinapiin, kidou ni chiengin ataizah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian thuhun azui sih ua, adanthu zong azui nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A silbawlte leh a sillamdang bawl amusahte amanghilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman Izipt gamsunga Zoar phaijangah apu apate uh, mitmu in sillamdangte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman tuipi akikhensah a, amaute apei galkai sah hi; tuite khu bangkhat kichieng bangin ading sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sun chiengin meipi in apui a, zan tungtawn in meikuongin apui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gamdai gamgaw mun ah suongpite akhipawh sah a, tuithuhpi akipat a hing luongdoh bangin tui dawn ding apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suongpi akipat in tuinahte apuldoh sah a, tuite luipi bangin aluongkhe sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuchi pumpum in zong Atungah sil abawl khiel ua, gamdai ah Tungnung pen tungah ahel nalai lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A gongsan uh phatna dingin ann ngen in, alungtang un Pasian a ze et uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi Pasian douin thu agen ua, “Pasian in gamdai ah annkuong ang luipieh thei na ngel diei izaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />En di ua suongpi asat a tuite ahing puldoh a, tuite lui bangin aluonglet hi, ann zong ang pe thei diei izaw? Amite a dingin sa ang pe thei ngel diei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuazieh in Mangpa’n tam thu azah tahin alungthah mama a, tuachi’n Jakob tungah mei akuongdoh a, Israel tungah athangpaina asouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun Pasian agingta sih ua, ahundamna zong amuong zou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinapiin Aman tunglam vante thu apie a, tualeh van kotkhate ahonpieh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh a neh ding un atung uah manna guo bangin azu sah a, amaute van akipat ann neh ding apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihingten vansawltahte ann ane ua, aman amaute kiningching tahin neh ding apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vanlaizawl ah suolam hui alaang sah a, a silbawltheina in simlam hui zong alangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amaute tungah leivui bangmai a tam sa guohzuh bangin azusah a, tuipi pieunel bang mai a tam aha nei vate a zusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aman agiehphuol sung uah akesah a, a umna kimvel uah atusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n ane ua agilva ngel uhi. Aman alunggulte uh amauh apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh agongsan uh apha nai tuom sih a, akamsung ua a ann um nalai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasian lungthahna atung uah asouta a, alah ua mi hat penpente athat a, Israel tangval thahat leh hoite asatpua lemlumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hichi pumpumin zong akhiel nalai lai ua, asillamdang bawlte mu napi in, agingta theisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n adamsung nite uh bangmalouin asuhbei pieh a, akumte uh zaunain aumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pasian in amauh atha chiengin Ama asui ua, akisia ua lungtanga kithalawp tahin Ama asui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pasian khu asuongpi uh ahi chi leh, Pasian Tungnung Pen khu amauh tanpa ahi chi atheidoh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahivang in akam un Ama aphat khem ua, alei un akungah zuouthu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Alungtangte uh Ama tungah adet sih a, Athuhun ah zong amuonhuoi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khuchi hinapiin zong Ama pen lainatna a dim ahiziehin, agitlouna uh angaidam a amaute asumang sih hi. Tamveipi alungthahna akideh a, athangpaina asupiching nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aziehpen tahsa giap ahi uh chi leh, nahna hu hing nua kia nawnlou ding bang ahi uh, chi athei ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Gamdaiah Ama tungah ahel mun mama ua, gamgaw mun ah Ama lungkham sah mun hina va-ia uh e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahi, akinuahei kia ua Pasian a ze et zih zeh ua, Israelte Misiengthoupa alunggim sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A silbawltheina alungsim uah akeem sih ua, amelmate ua pat a amaute atatdoh nite ageldoh ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Izipt gama chiemtena abawlte leh, Zoan gamlah a sil lamdang abawlte atheikha nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Aman aluipite uh sisan asuoh sah a, lui a pat tuite adawn theita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Aman thoupihon alah uah asawl a, tuate’n amauh anekhawnga, tualeh u kengte zong asawl a, tuate’n amauh asumangthai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Aman ahaichi zousie uh lungnoute kungah apie a; tualeh anasep gimgate uh khauphete kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Aman agrepguite uh giel in asuse sah a, atheipi kungte uh vua in asumang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Agantate u’zong giel in akhieh lia pie a, aganhonte uh keh zauhuoitah in keh in akhieh lia pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Sumangthai thei vansawltahte alah uah asawl a, alungthahna huoisetah, athangpaina nasatah, leh lungkham mangbatnate atung uah atung sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Aman alungthahna ding lampi abawl a, ahinna uh shina lah a kipat in ahinkhawi sih a, ahinna uh natna hipi kungah ape zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aman Izipt gama tachil zousie athatlum a, Ham puon inn a ahatna gamasa pente uh asumangthaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hinanleh amite pen ganhon bangin gamdai ah apuidoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bittahin amauh apui a, tuachi’n amauten zauna anei sih uhi; hinanleh amelmate uh pen tuipi ah atummang sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute amun siengthou gamgi ah ahing puitunga, akhut zietlam a aleisa taangah atunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Amaute mai ah namte adelmang a, agamte uh agoutan dingun ahawm pieh a, Israel namte apuon innte uah ateng sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuabang hinapi in zong, amauten Tungnung Pen Pasian a ze et uh a, Atungah ahel ua athutheisahnate azuisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hinanleh akilehei ua apu apate uh mabangin agin um sih ua; thalpi muonhuoilou bangin apeikawita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Aziehpen amunsangte un Ama alungthah sahta ua, amilim siemthute un Ama athangsesah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Pasian in tami azahtah in thangpaina in adim a, Israelte nasatah in akidahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman mihingte lah a akoi, Shiloh mun a apuon inn anuasieta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Thu hun bawm khu sal in amansah a, athupina uh zong melmate khut sungah apelutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Aman amite namsau in agalten athat gam sah siengta a, agoutan tungah alungthahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Mei in atangvalte uh akatum a, anungahte un zong kitenna mawngmawng aneita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Asiempute uh namsau in apua ua, ameithaite u’zong akap nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa khu imu khanglou bangin athouta a; pasal galhang zukham bang maiin akikouzahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Aman amelmate anua dou kia a, minsietna tawp neilou ah akoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tuathamlouin aman Joseph puonbuh adei nawn sih a, Ephraim nam zong atelta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Hinanleh Juda nam leh A it Zion muol atel zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />A munsiengthou khu leengpa innsang bangin abawla kumtawn a dinga sudet leitung bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />A suoh David atel a, belam huongsung apat in alakhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Belam noukaite azuina apat in amite Jakob leh, agoutan Israelte ching dingin ahandohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />David in lungtang dih leh muonhuoina toh amaute achinga, khutsiemna toh apuita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian, namte na goutante lah ah alut ua, Na bieh inn siengthou abuasah ua, Jerusalem zong vutvai asuoh sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na suohte luong khu tungleeng vate neh dingin apeta ua, Na misiengthoute sa khu leitung gamsate ann dingin apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asisante uh Jerusalem kimkot ah tui sunbuoh bangin, a luongsah uh a amauh vui ding koima a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka innvengte ua dingin mudahuoi ka suohta ua, ka kim ua mite simmaw leh nuisatin ka umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa bangtan vei ahiei? Kumtawnin na lungthah den talawm ding amah? Na thangsietna mei banga kuong ding adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang hing theilou namte leh na min lou ngailou gamte, tungah na lungthahna sungbuo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun Jakob anetumta uh a atenna mun uh asusegamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate uh khelnate ka tung uah thei ngitnget sinlen; na lainatna in kintah in hing nadawn pai hen, Aziehpen nahpitah a suhngiemin ka umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw ka hundamna uh Pasian, na min thupina dingin hing panpi inlen, hing hunkhie in, na min ziehin ka khelnate uh hing silsieng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangdinga namdangten “A Pasian uh hei a um ahiei?” Chise se ding ahi uoi mah? Na suohte sisan luong phuba lahna, ka mitmu un namchin lah ah kithei heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suongkul taangte thumna na masang hing tung henlen, na silbawltheina thupitah dungzui in shi dinga guotte humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka innvengte un a angsung ua, Nangma ahing selphounate uh ale sagi in thuh kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n kou na mite leh na gantatna mun a belamten, nangma kungah kumtawn in kipahthu ka hing gen ding ua, Nangma phatna akhang akhangin ka theisah zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel chingpa, Nang belamhon banga Joseph puipa, Na bil hing daw in, Nang cherubimte kikal a umpa hing tankhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ephraim, Benjamin leh Manasseh masangah na hatna tohthou inlen, hing pei inlen hing hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Pasian koute hing siemtha kia inlen na mel vahsah in, tuachi’n hundam in ka um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw galkapte Mangpa Pasian, bangtan vei na mite thungetna tunga lungthah ding na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang amaute khu hitui tanghou in na vah a, a dawn dingun hitui tenalien dim na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka inn vengte uh kihaupi ding bep in na hing bawl a, ka melmate un simmaw tahin ahing nuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Galkapte Pasian koute hing siemtha inlen, Na mel tangsah in tuachi’n hundamin ka um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat in grep gui khat na hing puo a, namte na notdoh a tua grepgui na suonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na suonna ding mun na susienga, thutah in ahui na hasah a tuachi’n gamsung aluodimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Muolte khu ahim in akhu a, abamengte khu Pasian Sidar singte bang mai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kahiengte tuipi dongin azam a, Aba mengte luipi tandong azam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kunga peiten aga alaw theina ding ua, bangdinga a inn a daite na susiet sieng ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gamnuoi a ngalten aphungkal gawp ua, gamlah a gamsaten anegam sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Galkapte Pasian aw, ka hing ngen uhi, hing kihei kia inlen van a kipat in hing ensuh inlen, tam grep gui en inlen hing ve in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na khut zietlam ngeiin asuon grep gui ahia, Nangma a dinga na hatsah abate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mei in akihalta a phuain a umta hi, na mel a phawhhilna ziehin abeimang zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh na zietlam a um mipa tungah na khut um hen, Nanga dinga suhat mihing tapa tungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n nangma ka hing nuangat san sih ding ua, hing suhal kia in tuachi’n na min ka hing han ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Pasian aw, koute hing siemtha kia inlen, Na meel vahsah in tuachi’n huhdam in ka um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I hatna uh Pasian kungah ngaitah in la sa unlen; Jakob Pasian kungah nuom tah in kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phatna la ngai sa unlen khuongta tum unlen, pehging kilawm leh kaiging ngainop huoi tahte tum un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ha tha ni leh ha lia ni in, tualeh pawi thupi bawl ni chiengin pengkul mut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen tami Israelte dinga danthu guot ahi a, Jakob Pasian dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka theikhah ngailou ham ka zahna gam, Izipt dou dinga agamsung atotsuoh lai a, Jakob Pasian in Joseph a dinga anamdet theipina khu tami ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Keima’n na liengkou ua na puohgihte uh ka ladoh a, na khutte uh zong tehlei gih apat hakhieh in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mangbat ni un na hing han ua, ken kang hunkhie hi; aguh a van ginna mun ah ka hing dawng a; Meribah tuite ah ka hing ze et hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw ka mite ngaikhie unlen, tuachi’n ka hing theisah ding hi, Aw Israel ka thu na ngai nuom uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lah uah gamdang pasien a um ding ahi sih a, gamdang pasien mawngmawng na bieh ding u’zong ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi a, Izipt gam a kipat a hing puidohpa khu ka hi; na kam uh lienpiin kaah unlen tuachi’n ka sudim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hinanleh ka miten ka aw angaikheta sih ua, Israelten ahing nuolta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n alungtang uh gen ha bang dungzui ua um ding in, ka umsanta a amauh lemsah dan bang a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka miten ka thu ngaikhie u’henlen, Israelin ka lampi zui mai uleh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima’n amelmate uh zawpieh ding inga, agalte uh tunga ka khut lampai mai ding hi vengin maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa mudate akung uah akipelut ta ding ua, hinanleh avang uh pen kumtawn in a umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman amauh ann hoipen in avah ta ding a, tualeh suongpi apat khuoizu in kahing taisahta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian khu mihatte kikhopna ah adinga, pasien te lah ah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bangtan vei ahiei dihloutah a vai na hawm ua, migiloute na deisah tuom ding uh? Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi gentheite leh pa neiloute hunkhie unlen, thudih in vaihawm pieh unlen mi nuoinungte leh, genthei thuohte tungah dihtah in thu khen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi hatloute leh tasamte hunkhie unlen, migiloute khut sung apat hunkhie un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaun a thei sih ua, theisiemna zong anei sih uhi; miel lah ah avah kawi ua, leitung kingahna suongphumte akiloh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Noute pasien tate na hi ua noute na bawn un, Tungnung Pen tate na hi uh ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangtenghileh mihingte bangin na shi ding ua,” leeng tapate khat bangin na pua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Pasian thou inlen leitung vai hawm pieh in; Nam zousiete khu na goutan ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian, hamlou kei in um sin, Aw Pasian um khinkhien sinlen, sip dide in um mama sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai in Na melmate akisabuoi vengvung ua, Nangma hing mudaten alu uh aphongsang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mite tungah pil lepchietah in thu aphiel ua, Na mi phuolguhte tungah aselam in a kihoukhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kisadi uo, anam hina uh mang khopin, Israel min mawngmawng thei zing a, a um nawnlou na ding in iphiet dinguh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungsim munkhat puo a kithutuoh in akihoukhawm ua, Nangma hing dou dingin thuhun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Edom mite leh Ishmael mite puonbuh leh, Moab mite leh Hagar mite puonbuhte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gebalte leh Ammonte, Amalekte, Philistinte, leh Tai-ar mite puonbuh a tengte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assiriate nangawn zong amaute langah apang a, Lot hahlesuonte apanpi uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Midiante tunga na bawl bangin, Kishion lui a Sisera leh Jabin tunga na bawl bangin, amaute tungah zong bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua mite khu En Dor khuo ah amangthaita ua, lei a dingin silnieh deilou bang ahing hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ami liente uh Oreb leh Zeeb bangin bawl inlen, Ahi, aleeng tapate uh abawn un Zeba leh Zalmuna bangin bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Amaun Pasian loupahing munte lahpieh vai in eiman kitanvai,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian, leivui kipei vengvung bang leh, bushi hui in amut leeng bangin amauh bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mei in gamlah akahtum bang leh, meikuong in muol leh taangte akah bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n huipi hattah in amauh nuadel inlen, na khopihui in amauh zausah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa aw, miten na min asui theina dingun, amel uh zumna in dimsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumtawn in zalah leh mangbang tahin um uhenlen, suhmuolphou a um in mangthai denta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten nangma min bou Mangpa ahi chi leh, Leitung pumpi ah nangbou Tungnung Pen na hi chi, atheina dingun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw galkapte Mangpa, Na biehbuh ngaihuoi hina va-ia e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna in Mangpa inn huongsung angai nama a, ahi, aba vawt hi. Ka lungtang leh ka tahsa khu Pasian hing ngai in akikoukhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vatou na ngawn in tenna ding inn amu a, Sielpaleeng in zong ama dingin anoute koina ding bu aki nei hi. Aw galkapte Mangpa ka leengpa leh ka Pasian aw, tuate khu na mai tamte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na inn a teng mite ahampha uhi, Nang ahing phat nalai ding uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma a hatna nei mi ahampha hi, alungtanga Zion zotna lampi lunggul khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaute kaana luiguom a azawt lai un, tuakhu tuikhuh in abawl zel uhi. Khaal guo zu masate’n zong tuikulte adimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute hatna a kipat hat zawh semna ah apei ua, Zion ah Pasian masang ah akimusah chiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw galkapte Mangpa Pasian, ka thungetna za inlen, Jakob Pasian aw, na bil hing daw in. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Pasian ka kidalna phaw uh, ngai in, na sathau nupa mel zong envawi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen mundanga ni tul khat um sangin, Na inn huongsunga ni khat um ahoi zaw a; gitlouna puon innte a um sangin, ka Pasian kotkha ngah a pan ka ut zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian khu ni leh phaw ahi a, Mangpa’n hepina leh thupina ape dinga; Dihtah a umte lah ah silhoi mawngmawng a it ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw galkapte Mangpa, Nangma hing muong mi ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa, Nangma na gam tungah na kipah a, a saltanna ua kipat Jakob na nua puikiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mite gitlouna na ngaidam a, akhelnate zousie uh na liekhu hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thangpaina zousie na lamangta, Na lungthahna zauhuoina apat na kiheimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw ka hundamna Pasian uh hing kiheisah kia inlen, ka tung ua na lungthahna tawp sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tung uah na lungthah den ding amah? Na lungthahna akhang akhanga, umsah den ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma a na mite a kipah theina ding un, na hing suhal kia sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa aw, na khotuona hing musah inlen, na hundamna zong hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian thugen ding ka ngaikhe dinga, aziehpen Aman amite leh amisiengthoute kungah, lungmuonna thu gen ding ahi; hinanleh amaute motna lam ah kihei nawn sih uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pellou in a hundamna khu ama giing mite nai ah a um hi, thupina i gam a aum theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khotuona leh thutah akimutuo ua; dihtatna leh hamuonna akitawptuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitung apat thutah ahing poukhe tou ding a, dihtatnain van akipat in ahing ensuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, Mangpa’n silhoi ahing pe dinga, tualeh igam un ga tampi asuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amasangah dihtatna apei dinga, akalsuonna lampite ah eite ahing koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa kei langah na bil hing daw inlen, hing dawngin aziehpen genthei leh tasamtah ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna keem hoi inlen Ka siengthou ngal a, Aw Nang ka Pasian na hi a, Nangma hing muong na suohpa hundam in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing khotuo in, aziehpen nichin in nangma ka hing han hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw na suohpa hinna nuomsah sah in aziehpen, Aw Mangpa ka hinna nangma kunga ka domsang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Aw Mangpa nang na hoi a, ngaidam dinga mansa na hi a, Nangma hing han poumate tungah khotuona na hau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, ka thungetna ah na bil hing daw inlen, hepina ngen a ka kikounate ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lungkham mangbat ni chiengin, Nangma ka hing han ding hi; na hing dawn ding zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Mangpa pasien te lah ah, Nangma bang mawngmawng koima a um sih hi, na silbawl banga bawlthei mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa aw na siemsa nam chinte ahing pei ding ua, nang ma ah ahing be ding ua, Na min apahtawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Nang na thupi a, sillamdang tahtahte na bawl a, Nang bou Pasian na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na lampite hing hil in, tuachi’n na thutah ka zui thei ding hi Na min zau dingin lungtang khat hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian ka lungtang, zousie in ka hing phat ding a, tualeh na min thupi ka pahtawi kumtawnta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen na khotuona khu kei a dingin athupi hi, Nangman ka hinna hankhuh nuoinungpen a kipat in na hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Pasian mikiliensahte’n ahing dou ua, mi ngongtat umkhawmten tha dingin ka hinna asui uhi, tualeh amasang uah Nangma ahing koikha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa nang pen lainatna a dim, hepisiem lungthah bailou, khotuona leh thutah a dim Pasian na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Oh! Kei lam hing nga inlen hing khotuo in, Na suohpa kungah na hatna hing pie inlen, na suohnu tapa hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hoina ding chiemtena hing lah in, ahing mudate’n tuakhu amu ua azumthei na dingun; aziehpen Mangpa nangman na hing panpi a, na hing hamuon hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asuongphum khu muol siengthou a um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Zion kulpi kotkhate khu, Jakobte umna zousie sangin angaina zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Pasian khopi na tungtang thu thupitahte agen uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei hing theite kung ah Rahab leh Babilon tungtang ka gen ding a, Ngai in, Philistin leh Tai-ar Ethiopia toh, “Envawi tamte khuna pieng ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zion tungtang thu ah tami leh tuomi,” ama a pieng ahi ua, Tungnung pen mama in tua khopi aphutdet ding hi, chi’n agen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n michin min akhum chiengin, “Tami pen Zion a pieng ahi,” chi’n achiemte ding hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lasa mite’n tumging tumte toh, “Ka lungnopna tuikhuh zousie nangma ah a um hi,” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka hundamna Mangpa Pasian, sun leh zan in na masang ah ka kikou kou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thungetna na masang ah hing tung henlen, ka kikou thawm ah na bil hing daw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen ka hinna buoina in adimta a, ka hinna in hankhuh lam anai hiei hiei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hankhuh a peisuhte lah a simtel ka hita a, hatna neilou mi bang giap ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gal tha, han a lumte bang a mishi lah a paikhiet, na theizing nawnlou bang giap kahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kokhuh nuoinung pen leh, amielna mun thuhtah ah na hing lumsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thangpaina gihtah in ahing netkhum a, na tui kihotte’n na hing sugimta hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka meltheite kei a pat in gamlapi ah na umsah a, ama-ua dinga kidahhuoipi in na hing bawlta hi; khakhum in ka um a ka pawtkhe thei nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gimthuohna zieh in ka mitte ase hiei hiei a; Aw Mangpa nichin in nangma kung lam a, ka banzah in ka hing han hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mishite a dingin sillamdang na bawl ngai amah? Mishi sate hing thouin nang ahing phat ding uoi mah? Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hankhuh sungah na itna tulngailou, akiphuong thei ngelna diei mah? ahisihleh manthaina mun ah na ginumna, theisahin in aum na diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amielna mun ah na sillamdang bawlte akitheina ngel diei? Na dihtatna khu manghilna gam ah akithei diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa nangma ka hing han hi; Zingmawng tenga ka thungetna, na masangah ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, bangdinga ka hinna paikhie na hiei? Bangdinga kei akipat na mai phuol na ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka naupan chiil a kipat in gimthuoh leh shi dihdihin ka um a, na silbawl chizat huoite ka thuoh lai in suhmangbat in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thangpaina zauhuoi tahin ahing tuomkhum a, na zauhuoina in ahing sumangthaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amauten nichin in tuilien bangin ahing imkuol uhi. Ka kim vel ah ahing tuom chintuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahing it ka lawm kaguolte kei a pat in na koi gamla ta a, ka meltheite miel lah ah na umsahta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na khotuona te kumtawn in lain kasa ding a; Ka kam in na ginumdan khang sawnsawnte kungah ka theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen khatuona khu kumtawn in lamtouin a um dinga, Na ginumna khu vante ngei ah na sudet ding, ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka mi telpa toh thuhun ka bawlta ua, ka suohpa David kungah thu ka chiemta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nahah nasuonte kumtawn in ka sukip dinga, Na leengtoupha zong khang zousie tan in, ka sudet ding hi,” na chita hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, vanten na silbawl lamdangte aphat ding ua, misiengthoute kikhopna ah, Na ginumna zong aphat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa toh tekah thei ding vante ah koi a um ei? mi silbawltheitah tapate lah ah, Mangpa toh kibatsahthei koi ahiei um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasian khu misiengthoute kikhopna ah, nasatah a giinding ahi a; Akimvel a mi zousiete lah ah zatat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw galkapte Mangpa Pasian, Nang banga thahat koi ahiei, Aw Mangpa? Na muonhuoina in Nang ahing imkuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang tuipi kihot zua zua tungah vai na hawm a, tuikihotte akiseptou chiengin na daisah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang Rahab khu galtha bangin na satnen dimdem a, Na banthahat in na galte na delzahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vante nanga ahi a leitung zong nanga ahi. Leitung leh a sunga umte zousie zong, Nangma mukhiet ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sim leh mal zong Nangma siem ahi a, Tabor leh Harmon muolte Na min in anuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangman ban thahattah na nei a na khut ahat a, Na khut zietlam pahtawi in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dihtatna leh vaihawmnadih khu, Na leengtoupha kingahna ahi a, khotuona leh thutah na masangah apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungnopna aw ging za namte ahampha uhi, Mangpa aw amaute na mel vah ah avah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na min ziehin sun nitum in anuom ua, na dihtatna ziehin pahtawi in aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen athahatna uh thupina nangma na hi a, Na deisahna ziehin ka kii uh pahtawi in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen ka lum uleh ka phaw uh Mangpa ahi a, Israel Misiengthou khu ka leengpa uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuahun lai in na misiengthou kungah, “Mengmunain thu na gen a, mi hattah khat tungah panpina ka ngata a, mite lah a kipat a ka teldohpa mi khat, ka pahtawita hi, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka suohpa David ka mukheta a, ka sathau siengthou ama ka nuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama ah ka khut suhkip in a um ding a, ka bantha in ama asuhat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amelmate koima’n ama azouthaw sih ding a, gitlouna ta in zong asugim sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amasang ah agalte ka satpua dinga, ama mudate natnain ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh ka ginumna leh ka khotuona khu, ama toh aumkhawm dinga, ka min ziehin akii tawisangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Akhut zong tuipi tungah ka ngasah dinga, tualeh akhut zietlam zong luipite ah ka ngasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman kei ang han dinga Nang ka Pa na hi a, Ka Pasian, ka hundamna suongpi na hi; ahing chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ken zong ama ka tachil in ka bawl dinga, leitung a leengte lah a sangpen in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka khotuona khu ama a dingin, kumtawn in ka kep hoipieh dinga, ka thuhun khu a kungah dettah in aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahah asuonte zong kumtawn in ka umsah dinga; aleengtoupha zong vante um sungsie, ka umsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ataten ka dan alengatsan ua, ka vaihawmnate dungzui a a um sih uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka danthupiehte apalsan ua, ka thupiehte azui sih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />atawnkhielnate ziehun, chieng in ka gawt dinga, akhelna zieh un khauhuol in ka zep ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahivang in ama a kipat ka itna tulngailou, khu ka lamang sih dinga, ka ginumna in azuousan ka phal sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ken ka thuhun ka bawtse sih dinga, ka kam a thupawtsa zong, ka heng lamdang vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khatvei ka sienthouna louin ka kichiemta a; David kungah zuou ka gen sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahah asuonte kumtawn in a um den ding ua, aleengtoupha zong ka masangah, ni bangin a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hapi bangin kumtawn in sudet in a umden dinga, vanlai a theipitu gin um bang in a umden ding hi,” na chita hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin na paikheta a na kidahta a; na sathau nusa tungah na thangpai mamata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na suohpa thuhun na don nawn sih a, amanglukhu zong tuol sena a nei in na sungiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A daite zousie na phesiet pieh a, akulpite zousie na susiet pieh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A kung a peikha pouma in asuom ua, a inn vengte simmaw ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nang ama doute khut zietlam na tawisanga, amelmate zousie na lungnuom sah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nang anamsau mahiem na lehei pieh a, kidouna mun ah ama na dingkipsah nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A thupina na suhtawp pieh a, aleengtoupha zong tuoltang se na’n na nei piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Atangval lai nite na suhtom pieh a, zumna leh zalatna in na tuom khumta hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Aw Mangpa bangtan vei ahiei mah? Kumtawn a kiphuol den ding na hiei mah? Na thangpaina mei banga kuong ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ka hun tomdan thei ngitnget in, Bangding a mihingte zousie, bangmalou dinga na siem ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Koi ahiei shina mel mulou a hing ding? Koi ahiei shina hankhuh a pat ahinna hun thei ding? Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mangpa nidanglai a na itna tulngailou leh, Na thutahna a David kunga na thuchiem hei a umta ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mangpa aw na suohte a simmaw na uh thei ngitnget inlen, mitampite’n ahing simmawna uh, ka angsunga ka thuoh zel dan thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na melmaten ang simmawna uleh, na sathau nupa kalsuonte asimmawna uh thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Mangpa khu kumtawn in phat in umta hen, Amen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa Nang khang zousie a ka umna uh na hi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Muol leh tangte pien masanga, leitung leh khuovannuoi na siem masang peh a, kumtawn akipat kumtawn donga Pasian na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang mihingte khu manthaina ah na kesah a, “Mihing tate aw lei vui ah kia kia un” na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na mitmu ah kum tulkhat zong apeisa zani bang giap ahi a, zan ven khat sung bang bep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuilien bangin amaute na taimang a, khangkhat imu bang giap ahi uhi; zingmawng a loupa hing dawhkhie bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingmawng in ahing poudoh a, ahing dawnkhie a, nitahlam chiengin a muol a avuoi gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen na lungthahna in koute ahing katum a, na thangpaina ah suhmangbat in ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka gitlounate uh na masangah na koi a, aguh a ka khelnate uh na mel vah ah na sulangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen ka damsung nite uh na thangpaina ah abeimang zel a, ka damsung kumte uh khatvei nahhuoi bangin ka beisah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka damsung kumte uh kum sawmsagi ahi a, hatna zieh in kum sawm giet zong ahi thei hi. Hinanleh asawtna khu sepgimna leh lungkhamna giap ahi a, abei pai a ka lengmang zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koi in ahiei na lungthahna silbawlthei dan thei? Na zauhuoina bang zel in na thangpaina a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka damsung nite uh sim dan hing hil in, pilna lungtang ka nei theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Mangpa hing kihei kia in, bangtan vei lungthah ding na hiei mah? Na suohte tungah lainatna nei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka damsung nite zousie ua, nuom a ka kipah theina dingun, zingmawng in na khotuona in hing taisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na hing suhgimna nite leh, sil hoilou ka tuoh kum sungte bang dungzui in, hing kipah sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na suohte kungah na nasep kilang henlen; na thupina khu atate uh kungah kilang hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa ka Pasian uh kilawmna ka tung uah um henlen, Ka khut nasep uh koute a dingin sukip inlen, Ahi, ka khut nasep uh suhkip in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tungnungpen kibutna mun guh a um mi khu, Bangkimbawltheipa lim nuoi ah a um ngitnget ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa tungthu ah “Ama khu ka kibutna leh ka kulpi, Ka Pasian ahi, Ama ka muong ding kachi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pellou in Aman thangkammi thang leh, natna hi leng zauhuoi lah a kipat in ahing hunkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman ahain in ahing liekhu dinga, ahalim nuoi ah na muong ding a; athutah khu na lum leh phaw ahi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zanlai a sil chizathuoite na zau nawn sih dinga, suntang lai a thaltang leng zong na zau sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miel nuoi a natna hii leeng na zau sih dinga, sunlai a silhoilou sietna zong na zau sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na geiah mi tulkhat a pua ding ua, na zietlangah tulsawm a pua ding uhi, hinanleh nang ahing nai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mit in na en dinga, migiloute kithuhna na mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen nangman Mangpa khu kihumbitna in na nei a, Tungnungpen mama khu na umnain na bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sil hoilou mawngmawng na tungah atung sih dinga, natna hi in zong na tenna ahing nai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman a vansawltahte, na gamtatna zousie veng dingin thu ape ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaun akhut un ahing domtou ding ua tuachilouin, na kengin suong na suikha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Humpibahnei leh gulha na tuonden dinga, humpibahnei khanglaite leh gulte na tuonchil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tunga a itna angap ziehin ka hundam ding a, ka min athei zieh un munsang ah ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei ahing han ding ua ka dawng dinga; amangbat chiengun ka umpi dinga, amauh ka hunkhe dinga tualeh ka pahtawi nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Damsawtna in amauh ka lungkim sah dinga, ka hundamna zong ka musah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa kunga kipah thugen leh, Aw Tungnung pen, na min phat a lasah sil hoitah a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na itna tulngailou zingmawng a suhlat leh, na ginumna zan chin a phuondoh ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tumging gui sawm neite, theile leh gawsem ging hasiet huoitah toh phat khu ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa aw Nangma nasep ahoi a, ahing kipah sah a, na khut nasepte zieh a kipah in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa aw na nasepte thupi hina va-ia e, na ngaituonate zong athuh mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi mawl in tami athei sih a, mi moten zong atheisiem sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migiloute hampa bangin ahing khangkhie ua, silgilou bawlte zousie’n nuom ahing sah chiengun, kumtawna Mangthang ding ahibou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa, Nang pen kumtawn a Tungnung Pen na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Aw Mangpa, ngai in, nangma hing doute, ngaivawi, Nang hing doute mangthai ding ahi uhi, sil bawlkhielte zousie thethangin aum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh ka kii pen gam bawngtal kii bangin, na pahtawi dinga, sathau tha nuin ka umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mit in ka galte guollelna ka mu dinga, ka bil in kei hing dou migiloute tunga, ka dei azata ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midihtate khu tumsing bangin akhanpha ding uh a, Lebanon muol a Sidar singte bangin a khang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa inn a kisuonte pen, i Pasian uh bieh inn huong sungah, akhanpha zeizoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A upat nua chieng nangawn un zong, ga asuong nalai ding ua, a hing dipdep ding ua abawhpha mama ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuapen Mangpa khu adihtat ahi chi phuondohna ding ahi a, Ama ka suongpi ahi a, Ama ah dihtatlouna mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa leeng vaihawm in atou a, athupinain akithuom hi; Mangpa’n leeng puontuol asil a, thahatna in akawng agah hi. Leitung zong akilin louna dingin, suhdet in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na Mangtoupha nidanglai peh a sudet ahi a; Nang pen kumtawn akipat umden na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, tuisanglette akivawhtou ua, tuisang lette’n a aw uh asuo ua, tuisanglette aging henhon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tunglam a um Mangpa khu, tui tampi gin sangin ahat zaw a, tuipi kihawt sangtah sangin zong ahat zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thutheisahte khu amuonhuoi mama hi; Aw Mangpa, sienthouna khu kumtawn in, na inn toh akilawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Pasian Nang phubalahna neitu na hi a, Phuba lapa Pasian hing taangkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw leitung vaihawmpa, kipan inlen, kiliensahte kungah a gitlou man uh thuh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Mangpa bangtanvei ahiei, bangtan vei ahiei migiloute a guolzaw ding uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauh kisathei tahin a ham ua, thulimlouna nasemten ki uongsah tah in thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, amaun na mite abottel gawp uh a, na goutante asugenthei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaun meithaite leh mikhuolte athat ua, pa neiloute a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Amaun Mangpa’n amu sih ding a, Jakob Pasian in phamaw asa sih ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite lah a mimawlte aw, theisiem un, Mimote aw, bang chih chienga pil ding na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bil bawlpan zalou ding ahiei mah? Mit bawlpan mulou ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian theilou Namte Thununpa’n asudih sih ding amah? mite pilna hilpa’n athei sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n mihingte ngaituonate bangmalou ahi chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangman na phawhhil leh, na dan a pat a na hil mite ahampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Migilou a dinga akuo uh taw a aum masangsie, mangbatna nite apat khawldamna na pieh theina ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n amite anuasie ngai sih dinga, agoutan ataisan ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaihawmna khu dihtat na lamah akinuale kia dinga, lungtang dihtah po zousie’n tuakhu azui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Koi ahiei silgilou bawlte hing doupieh dinga kipankhe ding? Ahisihleh koi ahiei thulimlouna bawlte, hing doupieh dinga ding ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa kei hing panpipa hisih leh, ka hinna kintah in sip didena mun ah aumta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka keng ateu hi” ka chi chiengin, Aw Mangpa, na khotuonain a hing tudet zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka lunggimna atam seng chiengin, na hamuonnate’n ka hinna akipahsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dan bawl a khelna umsahte gitlouna leengtouphain, nangma toh kithuokhawmna anei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Midihtat hinna dou tum in akikhawm ua, mawna neilou sisan siemlou atangsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa khu ka kivenbitna ahi a, Ka Pasian khu ka kihumbitna suongpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman amaute thulimlouna ngei khu atung uah akesah ding a, agitlouna ngei uah amaute asattan ding a Mangpa i Pasian un amaute a sattan ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw hing pei un, Mangpa phat in la isa ding uh; i hundamna suongpi pahtawi in, nuomtahin ikikou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kipahthu gen kawm in amasangah ipei ding ua, phatna la sa a Ama pahtawi in, nuomtah in aw i suo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa khu Pasian thupitah ahia, pasien zousiete tunga leengpa thupitah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khut ah lei mun thuhtahte a uma, muolvum sangte zong Ama a ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi Ama a ahi a, Ama siemsa ahi, a khut in gamgaw zong asiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw hing pei un Ama bie in kunva ui; Mangpa eite hing siempa mai ah khupdin chiet va ui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen ama i Pasian uh ahi a, eite agantatna muna mite leh akhut a belamte ihi uhi. Tunia, a aw na zah ua ahileh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a suh lungthah lai bang uleh, gamdai a aze et lai ni ua bang in, na lungtang uh khausah sih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum hunlai in napu napate un ahing ze et ua, ka silbawlte munapiin ahing enkhie nalai lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen kum sawmli sung ving veng, tua khangte tungah “Ka lungkimta sih a, alungtang ua lampiel ngitnget nam ahi ua, ka lampite azui sih uhi,” ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka khawldamna ah alut sih ding uh chiin, atung uah lungthah in ka kichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa pahtawi in la tha sa unlen, leitung pumpi in Mangpa phat in la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa pahtawi in la sa unlen, amin phat un; Ni simin ahundamna thu gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Namte lah ah athupina phuong unlen, mizousie lah ah asilbawl lamdangte phuongzah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa khu athupi a, thupitah a, pahtawi ding ahi, pasien zousiete sanga Ama giin ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen namte pasien zousie khu milimte ahi ua, hinanleh Mangpa’n vante asiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zatatna leh vangletnate amasangah a um a, thahatna leh kilawmna amunsiengthou ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw nou michin namchinte, thupina Mangpa kungah pie unlen, Ahi, thupina leh hatna Mangpa kungah pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa kungah Amin thupina pie unlen, sillatte tawi in ahuong sungah hing lut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Oh! asienthouna kilawmna toh Mangpa bie unlen, leitung pumpi amasangah chitun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namte lah ah “Mangpa’n vai ahawm hi, chi’n genkawi un, leitung zong kiptah a phudet ahia, akiling nawn sih ding hi. Aman dihtatna toh mite vai ahawm pieh ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vante nuom uhenlen, leitung zong kipah hen; tuipi leh asunga um zousie kikou uhen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />leitung leh asunga um zousie kipah uhen, tuachi’n gamlah singkung zousie zong, nuomsatah in Mangpa masangah aum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama hing pei pai ding ahia, leitung vaihawm dinga hing pei pai ding ahi; Aman dihtatna toh leitung thu akhen dinga; A thutahin mite vai ahawm pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n vai ahawm hi, leitung nuom henlen, tui laisie gam zousie kipah hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meilum leh mielna khu akimvel ah a um a, aleengtoupha kingahna khu dihtatna leh, thudih a vaihawmna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amasangah meikuong apei a, akimvel a agalte akatum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tunpheten leitung atanvah vapom a, leitungin amu a, achitun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa mai ah muolte khuoilu bangin azunmang a, leitung pumpi Mangpa mai ah azunmang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanten Adihtatna aphuongkhie ua, mi zousie’n athupina amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siemthu milim bete zousie, suhmuolphouin um uhenlen, milim kisahtheipite, nou pasiente zousiete Ama bie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion in aza a, kipah tah in aum hi, tualeh Aw Mangpa, Na thukhenate ziehin Juda tanuten nuom asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa nang leitung pumpi tunglam peh a, sangpen Na hi a, pasien zousiete tungah tawisangin na um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nou Mangpa itten, sil hoilou huo un. Aman amisiengthoute hinna akeem hoi a, migiloute khut a pat in ahumbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Midihtat adingin khuo avah a, mi lungtang dih adingin kipahna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nou midihtatte aw Mangpa ah nuom unlen, Amin siengthou theizingna ah kipahthu gen un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa pahtawi in la tha sa un, aziehpen Aman sillamdangte abawlta a, akhut zietlam leh aban siengthouin Ama aguolzou sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n ahundamna atheisahta a, adihtatna namte mitmu ah chientah in a langsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman Israel innkuonte tungah akhotuona leh, agin umna athei ngitnget hi. Kawlmong tan a mi zousie in i Pasian uh, hundamna amu suohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung luo zousiete aw, Mangpa pahtawi in nuomtahin aphatna la sa in kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa phat in kaiging toh la sa unlen, tumging leh phatna lasah ging toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pengkul ging leh belamtal kii kimut ging toh, Lengpa, Mangpa mai ah nuomtah in kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuipi leh a sunga um zousie ging zoizoi uhenlen, leitung leh asunga um zousie toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Luipiten akhut uh beng uhenlen, muolten Mangpa masangah nuom in la sa khawm uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen, Ama leitunga vaihawm dinga hing pei ding ahi. Aman dihtatna toh leitung pumpi vai ahawm dinga, khentuom neilou in vai ahawmpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n leeng vai ahawm hi, mipite chitun uhen, Ama cherubimte kikaal ah atou hi, leitung kiling hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion ah Mangpa athupi hi; Namchinte tungah atungnungpen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaun na min thupitah leh chizathuoi phat uhen; Ama asieng thou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lengpa thahatna in thukhenna dih a it hi, Nangman khentuom neilouna na sudet zel a, Jakob tate lah ah vaihawmna leh, dihtatna na bawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa i Pasian pahtawi unlen, akeng ngahna bulah bie un, Ama asiengthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A siempute lah ah Mosi leh Aaron apang ua, Amin hante lah ah Samuel apanga, Amauten Mangpa ahan ua, tuachi’n Aman adawng zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman meilum khuom akipat in amauh ahoupi a, amaun athu theisahte leh, adanthupiehte azui zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian uh, Nang amauh na dawng a, asilbawlkhelnate uh tungah phuba la zel nanlachin zong, amaute ngaidampa Pasian na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa i Pasian khu tawisang unlen, amuol siengthou ah Ama bie un, aziehpen Mangpa i Pasian u’khu asiengthou ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou gam zousiete aw, Mangpa pahtawi in nuomsatah in kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kipahkawm in Mangpa nna sem unlen, lasa kawm in amasang ah hing pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa khu Pasian ahi chi thei un, ahing siempa Ama ahi a, eite Ama a ihi ua, amite leh agantatna mun a abelamte ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kipah thugen kawm in akotpi ah lut unlen, phat kawm in A biehinn huongsung ah lut un, Akungah kipahthu gen unlen, Amin phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa khu ahoi a, A khotuona khu kumtawn in a um ding hi, tualeh athutahna zong akhang akhangin a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na khotuona leh vaihawmna dih thu khu la in kasa dinga; Aw Mangpa Nangma phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lampi hoibukim ah piltahin ka um dinga; Oh! bangchih chiengin ka kungah na hing pei diei? Ka innsungah lungtang hoibukim puoin ka um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sil gilou mawngmawng ka mitmu ah ka koi sih dinga, Lampielte silbawl ka huo a keima ah abeh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungtang genhain ahing peisan dinga; gitlouna zong ka theikha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Koipou a innveng simtham a gensie pouma ka sumang dinga, mit sangha leh Lungtanga kisathei pouma ka thuoh thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamsunga mi ginumte tungah ka mit atu dinga, kei toh atengkhawm ding uhi; Koipou hoibukim a, ka lampi zuiten ka nna asem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Milepchie koima ka inn ah ateng sih ding ua, zuougen hat mi koima ka kungah a um thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gamsunga migiloute zousie zingmawng tengin ka sumang dinga, silgilou bawl mi zousie Mangpa khopi apat ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, ka thungetna hing ngaikhie inlen, ka kikouna husa Nangma kungah hing tung hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka genthei ni chiengin kei a pat na mai phuol sin. Na bil kei langah hing daw inlen, ka hing hat ni chiengin hing dawng paiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen ka damsung nite meikhu bangin azammang zel hi. Ka gute zong taptunga mei-amsa abang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lungtang vuoh in a uma, hampa bangin avuoita a, ka ann neh ding nangawn ka manghilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thum ka mauna aw zieh in, ka gute ka vun ah abeh chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamdai simbupi bang ka hita a, khogem nua a simbuneu bang giap ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hah ngitnget a, Inntunga vatou amatanga um bang kana hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sun nitum in ka melmaten ahing gensie ua, ka tunga hangsanten ka tungah hamsie alou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vut khu ann bangin ka ne a, ka dawn ding khu ka hitui toh akihal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na thangpaina zieh leh na lungthahna zieh in, Na hing domkanga na hing paikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka damsung nite lah nitahlam nihim kihei bang giap ahi a; hampa bangin ka vuoigawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa, nang pen kumtawn a um ding na hia, na min theizingna zong akhang akhangin, a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thou dinga, Zion muol na khotuo ding a, lainatna na nei ding hi; a ma deisahna ding hun atung ta ngal a, ahi, hun guot khu atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen na suohten asuongte adeithaw mama ua, a leivuite na ngawn angaina uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namten Mangpa min a zau ding ua, leitunga leengte zousie in na thupina azau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n Zion alamtha kia dinga, athupina toh ahing kilang kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman bangmaneiloute thumna angaisah dinga, athumnate uh asimmaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam thu khangtha hing um dingte dinga gel ahi ding a, nam hing kisiemkhe dingte’n, Mangpa apahtawi theina ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n amun siengthou sangtah akipat in ahing ensuh a, Mangpa’n van a kipat in leitung a ensuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman suongkul taangte tau thawm aza dinga; shi dinga kiguotte aphelkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zion ah Mangpa min akiphuongzah dinga, tualeh Ama phatna Jerusalem ah kiphuongzah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mipite leh leenggamte Mangpa be dinga, ahing kikhop khawm hun chiengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman lamkaal ah ka tha atawlsah a, ka damsung nite asutomta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ken, “Aw ka Pasian,” ka damsung hatlai nite ah, “Hing lamang nai sin; Nangma kumte pen akhang akhang a umden ding ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangma’n leitung kingahna nidanglai peh a na phumsa ahi a, vante zong na khutsuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuate ahing mangthang ding ua, hinanleh Nang pen na umden ding hi; Ahi tuate zousie pen puonsil bangin ahing lui ding ua, puonsil bangin na hengta ding a, tuachi’n ahing kihengta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Nang pen angai ngai na hi a, Na kumte zong a bei ngaisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na suohte tate pen aumzing ding ua, tualeh ahah asuonte uh zong na masang ah suhdet in aum ding uhi. Ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka hinna Mangpa phat in, ka sunga umte zousie aw! Amin siengthou phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw ka hinna, Mangpa phat inlen, phattuomna ahing bawlpieh zousie manghil vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman na khelnate zousie angaidam a, na natna zousie asudam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman manthaina kokhuh apat in na hinna atandoh a, Itna tulngailou leh khotuona ahing khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kam silhoi in ahing taisah a, tuachi’n na khangdawnna khu muvanlai banga siemtha in a um kia zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n suhgentheina thuohte zousie a dingin, dihtatna leh thudih in vai ahawmpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman alampite Mosi kungah atheisah a, asil bawlte Israelte kungah atheisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa khu lainatsiem leh hepisiem ahi a, lungthah bailou leh khotuona hau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman eite ahing phawhthop ngitnget sih dinga, alungthah ngitnget sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman ikhelnate dungzui in itungah nna asem sih a, gitlounate dungzui in ahing thuh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen vante leitung sanga asan zawh bangin; A khotuona khu ama giing mite a dingin alien mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suolam leh tumlam akigamlat bangin, Aman itawnkhelnate eima akipat akoimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pa in tate ahepi bangin, Mangpa’n Ama giing mite ahepi ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman itahsa pumpi kisiem dan athei a, leivuigiap ihi dan zong athei ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing pen adam sung nite hampa bang bep ahi a, gamlah a pahpe pah bangin ahing pah lun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen hui in a mut chiengin aleengmang pai ua, a umna mun nangawn a kithei nawnsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa khotuona khu ama giingte tungah, kumtawn akipat kumtawn tanin a umden dinga; tualeh adihtatna zong atu khang ata khang tan in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thuhun zui poumate leh athupiehte zui tum a theizingte kungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa’n vantungah aleengtouna asudet a, A leenggam in zong bangkim tungah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nou athu ngaikhie a athu mang, hatna thupi nei Vansawlsiengte aw, Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nou agalkapte zousie leh nou adeilam bawl a, Ama nasemte zousie aw, Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama vaihawmna mun phot a, Asilbawl zousiete aw, Mangpa phat un; Aw ka hinna Mangpa phat in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hinna aw Mangpa phat in, Aw Mangpa ka Pasian Nang na thupi mama a, pahtawina leh vangletnain na kithuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khovah puon bangin na sil a, vante zong puon inn bangin na zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman a pindan tungnung innkam zawlte khu tui lah ah ahunga, meilumte khu sakolleng in abawl a, huipi ha tungah atuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman huite thupotu in azang a, meikuongte anasem in azang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman leitung kingahna suongphum aphum a, kumtawmna akilin louna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman leitung khu tuithuhpi in puon bangin akhukhum a; taangte tungah tuite a um zeizoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na phawhthop chieng in tuipite ataimanga, na vanging thawmte zieh in akikhin mangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Taangte tungah apeitou ua, amauh dinga na mupiehna mun phaihawmte ah apeikhesuh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Akantan louna dingun gamgi na hung a, leitung tummang ding a anuakia louna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman guomte ah tuinahte a pul sah a, tuate taang kikaalte ah a luong uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaten gamsa chinteng kungah dawn ding apie a, gam sabiltungten adangtah uh aphasah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuami luipangte ah tungleng vate’n umna anei ua, luising bazamte lah ah vaten la asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman a pindan tungnung apat in taangte tui in ahing tapnou zel a; leitung na khut nasep gate ah taitah in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gantate a dingin hampa a pousah a, ante louhingte mihingte zah ding in a pousah hi; leitunga kipat neh ding apawtsah theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihingte lungnopna dingin zu na siema, amai uh suhnouna dingin sathau, tualeh mihing lungtang suhat dingin tanghou a bawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa singkungte khu abawhpha mama ua tuiin atapnou a, Lebanon taanga asuon singte khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuami singkung lah ah vaten bu abawl ua, vaiva a dingin tasingte a inn ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tang sangte khu sakelte dinga umna ahi a, suongpite khu zupite kibutna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman kum kihei dan chiemtena dingin hapi abawl a, ni in atum hun ding athei ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma’n miel na bawl a, zan ahing hi a, zan nuoi ah gamsa zousie avahdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Humpibahnei lunlaiten asamat ding uh angih ua, Pasian apat neh ding asui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni ahing suoh chiengin, aum khawm zel ua akawsung uah alum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihingte zong anasepna mun chiet uah akuon ua, nitahlam tandong a semgim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na silbawlte tam hina va-ia uh e! amaute khu pilna a na bawl ngen ahi ua, leitung na siemsatein a dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khunah tuipi lien leh thupi a um a, asungah simsenglou ganhing alien aneu tampi a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khunah tembawh apei a, asunga ki-apmai dingin nana bawl a, Leviathan ahing kuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuate zousie in, ahuntah a ann na pieh theina dingin Nangma ahing ngah chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amauh kung a na pieh pouma atom khawm ua, Na khut na zah a, hoina in atai zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na mai na phuol a achimaw uh a, anahna uh na lamang a ashi ua, leivui ah nua kia kia zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na hagau na sawlkhie a siem in a um uhi; tualeh leitung zong na siemtha kia zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mangpa thupina khu kumtawn in um henlen; a siemsate zousie tungah Mangpa kipah in nuomta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman leitung a en a akiling zel hi, taangte akhoi a meikhu apawt zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka damsung teng Mangpa phat in la kasa dinga; ka hinlaisie ka Pasian phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka ngaituona khu Ama a dingin humtah hi henlen, Kei pen Mangpa ah ka nuom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitung a pat in mikhielte suhmangin um uh henlen, migiloute zong um nawn sih uhen. Aw ka hinna Mangpa phat in. Mangpa khu pahtawi chiet un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa kungah kipahthu gen unlen, Amin siengthou han unlen, mite lah ah asibawlte theisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama pahtawi in la sa unlen, Ama phat in la sa un, asilbawl lamdang zousie ah houlim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amin siengthou suong unlen, Mangpa sui mite lungtang kipah hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa leh ahatna sui unlen, bangchilai pouin Amel sui ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asil lamdang bawlsate thei ngitnget unlen, asillamdangte leh akam a vaihawmnate thei ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw nou, Asuohpa Abraham hahlesuonte leh, atel tuom Jakob tate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama khu i Mangpa Pasian uh ahi a, A vaihawmnate leitung pumpi ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman athuhunte kumtawn in athei ngitnget a, khang tulkhat tan a ana thupiehsate ngei khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham kunga athuhun leh, Isak kunga akichiemna ngei khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuami khu adan thupieh dingin Jakob kungah asudet a, Israelte kungah kumtawn thuhun dingin asudetta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Noute kungah Kanaan gam ka hing pe ding hi, na goutan tuom ding un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tawmnou khat ahilai uleh, simtham ching lou ahi lai un, tualeh khum gam a mikhuol ahi lai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nam khat akipat namdang kunga, tualeh leenggam khat apat leenggam dang kung a avahvai lai un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Koima’n amauh anuoisie ding aphal sih a, ahi, amauh ziehin leengte na phawhhil zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka sathau nusa khoisih unlen, ka guolneite bawlse sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum gama tung dingin kiel ahan a, neh ding mawngmawng a um sah ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amasanguah mi khat Joseph ngei asawl a, Ama khu suoh dinga zuain a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kengte kolbun in aliemsah ua, sia khainieng bulin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Athugen ahing tangtun masangsie in; Mangpa thuin ama aze etta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lengpan mi asawl a ahakhe sah a, mipite vaihawmpa’n ama azalen tahin apeisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’n a innsunga houtu ding leh, anei alam zousie tunga thunei dingin leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A miliente a ut thu thu a kaan ding leh, a upate pilna thu hil dingin ama abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel zong Izipt gam ah ahing lut a, tuachi’n Ham gam ah Jakob khuolzin bangin atam tadi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n amite nasatah in apungsaha, amelmate uh sanga hatzaw in abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman amite muda dingin Izipt mite lungtangte ahei pieh a, asuohte tunga lepchietah a bawl dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman asuoh Mosi asawl a Aaron ami tel toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amaute gel in chiemtenate alah uah abawl ua, tualeh Ham gam ah sillamdangte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aman miel asawl a, amiel sahta a; athu kal in ahel tasih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aman atuite uh sisan asuohsah a, angate uh ashisah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Agam uh ukengin ahing dimta a, aleengpa uh pindansung nangawn ah adimta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aman thu agen a, thou tampi ahing um a, tualeh hit zong agamsung pumpi uah ahing dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman akung uah guo taang in giel apie a, agamsung uah tunphe toh kithuo keh akesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Agrepguite uleh atheipi kungte uh asuhlup pieh a, agamsung ua singkungte nangawn asuhtan pieh sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aman thu agena, khauphete ahing um ua, khauphe nou simsengloute ahing um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaten agamsung pumpi ua, haichi zousie anegamta ua, aleigate uh anekhawng siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Agamsung ua taluchil zousie athat a, ahatna ga masapente uh zousie khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aman dangka leh sana toh amauh apuidoh a, tualeh Ama namte lah ah mihatlou khat zong a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amaute apawtdoh laitah un Izipt mite akipah mama uhi; Israelte zauna atung ua atuh zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aman Israelte lie dingin atung uah meilum akaisah a, zanlai chienga tanvah dingin meikuong apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Miten angen ua, vamimte apie a, Van ann in amauh ataisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aman suongpi apohkhisah a, tui ahing luongdoh a mun gawte ah lui bangin tui aluong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman athuchiem siengthou leh, asuohpa Abraham athei ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n amite khu nuomsatah in apuidoh ta a, a mi telte kipah kawm in apuidoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Aman namte gam khu amauh apeta a, amaun agam mite sepgimna aluota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun athuguotte azui ua, adanthute a nit theina ding uh ahi. Mangpa phat un. Mangpa pahtawi un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, Mangpa kungah kipahthu gen un, Ama ahoi ngal a, A khotuona kumtawn in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa silbawl thupitahte koi ahiei gen thei ding? Ahisihleh aphatna koi ahiei phuong thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaihawmnadih kem hoi mite ahampha uhi, hunchintenga dihtatna bawl mite toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, na mite na deisahnain kei hing thei ngitnget inlen; Na hundamna toh kei hing ve in aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mi telte hamphatna ka mu theina ding leh, Na namte kipahna a ka nuom theina ding leh, na goutante toh ka thupi khawm theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kapu ka pate uleh koute kana khielta ua, silgilou ka bawlta ua, giloutahin ka gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kapu leh pate un Izipt gama na sillamdang bawlte atheisiem sih ua, Na khotuona thupitah atheizing ta sih ua; Tuipi san gei ah Tungnung Pen tungah ahelta zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahivang in Mangpa’n Ama min zieh in amauh ahundamta hi; tuachi a amaun asilbawltheina thupitah atheisah theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman tuipi san aphawh a, akangsanta a, tuachi’n gamdai a pei bangin tui thuhpi ah amaute apui galkaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh mudate khut apat in ahundamta a, agalte uh khut apat in atankheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipi in amelmate uh atummangta a, khat zong asuohta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun athute agingta ua, ama phat in la asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh A silbawlte amanghil pai ua, alemguotnate angahzou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh gamdai ah agongsan mama ta ua, gamgaw mun ah Pasian aze etta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasian in anget uh apie a, hinanleh ahinna uah gawnna atun ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Agieh phuol uah Pasian misiengthou Mosi leh Aaron tungah athangsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitung in akam akah a Dathan avaltum a Abiram lawmte avuamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pawlpi lah uah mei ahing kuonga, tua meikuongin migiloute akatumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Horeb muol ah bawngnou lim abawl ua, milim kisunthu khu abeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tambangin amaun athupina u khu, hampane bawngtal lim khat toh ahengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izipt gam a sil thupitah tah bawlpa, ahundampa uh Pasian amanghilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ham gamsunga sillamdangtah leh Tuipi san gei a silchizathuoitah bawlpa amanghilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin sumang khava e, chiin athangpaina kiheimangsah dingin, atel Mosi khu alutna ding amasang ah ding kha laizang sih leh, ka sumang ding chi Ama’n agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua gam nuomtah khu asimmaw ua, athugente agingta thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A puon inn sung uah aphun ua, Mangpa thugen angaikhe nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuazieh im Aman akhut alaamtouta a, gamdai a amauh puasah dingin akichiem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ahah asuonte u’zong namte lah a pua sah ding leh, gam chin a athethang na dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute Peor mun a Baal toh akizop ua, mi shite kunga kithoina sa ane ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuabanga asilbawlte un Mangpa asulungthah ua, alah uah natna hipi ahing lengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Phinehas adingdoh a, thu anget pieh a, tuachi’n natna hi leng akhawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua asilbawl khu Phinehas a dingin, kumtawn a khang zousie tan a dingin dihtatna a sim ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amaun Meribah tuite ah Mangpa asulungthah ua, amaute ziehin Mosi tungah silhoilou atunghielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aziehpen a hagau tungah ahel ua, tuachi’n akam in thu kilawmlou agenkhata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mangpa’n akung ua sumang dinga thu apieh bangin, tua gam mite asumang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh namte lah ah akihalthang ua, asilbawlte uh azui zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amilim pasiente uh abie ua, tuate ama ua dingin thang ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi dawite kungah atapate uleh atanute un akithoi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mawnaneiloute sisan asuo ua, atapate uleh atanute uh nangawn Kanaan, milimte kungah kithoina in anei uh a, tua gam khu sisan a suhbua in ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuabangin amauh nasep mama in akisuthanghuoi ua, asilbawlte ngei uah kizua asuohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaziehin amite tungah Mangpa lungthahna akuongta a, agoutante akidahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman amaute namdangte khut ah apeta a, amauh mudaten atung uah vai ahawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amelmate un anuoisie ua, akhutnuoi uah akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aman amauh tampivei ahunkhie a, hinanleh alunggeelna uah atungah ahel ua, akhelnate zieh un suhngiem in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Khuchi pumpum in zong, akikouna thawmte uh azahpieh zel a, agentheinate uh angaisah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amaute ziehin athuhun athei ngitnget a, A khotuona thupidan dung zui in alungsim akisiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amauh suoh leh sal a puite zousiein amauh ahepisah nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian uh, hing hundam inlen, namte lah a kipat hing puikhawm in, Na min siengthou pahtawi ding leh, Na phatna a guolzou dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Mangpa Israelte Pasian kumtawn apat kumtawn tan in, phat in um hen, Mipi zousiein “Amen” chi hen, Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa kungah kipahthu gen un, aziehpen ama ahoi a, A khotuona kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa tatsa miten tuabangin gen uhen, melma khut a kipat a atatdoh miten;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suolam leh tumlam, simlam leh mallam gamteng akipat a apuikhawmten, kipahthu gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauh gamdai lampi ah, avahvai ua, tenna ding khopi mawngmawng amu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilkiel leh dangta in a hinna uh asung uah abata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n lungkham leh mangbang in Mangpa ahan ua, Aman agentheina ua kipat amauh ahunkhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman amauh mihing umna khuoa aten theina ding un, lampi tangtah ah apuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, mihingte’n Mangpa khu ahoina zieh leh, mihing tate tunga asillamdang bawlte zieh in, kipahthu gen uleh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman lunggul mama neite hinna ataisah a, tualeh hinna gilkielte silhoi in agilva sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miel nuoi leh, shina lim nuoi a toute, thuohgimna leh siakhau a kihente mama khu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian thu doua ahel zieh un, Tungnung Pen lemguotte asimmaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aman alungtangte uh sepgimnain akunsah a, apuasuh ua hinanleh panpi ding koima a um tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Lungkham sengin Mangpa ahan ua, Aman abuoina ua kipat amauh ahundoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman miel lah akipat leh, shina lim a kipat in amauh apuidoh a, a kaanna khaute uh asutanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw mihingten Mangpa khu ahoina zieh leh, mihing tate a dinga asillamdang bawlte zieh in, kipahthu gen uleh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman sum-eng kulkotkhate asusie a, akalna sia zawlte asutan ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihingte akhelna zieh uleh, agitlouna zieh un gimthuoh sah in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahinna un nehthei chinteng akidah a, shina kulkot anai zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n mangbang in Mangpa ahan ua, Aman agimthuohna ua pat amauh ahunkhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman athu asawl a amauh asudam a, a manthaina ua kipat amauh ahunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw mihingte’n Mangpa khu ahoina zieh leh, mihing tate a dinga asillamdang bawlte ziehin, kipahthu gen u leh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaun kipahthugenna kithoina lan uhenlen, asilbawlte nuomin phuongzah uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuipi tunga tembaw akitawl suh a, tuipi lientah tunga summet bawl a kivaite’n;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mangpa nasepte leh tuipi thuhtah nuoi a, asillamdang bawlte amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman thu apie a, tui kihawt sousang sah thei huipi alaangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuate vanlam ah akivawhtou ua, tui thuhpi ah akesuh zel uhi. Tuahsietna ziehin ahinna uh azunmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zukham bangin alang alangah ahawilen kawi ua, kimakhup dihdih in aum ua, umdan mawngmawng a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n mangbang sengin Mangpa ahan ua, Aman agentheina ua pat apuidoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aman huipi adaisah a, tui kihawtte zong adai duom zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi a adai dide tah zieh in akipah ua, tuachi’n Aman alunggul uh kuongkhawlna mun ah apui tung zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw mihingte’n Mangpa khu ahoina zieh leh, mihing tate mihingte dinga asillamdang bawlte zieh in, kipahthu gen uleh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mipi kikhawmte lah ah Ama pahtawi uhenlen, upa kikhawmte lah ah Ama phat uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aman luite gamdai asuohsah a, tuinahte zong leigaw asuohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Asunga tengte gitlouna ziehin, bu leh bal pienna gamte zong, bangma pien theilouna gamgaw asuohsahzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aman gamdai zong tui veina dil asuohsah a, gamgawna mun zong tuinah asuoh sah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua mun ah gilkielte atengsah a, tualeh amauten atenna ding uh khopi abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Loute ahou ua, grep huonte zong abawl ua, tuaten ga tampi hing piengte amu theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amauh aguolzawl a, nasatah in ahing pung ua, agantate uh khu akiem aphal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nuoisiena, suhgentheina leh lungkhamna zieh in, ahing kiem hiei hiei zel ua, suhngiem in ahing umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aman miliente tungah simmawna asungbuo a, lampi mawngmawng umlouna gamdai ah avahvai sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman mitasamte agentheina ua kipat in adomkangtou a, mun sangah akoitou a, a innkuonte uh belamhon bangin apungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Midihtatten tuakhu amu ua akipah ua; thulimlouna zousie in akam ahum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Koizong mipil pouma in tam silte akem hoi ding ua, Mangpa itna tulngailou atheisiem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pasian ka lungtang adet hi, la ka sa dinga ka thupina toh, ka hing phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tumgingte leh pehgingte aw, hing thou unlen, zingmawng phalvah phong ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa aw, mipite lah ah nangma ka hing phat dinga, namte lah ah nangma phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen na khotuona van khup hielin athupi a, Na thutahnain meilumte asunpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pasian vante tunglam peh ah tawisangin um inlen, Na thupina zong leitung pumpi ah pahtawi in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na itte hutkhiet a a um theina dingun, Na khut zietlam in hundam inlen, tualeh hing dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasian in asiengthounain thu agenta hi, “Ka nuom ding a Shekem khuo ka hawmdinga, Sukoth phaijang ka tekhen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead kei a ahi a, Manasseh kei a ahi; Ephraim ka sia lukhu ahi a, Juda pen ka dan petu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab khu ka kisilna bel ahi a, Edom tungah ka kedap ka pai ding a, Philistin tungah guolzouin ka kikou ding hi;”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kulpi nei khopi a hing puilut ding koi ahiei? Edom gam hing tun ding koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Pasian koute hing paikhepa nangma hilou na hiei mah? Aw Pasian ka galkapte utoh kuondoh nawnlou ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka buoina ua kipat in hing panpi in, mihing panpina pen bangmalou ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasian zal in hangsantah in ka dou ding ua; ka galte uh hing totchil pieh ding Ama ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka pahtawina Pasian, aw hamlou in um sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen migiloute kam leh mi solhatte kam kei hing dou in akikaah hi; Amaun zuou hat leiin ka kungah thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mudana thu in ahing imkuol ua tualeh azieh umloupiin ahing dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka itna thuhna in ahing hehte ahita uhi, Hinanleh kei pen thunget nalam ah ka kipe chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tambangin ka hoina sil hoilou in ahing thuh ua, ka itna khu mudana in ahing thuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangman atung uah migilou koi inlen, aziet lam ah hehmi ding sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atunga thukhenna a um chiengin, siemawtangin um henlen, athungetna zong khelna suoh heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Adamsung nite tom henlen, anasepna mun midangin tang hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atate pa neilou in um uhenlen, azi zong meithai in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atate vahvai ngitnget uhenlen, khutdaw uhen, a neh ding uh amun sete lah uah sui uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aleibatna pa’n anei zousie uh lahpieh sieng henlen; gamdang miten asepgim gate uh lahpieh hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama khotuo ding mi koima um vawtsih henlen, pa bei a um atate zong adeisah ding koima um sih hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahah asuonte uh suhmangin um uhenlen; khangtha hing um dingte lah ah amin uh thaimangin um uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Apu apate uh gitlouna khu Mangpa masang ah thei ngitnget in um henlen, anu khelna zong kithaimang sih hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaute thei zingna leitung apat suhmang ahi theina dingin, Mangpa masangah akhelnate uh um ngitnget hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen aman khotuona etsahna dan athei sih a, hinanleh lungtanga kingaisete atha theina dingin, migenthei leh tasamte asugenthei zaw leeng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi gausap nuom asah lamtah ahi zieh in, tuakhu ama tungah tu hen, guolzawlna adeilou ziehin, guolzawlna in ama gamlat hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman gausapna khu puon silbanga asil ziehin, tuakhu atahsa sungah tui bangin lut henlen, agu sungah sathau bangin lut hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hamsie khu ama a dingin asil ngitnget puonsil bang hi henlen, akigah zingna kawnggah bang hing hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuakhu kei hing hehte leh, ka hinna hing gensete tunga Mangpa thuhna hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, Nangman na min ziehin hing bawlpieh inlen, Na khotuona ahoi ziehin hing hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen kei genthei leh tasam ka hi a, ka sungah ka lungtang aliem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni him kiem bangin ka manga, khauphe bangin mutleng in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ann ngawl ziehin ka khup azaw gawpta a, ka tahsain thauna atahsap zieh in ka tha aneem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Agensiet uh ka hing hita a, ahing et chiengun alu uh ahing thinkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa ka Pasian aw hing panpi inlen, Na khotuona dungzuiin hing hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tami na khut ahi chi athei ua, Mangpa, Nangma bawl ahi chi a theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaun gausap uhenlen, hinanleh Nangman guolzawl in, athawdoh tahchieng un, zala uhenlen, hinanleh Na suohte nuom uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kei hing hehte zumna in tuom henlen, azalatna un puon bangin tuomkhum hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka kam in Mangpa uongtahin ka phat ding a, mi tampite lah ah Ama ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama gentheite zietlam ah ading ding a, ahinna mawpaite lah a kipat a hundam dingin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mangpa’n ka Mangpa kungah, Na melmate na kengphang ngahna a, ka bawl masangsie’n ka ziet lang ah tou in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Zion a kipat in na hatna leengchieng asawldoh dinga, na melmate lah ah nangman vaihawm in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mite khu na silbawltheina ni ah, amauh ut thuin akipe ding ua, zingmawng gilsunga kipat a, siengthou kilawmnain na khangdawng hina, daitui khu na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa akichiemta a, alungsim heng kia sih ding hi. “Nang pen Melkizedek umdan banga kumtawn siempu na hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa na zietlam a umin, Athangpaina ni ah, leengte asatpua sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman namte lah ah vai ahawm ding a, munchin ah mishi luong adim sah dinga, gam tampite ah lutangte asatphel lemlum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lam gei a luita tui adawn dinga, tuaziehin lutang khu atawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, Ken midihtatte kikhopna leh mipi kikhawmte lah ah, ka lungtang zousie in Mangpa ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa nasepte athupi a, tuate kipahna neite’n asuikhe zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anasep khu azatathuoi in athupi a, tualeh adihtatna khu kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman asillamdang bawlte thei ngitnget dingin abawla, Mangpa khu hepisiem leh lainatna a dim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Ama ging mite kungah neh ding apie a, Athuhun khu kumtawnin athei ngitnget ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A nasep thupidante amite kungah aphuongta a, namte agouluo ding ua apieh theina ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akhut nasepte khu thutah leh vaihawmnadih ahi a, Athuhilnate zousie amuonhuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuate khu kumtawn kumtawn a dingin adet a, thutahna leh dihtatna toh bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman amite kungah tatna ahing sawl a, athuhun khu kumtawn a dingin thu apie a, Siengthou leh zatat huoi khu Amin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa giin khu pilna bul ahi a, athupieh zuite poumain theisiemna hoitah anei uhi. Ama phatna khu kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, Mangpa giing mi, athupiehte nasataha kipahpi mi ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahah asuonte leitungah mi hattah ahi ding ua, midihtatte khang guolzawl in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A suonte khu leitungah mi hattah ahi ding ua, midih hahlesuonte khu guolzawl in aum ding hi. Adihtatna kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midih a dingin mielna lah ah vah ahing tangkhe zel ding a, ama khu mi hepisiem, lainatna a dim, dihtattah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi hoiin deisahna asulang zela, aleitawisah hi, ama tungthu pilvangtahin angaituo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangchihtanin suhling in a um sih dinga, midihtatte pen kumtawn a theizingin a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuthang hoiloute azau sih ding ua, alungtangte uh Mangpa muongin adet zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Alungtang uh adet a, amelmate uh tunga adei uh, hing tung amu masangsie uh azau sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaun ahawmzah ua, gentheite kungah apie ua, adihtatna uh kumtawnin a um ding a, akii u’khu pahtawina toh tawisangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilouin tuakhu amu dinga alungthah ding a; Aha agawt dinga, azunmang ding hi. Migiloute lunggul pen a mangthang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, Aw nou Mangpa suohte, Ama phat unlen, Mangpa min phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu a kipat kumtawn dongin Mangpa min phat in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuohna lam apat, nitumna lam dongin Mangpa min phat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa khu nam zousiete tunglam peh ah aum a, athupina zong vante tunglam peh ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tunglam sangtah a um, Mangpa i Pasian uh bang koi ahiei um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van a sil umte leh lei a sil umte en dinga, kingaingiem ama bang koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman migentheite leivui a pat in akaithou a, mi tasamte vut vum a kipat in adomkang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amauh miliente kunga atousah theina dingin, amite lah a miliente toh atoukhawm sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman numei chiing kungah inn apie a, tualeh nuomtaha um tualeh ta neinuin asiem zel hi. Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat Israelte apawtdoh ua, Jakob innkuonte hamtuom namte lah a kipat a apawtdoh lai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda khu Pasian mun siengthou ahi a, Israel khu avaihawmna leenggam ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipi in amu a ataimangta a; Jordan lui zong aleluonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangte belamtal bangin akidieng ua, muolneute zong belam noute bangin adieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw nang tuipi bang achileh taimang na hiei? Aw Jordan lui bang dinga nua luonkie na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tangte aw bang achileh belamtal banga kidieng nahi uoi? Muolneute aw bang achileh belamnoute banga kidieng na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw nang leitung, Mangpa masang ah kiling inlen Jakob Pasian masangah kiling in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman suongpi zong dil asuohsah a, meisa suong zong tuinah a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa kou hing pe louin, koute hing pe louin, Na khotuona leh na thutahna ziehin, thupina khu Na min pe zawin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh a namdangten “A Pasian uh heia um ahiei,” ahing chi sese ding uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh ka Pasian uh van ah a um a, Aman a ut ut abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A milimte ukhu sana leh dangka akibawl, mihingte khut suoh ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kam a nei ua, hinanleh ahamthei sih ua, mit a nei ua, hinanleh amuthei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bil a nei ua, hinanleh a za thei sih ua, nahkuo a nei ua, hinanleh bangma gimnam anam thei tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khut a nei ua, hinanleh bangma atham thei sih ua, keng a nei ua, hinanleh apei thei sih ua, alawl uoh zong ham theina a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabang a milim bawlmite khu a milim bawlte bang ahi ua, tuate muong pouma zong tuabang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Israel Mangpa muong in. Ama khu Ama uh panpipa leh a phaw uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Aaron innkuonte, Mangpa muongun, Ama muongte panpipa leh a phaw uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou Mangpa zaute aw, Mangpa muongun, Ama khu ama muongte panpipa leh a phaw uh, ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n eite ang thei ngitnget a, ahing guolzawl ding hi. Israel innkuon a guolzawl ding a, Aaron innkuon zong a guolzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman Mangpa zaudan siemte alien aneu a guol zawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n noute a hing pungsah deu deu ding a, noute leh na tate utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lei leh van siempa Mangpa’n noute hing guolzawl hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Van, vante nangawn Mangpa a ahi a, Aman leitung khu mihingtate kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mishiten Mangpa aphat sih ua, mun sip a peisuhte mawngmawngin aphat thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh eiten tu a kipat kumtawn dongin, Mangpa iphat ta ding uhi. Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa ka it hi, aziehpen Aman ka ngetna leh ka aw aza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei lang a bil ahingdaw ziehin, ka damsung teng in Ama ka han ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shina khauhuolten ahing viel a, Sheol natnaten ahing man a, Lungkhamna leh danaten ahing tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuatahin Mangpa min ka han a, “Aw Mangpa ka hinna hundam in” chi in ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa khu mi hepisiem leh dihtat ahi a, Ahi, i Pasian khu lainatna dim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n mi mawlte ahumbit zel a, suhngiem in ka um a, Aman ahing hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw ka hinna, na khawlna ah kinua le kia ta in, aziehpen Mangpa’n na tungah hoitah in abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa nangman ka hinna khu shina lah ah, Ka mitte khu hitui lah ah, tualeh ka kengte puana lah a kipat in na humbit ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing gam a Mangpa masangah ka vah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka gingta a tuaziehin thu ka genta hi, “Nasatah a suhgenthei in ka um hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kinaw hehu zieh in, “Mi zousie zuouthei ahi uh,” ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tung a silhoi tampi abawl zousiete ziehin Mangpa kungah bang ahiei ka pieh thuh thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hundamna nou ka la dinga, Mangpa min ka lou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa kunga ka thuchiemte, Amite zousie masangah ka tangtun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A misiengthoute shina khu Mangpa mitmu in amanpha mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Mangpa adihtahin kei na suohpa ka hi a, Na suoh ka hi a, Na suohnu tapa ka hi. Nangman ka henkol bu na hing sutpiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kipahthugenna sillat na mai ah ka hing lan dinga, Mangpa min ka lou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa kunga ka thuchiemte amite zousie masangah ka tangtun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa inn huongsung leituol ah, Aw Jerusalem, na kholaitah ah ka tangtun ding hi. Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou nam zousiete aw, Mangpa phat un, Nou michinte aw, Ama pahtawi un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen itung uah akhotuona athupi hi; tualeh Mangpa thutah khu kumtawn in a um ding hi. Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa kungah kipahthu gen un, aziehpen Ama ahoi hi, A khotuona kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin Israelten, “Khotuona kumtawn in a umden ding,” chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aaron innkuonten, “A khotuona kumtawn in a umden ding,” chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa zaudan siem zousie in, “A khotuona kumtawn in a umden ding hi,” chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mangbat lai in Mangpa ka han a, Mangpa’n ahing dawnga, mun awngthawl ah ahing koita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa kei lam a pang ahi a, ka zau sih ding hi; Mihingin bang ahing law thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa khu keilam a pang, a hing panpipa ahi a, tuaziehin ahing mudate tung a ka deite ka mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihing tahsan sangin, Mangpa muon ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lengtapate tahsan sangin, Mangpa muon ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nam chin in ahing imkuol ua, hinanleh Mangpa min in amauh ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amauten ahing imkuol ua, ning chinteng ah ahing imsuoh ua; Mangpa min in amauh ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuoi bangin ahing tuom suoh ua, linglah meikuong bangin suhmit in a um pai ua, Mangpa min in amauh ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pua na dingin nasatah in ahing sawn ua, hinanleh Mangpa’n ahing panpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa khu ka hatna leh ka la ahi a, ka hundamna zong ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nuomna leh hundamna aw khu midihtatte puon inn ah a um a, “Mangpa khut zietlam in hangsantah in abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa khut zietlam tawisangin a uma, Mangpa khut zietlam in hangsantah in guolzawna abawl zel hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka shi sih dinga, ka hing ding hi, Mangpa silbawlte ka phuongzah zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa’n nasatahin ahing thunun a, hinanleh shina kungah ahing pedoh hiel sam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dihtatna kulkotkhate hing honpieh un, khunah ka lut dinga, Mangpa ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tami Mangpa kotpi ahi a, midihtatte alut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangma ka hing phat ding hi, aziehpen Nangman na hing dawngta a, ka hundamna na hing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Innlam mite suong deilou khu, aninga suong poimaw pen ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tami Mangpa bawl ahi a, i mitmu ah alamdang mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami Mangpa ni siem ahi a, tam sungah nuom in ikipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka hing ngen hi tuin hing hundam in, Aw Mangpa ka hing ngen hi, tuin vangphatna hing sawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa min a hing pei khu ahampha hi, Mangpa inn a kipat in nang ka hing guolzawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mangpa khu Pasian ahi a, Aman khovah ahing peta hi, kithoina ding khu khauhuolin, maitam kiite ah khi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang ka Pasian na hi a, Ka hing phat ding hi, Nang ka Pasian na hi a, ka hing pahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mangpa kungah kipahthu gen un. Aziehpen ama ahoi a, A khotuona kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lampi a kisuthanghuoi lou a, Mangpa danzuite ahampha uhi, agamtatna genbangloute ahampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Athutheisah zuite leh lungtang zousie a Ama suite ahampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaun thulimlouna mawngmawng abawl sih ua, Alampite azui zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangman phatuom ngaitah a Na thuzawna thute Keem dingin koute thu Na hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw na thuguotte zui dingin ka umdante suhkip in um thei leh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuahun chiengin ka zala sih dinga, Na thupiehte zousie khawh ka sah hun chiengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungtang dihtah puoin ka hing phat ding, Na vaihawmna dihte ka zil hun chieng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na thuguotte ka zui ding hi, Aw hing nuasie den sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khangdawng in bangchin ahiei a umdan asuhsiengthou thei ding? Na thu dungzui a umdan kem hoiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungtang zousie toh Nangma ka hing sui hi, Na thupiehte a kipat hing pielmang sah vawt sin aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tunga ka khellouna dingin, Na thu ka lungtang ah ka kemta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, Nang na hampha hi, Na danthuguotte hing zilsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kam a pawt vaihawmnate zousie, ka kam in ka phuongdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na thu theisahna lam ah nuom kasa a, hausatna zousie a nuom ka sah bang hiel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na thuzawna thute ka ngaituo ngitnget dinga, Na lampite ka ngaisah belap nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thuguotte ah ka kipah dinga Na thu ka manghil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hin theina dingin leh Na thu ka zui theina dingin, Na suoh tungah hoitah in bawlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na danthute apat sillamdangte ka mu theina dingin, ka mitte hing suhvah pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitungah khuolzin taambang ka hibou hi, Na thupiehte kei akipat phuol sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangchihlaipoua, Na vaihawmnate ka ngainat ziehin ka hinna akehgawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi kiliensah hamse thuohte khu na phawhhil a, Na thupiehte pielmangsan te khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gensiatna leh simmawnate kei apat lamangin, Na thutheisahte ka zui zingna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lengtapate zong a tou ua a hing gensie uh, Hinanleh na suohin na danthute ka ngaituo zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na thutheisahte zong ka kipahna ahi a, tuate khu kei hing thuhilte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hinna khu leivui ah abeh chinten hi, Na thu bang zel in hing suhal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka umdante ka phuongdohta a Nangman na hing dawng ta a, Na thugousiete hing hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na thuzawna lampi umdan hing theisiemsah in, tuachi’n na sillamdang bawl thute ka ngaituo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lungkhamna ziehin ka hinna a zunmang zel hi, Na thu bang zelin hing suhat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Umdan zuouhuoi kei akipat lamang inlen; hepitahin na dan hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thutah lampi ka telta a, Na vaihawmnate ka masangah ka pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na thutheisahte ah kabeh chinten hi, Aw Mangpa hing zalasah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na thupieh lam ah ka tai ding hi, aziehpen ka lungtang nang suhlet pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Na thuguotte zuidan hing zilsah in, tuahileh atawp tanin ka zui thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Theisiemna hing pie in, tuachi’n na dan ka kem hoi dinga, Ahi, ka lungtang zousie in ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na thupieh lampi ah hing peisah in, khunah kipahna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na thutheisah lam ah ka lungtang kiheisah inlen, huoihamna lam ah hilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Sil bangmalou enlou dingin ka mitte kiheisah inlen, Na lampi ah hing suhal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na thu khu na suohpa kungah sukip inlen, Nangma giinna a hing kipelutpa kungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka giinpen gensietna khu lamang in, Na vaihawmnate lah ahoi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Envawi, Na thuzawna thute khu ka lunggul a Na dihtatna in hing suhhal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na khotuonate zong ka kungah hing tung hen, na thubang zel in Na hundamna ngei khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken ahing gensete dawnna ding ka nei ding hi, Na thu lah ka muong ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thutah ka kam apat lamang sieng sin, Na vaihawmnate ka kineppi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n na dan thu kumtawn kumtawn in ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh zalentahin ka vah dinga, Na thuzawnathute ka sui zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na thutheisahte leengte mai ah ka gen dinga, ka zum sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Na thupiehte ah ka kipah ding hi, tuate ken ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Na thu peihte lam ah ka khut zong ka zah tou ding hi; tuakhu ka ngainat ahi. Tualeh na thugousiete ka ngaituo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na suoh kunga na thuchiem thei ngitnget in, tua thu ah kei na hing kinem sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka gimthuoh chiengin tami ka lung muonna a hi; Na thuin hinna ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Mikiliensahten kisathei tahin hing khelhou nan uleh, ken na danthu ka pielsan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, nidang lai a Na vaihawmnate ka theizing a ka kihamuon zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Na dan taisan migiloute ziehin lungthahna nasatahin, ahing buohkhum zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ka khuolzinna inn ah Na danthupiehte ka la ahi ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Aw Mangpa zankhang laiin zong na min ka theizing a, na dan zong ka zui ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na thuhilna thute kavom zing zieh in, tami ka neita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Nang ka tanvou na hi a, Na thu ka zui ding kana chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ka lungtang zousie in na deisahna ka hing ngen hi, na thubang zelin hing khotuo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka umdante ka ngaituo a. Na thutheisahna lam a kihei in ka kal kasuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Na thupiehte zui dingin ka kinaw mama a, ka kiheh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Migilou khauhuol in a hing kaan lawmta a, Hinanleh Na dan ka manghil tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Na vaihawmna dihtah ziehin, zankhang laiin kipahthu gen dingin ka thou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Nangma hing giingte zousie leh na thuhilna zuite pouma ka lawmte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Aw Mangpa leitung pumpi Na khotuonain adim hi; Na danthupiehte hing hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na thu dungzui in na suoh Na bawlhoi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Vaihawmna siemna leh theina hing hilin, Na thupiehte ka gingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Suhgenthei a ka um masangin, Kana vahmang kha zel a, tui’n vang na thu ka zuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Nang pen na hoi a, silhoi na bawl zel hi; Na thuguotte hing hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Mi kisatheiten ka tungah zuou aphuo ua, hinanleh kenvang ka lungtang zousie in, na thuhilnate ka vom hoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Alungtang uh sungthau bangin athau a, hinanleh kei pen na danthu ah kakipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Na danthute ka zil theina dinga, suhgenthei a kana um khu kei dingin ahoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Na kama dan pawt khu, kei a dingin sana leh dangka tul tampi sangin ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Na khutin na hing siemta a, ka lim leh mel na hing nabawl hi. Na thupiehte ka zil theina dingin theisiemna hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Nangma hing giingten kei ahing mu chiengun akipah ding uhi, Na thu ka kineppi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na vaihawmnate khu adih a, tualeh nangman ginumnain na hing sugenthei hi chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Na suoh kunga na thuchiem dungzui in, na khotuona tulngailou khu ka lungmuonna ding hi hen, chiin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Ka hin theina dingin, Na khotuona khu, ka kungah hing tung hen, Na dan lah ka kipahna ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Mi kisatheite zalatsah in um uhen, aziehpen amaun azieh beiin dihloutahin kei ahing bawlsie uhi, hinanleh kenvang na thuhilna thute ka ngaituo zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Nangma hing giingte leh, Na thutheisahna theite’n kei lam hing nga uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Ka zalatlouna dingin, na danthute ah ka lungtang gensietna beiin um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Na hundamna ngai in ka hinna aba mama a, hinanleh Na thu ka kineppi ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />Na thu suinain ka mitte avai gawpta a, “Bangchih chienga kei hing hamuon ding na hiei?” ka chi ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />Meikhu tunga kihang gaw savun zuthawl bang ka hita hi, hinanleh na thuguotte ka manghil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Na suoh damsung ni ding bangtan hi ding ahiei? Kei hing sugentheite tungah bangchih chienga, thukhenna bawl ding na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />Mi kiliensahten ka kiehna dingin, Na dan banglouin kokhuh atou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Na thupieh poumate a muonhuoi hi; amaun dihloupi in ahing sugenthei uhi, hing panpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />Amaun leitunga kipat ahing sumang dihdihta uhi, hinanleh ken vang na thuhilnate ka taisan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />Na itna tulngailou dungzui in hing suhal in, tuachi’n Na kam a thutheisahna ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na thu kumtawn a dingin, van ah suhdet ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="90" style="v" />Na ginumna akhang akhangin a um ding hi, leitung na sukip a, a umdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="91" style="v" />Tuate khu tunitan in, Na thupieh dungzui in aum gige uhi; aziehpen tuate na suohte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" />Na dan khu ka kipahna hilou hileh, ka gimthuohna ah ka mangthaita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="93" style="v" />Na thuhilnate ka manghil ngai sih ding hi, tuate zieh in hinna na hing petathuoi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="94" style="v" />Nanga ka hi, hing hundam in, Aziehpen na thuhilnate ka suikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="95" style="v" />Migilouten kei hing suhmang tum in ahing ngah uhi, hinanleh kenvang na thutheisahnate ka ngaituo zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" />Hoibukimna zousie tawpna ka muta a; hinanleh na thupieh khu alien mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="97" style="v" />Oh! na dan it hina va-ia ing e, tami sun nitum a ka ngaituo ngitnget khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="98" style="v" />Nangman na thupiehte ziehin ahing doute sanga pilzawin na hing bawl a; kumtawn a ka kunga aum ngitnget zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="99" style="v" />Ang hiltute zousie sangin theisiemna ka neizaw hi, Na thutheisahte ka ngaituo ahi zel zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="100" style="v" />Na thuhilnate ka vomhoi ziehin tehsete sangin theisiemna ka neizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" />Na thu ka zui theina dingin, lampi gilou a ka kengte akalsuon mawngmawng ka phal ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="102" style="v" />Nangman na hing zilsah zieh in, Na vaihawmna akipat ka pielmang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="103" style="v" />Na thute kei a ding in hum hina va-ia e, ahi, ka kam a dingin khuoizu sangin ahum zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="104" style="v" />Na thuhilna thute apat in theisiemnate ka nei a, tuaziehin umdan dihlou pouma ka huo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" />Na thu khu ka kenga dingin meivah ahi a, ka lampi a dingin vah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="106" style="v" />Na vaihawmna dihtatte zui dingin ka kichiemta a, ka sudetta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" />Nasatah a suhgenthei in ka um hi, Aw Mangpa, na thu bangzel in hing suhal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="108" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka kam kiphalna silpiehte hing pompieh dingin ka hing ngen hi; tualeh Na vaihawmnate hing hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="109" style="v" />Ka hinna ka khut ah a um ngitnget a, hinanleh na dan ka manghil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="110" style="v" />Migilouten ka awhna dingin thang akam ua, hinanleh na thuhilnathute ka pielsan ngaisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="111" style="v" />Na thutheisahte kumtawn a ka gouluo ding bangin ka lata a, ka lungtang sunuompen ahi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="112" style="v" />Na danthupiehte atawp donga semkhe ngitnget dingin, ka lungtang ka kiheisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" />Lungsim thuop ni neite ka huo a, hinanleh na danthu ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="114" style="v" />Nangma ka kibuhna mun leh ka phaw na hi a, Na thu ka kinepna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="115" style="v" />Nou silgilou bawlte, hing peisan un, Ka Pasian thupiehte zui ding ka hitaah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="116" style="v" />Ka hin theina dingin Na thu bangzelin hing tuzing inlen, ka kinepna ah muolphouin hing umsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="117" style="v" />Hing tudet in tuachi’n ka bit ding hi, tualeh na thuguotte ka zui ngitnget ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" />Na thuguotte akipat a pielkhete zousie na deisih a, asolbawlna ulah zuouthu ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="119" style="v" />Leitunga migilou zousie sia-eeh bangin na sumang zel a, tuazieh in Na thutheisahte ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="120" style="v" />Nangma zau in ka tahsa akithing a, Na vaihawmnate zong ka zau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" />Thudih in vai ka hawma, dihtattahin ka bawl zel hi, a hing nuoisiete khut ah hing nuasie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="122" style="v" />Na suoh tungtang thu ah ahoina dingin, theipipa in pang inlen, mi kiliensahte’n hing nuoisie sih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="123" style="v" />Na hundamna etna in ka mit avai gawpta a, Na dihtatna thu etna zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="124" style="v" />Na khotuona dungzuiin na suoh tungah bawl inlen, Na thuguotte hing hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="125" style="v" />Na suohpa ka hi a, na thutheisahte ka theisiemna dingin, theisiemna hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" />Mangpa nang dingin nasep ahunta hi; Na dan bangmalouin abawlta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="127" style="v" />Adihtah in sana leh sana siengset sangin, na thupiehte ka it zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="128" style="v" />Tuaziehin sil zousie thu a na thuhilnathu pouma, adihin ka thei a, umdan dihlou pouma ka huo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" />Na theipina te alamdanga, Tuaziehin ka hinna in a vom hoi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="130" style="v" />Na thu hilchienna in vahna apie a, mi mawlte kungah theisiemna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="131" style="v" />Ka kam ka kaah a ka hai hut hut hi, Na thupiehte ka lunggul zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" />Kei lam hing nga inlen, hing hepi in, Na min itte tunga na bawl zel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="133" style="v" />Na thu bang zel in hing kalsuon sah inlen, gitlouna mawngmawng in ka tungah thu neisah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="134" style="v" />Mihing suhgentheina a kipat hing tandoh in, tuachi’n na thuhilnate ka zui thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="135" style="v" />Na suoh tungah na mel vah sah inlen, na danthute hing hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="136" style="v" />Mite’n na dan a zuilou zieh un, ka mit a pat in hituite luitui bangin aluong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nang na dihtat a, tualeh na vaihawmnate zong adih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="138" style="v" />Nangman napieh na thutheisahte khu, adihtat a aginum mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="139" style="v" />Ka phatuomngaina in ahing sugamta hi, ahing douten na thu amanghiltah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="140" style="v" />Na thu khu asiengthou mama a, tua ziehin Na suohin ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="141" style="v" />Mi neu leh simmawhuoi ka hi a, hinanleh na thuhilnate ka manghil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" />Na dihtatna khu kumtawn dihtatna ahi a, Na dan zong thutah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="143" style="v" />Buoina leh mangbatna in ahing buohkhum ta a, hinanleh na thupiehte ka kipahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="144" style="v" />Na thutheisahna khu kumtawn dihtatna ahi a, theisiemna hing pie in, tuachi’n ka hing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" />Ka lungtang zousie in ka hing han hi, Mangpa aw hing dawngin, Na danthute ka kemhoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="146" style="v" />Nangma ka hing han hi, hing hundam in, tuachi’n na thutheipinate ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="147" style="v" />Zingmawng phalvah masangin ka thou a, panpina ngen in ka kikou a, Na thu ka kineppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="148" style="v" />Na thu ka ngaituo theina dingin, zanven sung pumpi ka mitte ahah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="149" style="v" />Na itna hepina bang zel in, ka aw ngaikhie inlen, na vaihawmnadih bangzel in hing suhal-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" />Gitlouna delte’n ahing nai deu deu uh hi, amaute na dan apat agamla uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="151" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangma na nai a, Na thupiehte zousie thudih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="152" style="v" />Na thutheisahte tungtang ahileh, kumtawn a dinga suhdet ahita chi, nidanglai peh akipat in kana theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" />Ka gentheina ngaituo inlen, hing hunkhie in, aziehpen na dan ka manghil ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="154" style="v" />Ka tungtang thu hing gen pieh inlen, hing tandoh inlen, Na thu bang zelin hing suhal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="155" style="v" />Migiloute apat hundamna agamla hi, aziehpen na danthu asui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="156" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na khotuo na khu athupi a, na vaihawmna dungzuiin hing suhal zel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" />A hing sugentheite leh a hing doute tampi ahi ua, hinanleh na thutheisahte ka pielmangsan ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="158" style="v" />Lepchietah a bawlte ka en a, ka lungkim sih hi. Na thu azuilou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="159" style="v" />Na thuhilna thute ka it dan ngaituo inlen, Aw Mangpa na itna hepina dungzuiin hing suhal zel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="160" style="v" />Na thu kigawmkhawmte khu abawn in thutah ngen ahi a, na vaihawmna dihtahte zousie kumtawn in a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" />Lengtapaten azieh beiin ahing sugenthei uh a, hinanleh ka lungtang khu na thute zau in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="162" style="v" />Gallah sum mupa kipah bangin na thu ah ka kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="163" style="v" />Zuouthu ka huo a, ka kidah hi, hinanleh na dan ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="164" style="v" />Na vaihawmna dihtahte zieh in, ni khat in sagi vei ka hing phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" />Na dan itten hamuonna thupitah anei ua, bangmain akipalpua sah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="166" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na hundamna ki nem in, Na thupiehte bangin ka bawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="167" style="v" />Ka hinna in na thutheipinate azui zel a; tuate ka ngaina mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="168" style="v" />Na thuhilnate leh na thutheipinate ka zui zel hi, aziehpen ka umdan zousie na masang ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka kikouna thawm na masangah hing tung henlen, Na thu bang zelin theisiemna hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="170" style="v" />Hepi ka ngetna na masangah hing tung henlen, Na thu bang zel in hing hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="171" style="v" />Ka kam in phatna thu agen ding a, Na danthute nang zilsah zel zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="172" style="v" />Ka leiin na thu lain sa hen, Na thupieh zousie dihtatna ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="173" style="v" />Na khut in kei hing panpi heh, Na thuhilnate ka teltah zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="174" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na hundamna ka lunggul mama hi; Na dan khu ka kipahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="175" style="v" />Ka hinna khu hing hen, tuachi’n, Nang ahing phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" />Belam mang bangin kana vahmangta a, Na suoh hing sui in, aziehpen Na thupiehte ka manghil ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mangbatna ah Mangpa ka han a, Aman ahing dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa kam zuouthei leh solhat lei apat in,” ka hinna hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Oh! nang lei solhat, nang kungah bang a hing pie un, bang ahing law ding uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihat thaltang hiemte leh Junipar sing mei-am toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Meshek gam ah khuolzin tambang ka hi a, Kedar puon inn lah ah ka um a ka tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lemna huo a deiloute lah ah kana teng sawt seng khata hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ken lemna ka dei a, hinanleh kei ka hamkhah chiengin amaute kidou a ut zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tangte langah ka mit ka dahtou sah ding hi, Heilanga kipan in ahiei keima panpina hing tun ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei hing ki panpina pen, Mangpa lei leh van siempa akipat hing tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman na kengte akitaal aphal sih dinga, nang hing chingpa a lusu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngaivawi Israel chingpa khu alusu sih dinga, aimu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa khu nang hing chingpa ahi a, Mangpa khu na ziet lam a nang hing liepa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sunlai chiengin nisa in ahing kasih dinga, zanlai chiengin zong hapi in ahing khawkha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n sil hoilou chinteng akipat ahing veng dinga, na hinna ahing kep pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n na pawt leh na lut aveng ding hi tu a kipat kumtawn dongin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mangpa inn ah haw vai” chia ka kunga agen chiengun ka kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem na kulkotpi sungah ka kengte uh ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem khopi khu, dettah a gawmkhawm khopi khat bang a kilam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khunah namte, Mangpa namte, Israelte kunga thutheisah bangin, Mangpa kunga kipahthu gen dingin apeitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen khunah vaihawmna dingin Mangtouphate akidaw a, David innkuonte Mangtouphate khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Jerusalem hamuonna dingin thunget pieh un, nang hing itte alawching ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kulbang sungah lungmuonna um henlen, na leeng innpi sungah lawchinna um hen.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka sanggamte leh ka lawmte ziehin, “Na sungah hamuonna um hen;” tuin ka chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa i Pasian uh inn zieh in, na hoina ding ka sui ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Nang vante a tengpa, Nang ma lam ka hing entou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai vawi, suohten apute uh khut lam a et bang uleh, suohnu mit in api khut lam a et zingbangun, koute mit in zong Mangpa ka Pasian uh lam a en ngitnget hi, Na hing khotuo masang sie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Koute hing khotuo inlen, Aw Mangpa koute hing khotuo in, aziehpen nasatah a simmawna in ka dimta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hinna uh mi nuomsate simmawna leh, mi kiliensahte musitnain adim siengta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ei lam a pang Mangpa hilou hileh, tuin Israelten chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miten ahing dou lai un, ei lam a pang Mangpa hilou hileh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum hun laiin eite ahing hingvalta ding uh, itung ua athangpai lai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum hun lai ma in, tuiten ahing tummangta ding a, tui hattah in ihinna uh a tummangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuahun lai main tuipi hattah in ihinna uh atummangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sa sielneh ding banga akam sung ua hing pelut loupa Mangpa phat in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thang kamte thang apat vate asuohtat bangin ihinna uh asuohtata hi, Thangte aseta a, eite isuohtata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eite hing panpi pa khu, Mangpa lei leh van siempa a hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa muongte khu, Zion tang suhling guollou kumtawn a um ngitnget bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tangte Jerusalem kimvel a aum bangin, Mangpa khu a mite kimvel ah, tua kipat kumtawn in aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen gitlouna leengchieng khu, midihtat gam tat tungah akinga sih dinga, khuchilouin vang midihtatten akhut un gitlouna azam kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Mangpa mi hoite tungah silhoi bawl inlen, lungtanga dihtatte tungah zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Alampi kawite lam a pielte ahileh pen, Mangpa’n silbawlkhielte toh apuimang ding a; Israel tungah lungmuonna um hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n saltangte Zion a ahing nuo puikia laiin, mang mantute bang ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hunlai in ikam uh nuina in adim a, ilei u’zong lungnop lasahna in adim hi. Tua hunlai in namchinte lah ah Mangpa’n ama ua dingin, “Sil thupitahte abawl pieh ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi, Mangpa’n eite a dingin sil thupite ahing bawlpieh a, tuaziehin i kipah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Mangpa sal a ka tan uh hing puikia inlen, Simlam luite bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hitui luong kawm a haichi tuten, lungnuom tahin a at ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kap kawm a buchi puo a kuonkhe ten, lungnopna bu phaite puoin nuomsatahin ahing kinuahle ngeingei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa’n inn alam sihleh, alam miten asemgim thawn giap uhi; Mangpa’n khopi aven sihleh aveng mite ahah thawn giap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingmawng matah a thou a, vaigei tah a tou a, sepgimna tanghou na neh uh nou a dingin athawn giap ahi, tuabangin Aman a itte khu a imusah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngaivawi tate khu Mangpa apata igoutan uh ahi a, tualeh gil a ga zong akipahman ahing pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatlai tate khu mihat khut a, thaltangte bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Athal bawm dim a thaltang nei mite ahampha uhi, kulpi kotkha a agalte toh akihou lai un zong azala sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa giing poumaten nuom asa uhi, alampi zuiten.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na khut sepgim ga na ne ding a, kipah tahin na um dinga, navah tahin zong na um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na zi zong na innsung a grepgui ganuom mama bang ahi dinga, na tate zong na dawkang kimvel a Olive selte bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngaivawi Mangpa giing mi khu tuabanga guolzawl in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n Zion a kipat in ahing guolzawl ding a, tualeh na damsung tengin Jerusalem hoina na mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi, na tute na mu ding a, Israel tungah hamuonna um hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka naupan lai a kipat mi’n tamveipi ahing sugimta uh,” Israelte’n tuin chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka naupan lai a kipat in mi’n tamveipi ahing suhgentheita uhi; hinanleh ahing zou tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lou kai miten ka eljang ah lou akai ua, aloukaina kuohte uh asausah thei mama uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa adihtat a, Aman migiloute khauhuol asattanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion mudate pouma zalatsah in um uhenlen, taizahsah in um uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaute khu inntung a hampa pou akhanlet masanga vuoi zel bangin um uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuate in bu at mi in akhut asudim ngai sih a, buphai khawm mi in zong a angsung asudim ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa guolzawlna na tung uah umta hen, “Mangpa min in ka hing guolzawl uhi chiin, akung ua va peiten zong achi ngai sam sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa tuithuhtah apat in ka hing han hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa ka aw za inlen, ka ngetna za dingin na bil hing daw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa nang khelnate na chiemte leh, koi ahiei ding zou ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh na kungah ngaidamna a um hi, giin a na um theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa ka ngah ngitnget a, ka hinna in angah hi, tualeh athu zong ka kineppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Galveng miten zingmawng angahla sang un, ka hinna in Mangpa angahla zaw hi. Ka chi ahi, veng miten zingmawng khovah a ngahla sang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Israel Mangpa ah kinem in, aziehpen Mangpa kungah khotuona aum hi, tualeh Ama kungah tatna kichingtah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Aman Israel akhelna zousie apat atan khe ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka lungtang akisathei sih a, ka mitte zong asangha sih hi; sil thupite leh kei a dinga sillamdang taluote ah zong ka kikumthaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naupang nawineh tawpta anu kunga um bangin, ka hinna khu ka sungah naupang nawineh tawpta bangin asip dide in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Israel Mangpa ah kinem un, tua kipat kumtawn dongin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa David leh, athuohgimna zousie thei ngitnget in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa kunga akichiemtah dan leh, Jakob Pasian hattah kunga akihahsiel dante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka umna inn pindan sung ah ka lut vawt sih dinga, ka lupna tungah zong ka kaltou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mitte ka imu sah sih dinga, ka mitvunte zong ka imutsuoh sah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa ading mun khat ka mudoh masangsie, Jakob Pasian hattah tenna ding munkhat,” achi khu thei zingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />En un, Ephrathah ah tami ka za ua, gammang sing lah ah ka muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Abiehbuhte ah i haw ding ua, Akeng ngahna bul ah Ama i be ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Mangpa thou inlen, na khawlna mun ah pei in, Nang leh na hatna bawm toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na siemputen dihtatna puonbangin sil u’henlen; na misiengthoute nuom in kikou uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na suoh David ziehin, na sathau nupa mai kiheimang sah nawn sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa khu David kungah thutahin akichiem ta a, akiheimangsan sih ding hi. “Na tate lah akhat na leengtoupha ah ka tousah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tapaten ka thuhun azui ua, ka thutheipina akung ua ka hil dingte azui uleh, atapate uh zong na leengtoupha ah kumtawn in ka tousah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n Zion atelta hi, Aman atenna mun dingin adei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tami kumtawn a ka khawlna mun ding ahi a, ka deitelna mun ahi a, tanah ka tengden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nehletah kiningching tahin ka guolzawl dinga, a migentheite tanghou in ka taisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asiempute khu hundamna in ka thuom ding a, amisiengthoute nuomsa in ngaitahin akikou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zion ah David a dingin kii khat ka poudoh sah ding a, ka sathau nupa a dingin thaumei khat ka tungdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A melmate khu muolphounain ka thuom dinga, hinanleh ama lutungah leenglukhu ataang singseng ding” hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai un, Unaute kituoh diil diel a umkhawm anah hoiin, nuom hina va-ia e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lu tunga thau manpha kinu, khamul a luong khie, Aaron khamul ngei a luongkhie, apuonah tuol monga luongkhie bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hermon daitui chiim, Zion taangte a ke zel bang ahi, Tuanah Mangpa’n guolzawlna thu apie a, kumtawnna hinna ding ngei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai un nou zan a Mangpa inn a ding zel, Mangpa suoh zousiete aw, Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na khutte uh munsiengthou lam ah zahtou unlen, Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa lei leh van siempa ngeiin, Zion a kipat in noute hing guolzawlta hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, Mangpa min phat un, Aw nou Mangpa suohte, Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nou Mangpa inn a dinga, i Pasian inn huongsunga dingte aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, Mangpa lah ahoi ngal a. Amin phatna la sa un, tua lah anuom ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n Jakob khu ama adingin atelta a, tualeh Israel ama goutan tuom dingin atel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa thupitah ahi chi leh, i Mangpa khu pasien te zousie sanga tungnung zaw ahi, chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n lei leh van ah, tualeh tuipi leh athuhna munte zousie ah a ut ut abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman kawlmong akipat meilumte akaitou sah a, kawlphete guo dingin a siem a, akoikhawmna inn apat huipite alangsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman Izipt gam a tamasa athat a, mihing leh ganta pum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Izipt gam, Aman na sungah chiemtenate leh sillam dangte ahing sawl a, Pharaoh leh asuohte zousie tungah zong asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman nam tampite asatlum a leeng thupi leh hat tahtahte athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amormite leengpa Sihon leh, Bashan leengpa Og leh, Kanaan leenggamte zousie athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Agam uh gouluo dingin apie a, Ami Israelte goutan dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na min kumtawn in a umden ding a, Aw Mangpa Nangma theizingna khang zousie dongin aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n amite tungah thu akhen dinga, a suohte tungah lainatna anei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namte milimte lah dangka leh sana a kibawl, mihingte khutsuoh ahibou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaten kam anei ua, aham thei sih ua, mitte a nei ua, amu thei sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />bil anei ua, aza thei tuom sih ua, akam uah nahna aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuabang milim bawlte khu tuo milimte bangin aum ding ua, tuate gingta poumate zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Israel innkuonte Mangpa phat un. Aw Aaron inn kuonte Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Levi innkuonpite Mangpa phat un, Nou Mangpa giing poumate aw, Mangpa khu phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa Jerusalem a tengpa ngei, Zion a kipat in phat in um hen. Mangpa khu phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa kungah kipahthu gen un, Ama lah ahoi ngal a, akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw pasien te Pasian kungah kipahthu gen un, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw mangpate Mangpa kungah kipahthu gen un, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama tanga sillamdang thupitah bawl zelpa kungah, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Theisiemna pilna zieh a vante siempa kungah, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuite tunga leitung kiphasahpa kung ah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vah thupitahte siempa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sun hun a vaihawm dinga nisa bawlpa kungah A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zan hun a vaihawm dinga hapi leh aasite bawlpa kungah, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izipt gamsunga tamasate thatpa kungah, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt mite lah akipat a Israelte puidohpa kungah, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khut thahat leh ban zah a amauh puidohpa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuipi san kikhentansahpa kungah, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuipi san laikim a Israelte galkaisah pa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn aumden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharaoh leh akalkapte tuipi san a tummang sahpa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gamdai gamgaw a amite puipa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leng thupi thahatte thatgampa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leng minthang tahtahte thatpa kungah, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor mite leengpa Sihon thatpa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bashan leengpa Og thatpa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Agam uh goutan dinga pepa kungah, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asuoh Israel kunga goutan pepa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I nam din mun uh a ngiem laitah a hing thei zingpa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Igalte u lah apat a hing tandohpa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tahsa zousie neh leh tah pepa kungah, Akhotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw van Pasian kungah kipahthu gen un, A khotuona kumtawn a umden ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon luigeite ah, khunah itou ua, ikapta uhi, Zion ingaituo chieng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuna lui lai a huisum bazamte ah i kaigingte uh ikhai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen khulaitah a sal a hing puiten la sa dingin ahing phuut ua, ahing sugentheiten thanuom tah in, “Zion late khat hing sahpieh un chi in ahing phut uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi gam ah Mangpa la bangchin isa thei mawh diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem nang ka hing manghil leh, ka khut zietlam in akhutsiemna manghil hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang kang thei ngitnget sih a ahileh, ka lei ka dangtawngah behden henlen, Kanopsahna pen sanga sangzaw a, Jerusalem ka hing dei zaw sih leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, Jerusalem pua ni a Edom mite’n suchim un, suchim un, “Asuongphumte nangawn suchim un” achi zieh un. Amauh aselam in thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw suhmanga um ding Babilon tanu, ka tung ua na bawlbanga hing thuh dingpa khu kipah in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na tangehte hing lahpieh a, suongpi satna a nei dingpa khu kipahtah in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka lungtang zousie in Nangma ka hing phat dinga; pasien te masangah nangma phatna la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na biehinn siengthou lam nga in ka hing be dinga; Na itna tulngailou leh na thutahna ziehin, Na min ka phat ding hi; aziehpen Na thu khu na min zousie tungah Na tawisangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kang hat niin Nang na hing dawng a, ka hinna na hing suhhat pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, leitung pumpi leengte zousie in Na kam a thu pawt azah hun chiengun ahing pahtawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, Mangpa umdan thute phat in la asa ding uhi, Aziehpen Mangpa vangletna athupi sengseng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa khu sangtah a um hinapiin mi ngiemte angaisaha, hinanleh mi kiliensahte pen gamlapi akipat in athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungkham gentheina lah ah vahkawi nanleng zong, Nangman nahing suhal ding hi, ka melmate lungthahna tungah, Na khut na zah ding a, na zietlam khutin nahing hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n ka tungtanga abawl ding khu abawl bukim dinga. Aw Mangpa, na khotuona khu kumtawn in a umden ding hi. Na khut nasepte taisan vawt sin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangman chientahin nahing sui a, nahing theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang ka tousuh leh ka dintou lai na thei a, ka ngaituote gamlapi akipat in na theithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang ka pei leh ka lup na en chien zel a, ka umdan zousie na theisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, Aw Mangpa, nangma theilou ka lei ah thu mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangman ka nualam leh ka mailam ah nang imsuoh a, ka tungah na khut na nga nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tambang va-ia a theina, kei dingin alamdang seng taluo hi, asang senga ka phazou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hagau kunga kipat hei ah ka pei thei diei? ahisihleh na masanga pat hei ah ka taimang thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Van ah kaltou ding chileng lah khunah Nang na um a, Sheol ah lupna bawl vang chileeng lah khunah Na um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zing ha zah in tuipi tawp peh ah va um nanleng zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khunah zong na khut in nahing pui dinga, Na khut zietlam in na hing tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pellou in mielin ahing khu khum dinga, zan zong ka kim ah vah ahi ding chinanleng zong;”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Miel in zong nanga kipat bangma alie sih a, zan zong sun bangin avah hi; Nang dingin miel leh vah akibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen ka lungsim sunggillam na bawlta a, ka nu gilsungah nahing phankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma ka hing phat ding hi, aziehpen zauhuoitah leh lamdang tah a siem ka hi; Na nasepte alamdang seng hi, tua khu ka hinna in athei chien mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aguuh a siem a ka um lai leh, leimun nuoinung pen a kilawmtah a bawl a ka umlai in, ka gu ka taangte nanga kipat phuol ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lim kibawlkim nailou khu na mit in amu a, ka tahsa ka hiengte na laibu sungah akigiel siengta hi. Khat beh zong aum nailou laiin nite kei a dinga bawl in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Pasian na ngaituonate kei a dingin manpha hina va-ia e, akigawmkhawmna khu thupi hina e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sim ding hita leng senel sangin atam zaw ding hi, ka khatlaw chiengin na kunga um kana hinalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Pasian migiloute na that ngei dinga, tuachi’n sisan suohat miten ahing peisan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaun giloutah in nang ahing gensie ua, Na melmaten na min bangmalouin agen zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, Nang hing mudate ka muda sih amah? Tualeh Nang hing doute ka haw sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaute huot chitahin ka huo a, ka melmate in ka ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Pasian hing enchien inlen, ka lungtang thei in, hing enkhie inlen, ka ngaituonate thei in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh keima ah umdan gilou a um eimah, en inlen, kumtawn lampi ah hing pui in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa silgilou bawlmite lah apat hing hunkhie inlen; ngongtatte lah akipat in hing humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaun alungtang uah sil gilou angaituo uhi, nisim in galdou dingin akikhawm ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Alei uh gul lei bangin ahiemsah ua, amuh uah thangtom gu a um hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Mangpa migiloute khut apat in hing veng hoi inlen, hing suhpua sawm migumtatte lah akipat in hing humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mikiliensahten ka awhna ding thang leh khauhuol aguhin aphuol ua, lampi gei ah a lenthang apha ua, ka awhna ding thang akam uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa kungah nang ka Pasian na hi ka chi a, Aw Mangpa hepina ka ngetna awte hing na ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian ka hundamna suhatpa, kidou ni chiengin ka lutang na liekhuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Mangpa migiloute deilam pe sinlen, asiltup guhte u’zong lawching sah sin, tuachilouin akipahtawi kha ding uhi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei hing imkuolte lu khu amauh kam a, athugilou gente un khukhum heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mei-am sa in amauh buohkhum henlen, meikhua lai ah pai in um uhenlen, athawkia nawnlouna ding un kokhuh thuh tah ah khieh in um uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu gilou genmi khu leitung ah tundingin umsih hen, migumtat khu suse dingin silhoilouin delpha hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n suhgenthei a umte tungtang thu apanpi ding a. Migentheite adingin dihtaha vaihawmna abawlpieh ding hi chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pellou in midihtatten na min aphat ding ua, mithudihte na masang ah a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa nangma ka hing han hi, kintah in hing del pai inlen, ka hing hat chiengin ka aw za dingin na bil hing daw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thungetna na masangah gimnamtui bangin zamtou henlen, tualeh ka banzahtoute zong, nitahlam kithoina bangin sangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, ka kam bul ah veng mi tousah inlen, ka muh kotkhah vengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Silgilou bawlte toh gitlouna bawlkhawm dingin, ka lungtang silhoilou lam mawngmawng ah kiheisah sinlen, a neh tuitahte uh zong hing nesah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midihtatin hing vuo heh, tuakhu hepina ahi ding a, tualeh hing phawhhil heh, tuakhu lu a sathau manpha kinu bang ahi dinga, ka luin deilou sih heh. Aziehpen ka thungetna khu migilou silbawlte douna ahi nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Avaihawm mite uh kawlsuongpi gei a paikhieh a aum chiengun, ka thute angaikheta ding uh, ahum ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi’n leitang akal a, akhetnen bangun ka gute uh hankhuh gei ah thezah in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa Pasian, ka mit in nangma lam a en a, Nangma ah kibutna ka sui a, ka hinna khu chimawin nuasie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka awhna ding a thang akam lah uah, tualeh silgilou bawlte thangkam lah ah hing vengbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ka suohtat lai in, migiloute amauh lenthang ah awh uhen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka aw in Mangpa ka han a; ka aw in Mangpa kungah, hepina ka ngen zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amasangah ka lungkimlounate ka sungbuo a, ka buoinate Ama kungah ka phuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hagau ka sunga achimaw chiengin, Nangman ka lampi na thei hi. Ka peina lampi ah amaun aguh in thang akam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka zietlam ka en a, tualeh ka dah a, koima kei hing thei mawngmawng aum sih hi, kihumbitna ding a um sih a, koiman ka hinna ahing donpieh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nang ka hing han a; Nang ka kibutna na hi a, mihing gam a ka tanvou na hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kikou ngaikhie in, aziehpen nasatah a suhngiem in ka umta hi, ahing sugentheite akipat in hing hunkhie in, kei sangin ahatzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na min ka phat theina dingin, ka hinna suongkul apat lahdoh in, midihtatten kei ahing imkuol ding uhi, Nangman ka tunga kiningching tah a na hing bawl ding ziehin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka thungetna ngaikhie inlen, hepi ka ngetnate ah Na bil hing daw in, Na ginumna leh na dihtatna ziehin hing dawngin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na suohpa tungah thukhenna bawlkhum sin, aziehpen na masangah mihing koima siemtang a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Melmain ka hinna asugenthei a, ka hinna lei lahah asatpua a, sawtpi a shisate bangin mun miel ah ahing umsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka sunga ka hagau achimaw gawpta a, ka sunga ka lungtang zong amangbang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nidanglai nite ka thei ngitnget a, Na nasep zousie ka ngaisut a, na khut silbawlte ka geldoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma kung lamah ka khutte ka zah zel a, gamgaw bangin ka hinna nangma ngai in adangta hi. Selah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa aw hing dawng meng in ka hagau agim gawpta hi, Kei apat in na mai phuol sin, tuachilou in kokhuh a peisuhte bangin ka um kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zingmawng chiengin na itna hepina hing zasah in, Nangma ka hing muong hi, Ka peina ding lampi hing theisah in, Aziehpen ka hinna in nanglam ang entou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka galte lah a kipat hing hundoh in, Nangma hing bel ka hibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na deilam bawl dingdan hing zilsah in, Nang ka Pasian na hi thuoi a. Na hagau ahoi hi, dihna gam ah hing puilut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na min ziehin hing suhal inlen; Na dihtatna ziehin buoina akipat in ka hinna puidoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na khotuona ziehin ka galte sattan sieng inlen, ka hinna sugentheite zousie sumang in, na suoh ka hi thuoi a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa ka suongpi phat in um hen, Aman ka khutte galdou dan azilsah a, ka khutmete galkap dan ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ka itna tulngailou leh ka kulpi, ka kibuhna innsang leh hing hunkhepa, ka phaw leh ka muonna kingahna, mite ka nuoi ah a koi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa mihing bang ahia ahiei, tambanga na theikhah zel? Ahisihleh mihing tapa zong koi ahi a, na hichi ngaituo ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing pen nah hu bang bep ahi ua, adamsung nite u’zong himliep mangzel bang bep ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na vante luoikun inlen, hing kumsuh in, tangte tham in tuachi’n akhu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tunphesah inlen amauh delzah in, Na thaltangte kapdoh inlen, amaute sumangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tunglam a kipat in na khut in hing sawhsuh inlen, tui lienpi a pat leh gamdang mite khut apat in hing hundoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Akam un zuou thu agen ua, azietlam khut u’zong zuoutatna khut ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Pasian, Nangma pahtawi in la tha kasa ding a, pehging gui sawm neiin nangma phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leengte kunga hundamna pie a, Asuohpa David shi theina namsau, a kipat a hunkhepa khu Ama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hing hundoh inlen, gamdang mite khut apat hing humbit in, Akam un thuginalou pou agen ua, akhut zietlam u’zong khut zietlam zuoutat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tapate uh khangdawng ahilai un, singnou khanghoinou bang ahing hi theina ding uleh, ka tanute uzong leeng innpi huong sunga aninga, suong kikhuoh khuompite bang ahi theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka bu innte uzong silpieng chintengin dim henlen, ka belamte u’zong atul atul leh, atulsawm atulsawm in ka kholai uah piengta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka bawngtalte un zong van gih tahtah apuoh ua, alut leh apawt ua sietna um lou na ding in, ka kholai gawlzingte ua zong, lungdon kanate a um louna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tambanga um mite pen kipahtahin aum zel uhi, Ahi, Mangpa a Pasian ua nei mite khu kipahtah in a um zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A Leengpa ka Pasian nang ka hing tawisang dinga, Na min kumtawn kumtawn in ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni chinin Namin ka phat dinga, kumtawn kumtawn in na min ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa athupi a, thupitah a pahtawi ding ahi, athupina koima suiguol ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khang khat in khangkhat dang kungah na silbawlte aphat sawn zel ding a, na nasep thupitahte agen sawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma pahtawina kilawmdan thupitah leh, Na sillamdang bawl thute ka ngaisut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miten na silbawl chizathuoi tahte hatdan aphuongzah ding ua, tualeh ken zong na thupina ka phuongzah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaun na hoina thupidan atheizingte uh agen ding ua, Na dihtatna phat in la asa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa khu mi hepisiem, lainatna a dim lungnem tah leh khotuona
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa khu silbangkim tungah ahoi a, asilsiem zousie tunga lainatna hau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Mangpa na silsiemsate zousie in, Na kungah kipahthu ahing gen ding ua, Na misiengthouten Nang ahing pahtawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na leenggam thupidan agen ding ua, Na silbawltheidan thute houlimna’n a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing tate zousie kungah Na silbawl thupitahte leh, Na leenggam kilawmna thupi dan atheisah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na leenggam khu kumtawn leenggam ahi a, Na thuneina zong akhang khangin a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n apua zousiete atudet a, akunsuh khiukheu a umte zousie akaidingzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mizousie mit in kinemtahin Nang ahing en ua, Nangman ahun, tah in neh ding amauh na pe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na khut na zah a, tuachi’n silhing chintengte dei na pia a, na taisah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa khu agamtatna zousie ah a dihtat a, Anasepna zousie ah mi hepina ahau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa Ama hante pouma leh, thutah a Ama hante zousie anai zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa’n Ama zaudan siemte pouma deilam atangtungsah dinga, akikou uh aza dinga, a hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n Ama itte zousie avengbit a, hinanleh migiloute asumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka kam in Mangpa phatna thu agen dinga, tahsa hinna nei zousie’n, Amin Siengthou kumtawn kumtawn in aphat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, Aw ka hinna Mangpa phat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka damsung tengin Mangpa ka phat dinga, ka damlai sie’n Pasian phat in la kasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miliente muong sinlen, panpitheina mawngmawng neilou ashithei mihing pou muong sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nahna hu in apawtsan a, lei asuoh kiata hi, tuachi’n khum ni mama in angaituonate abeimang pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob Pasian panpi tu-a nei miin nuom asa hi, akinepna khu Mangpa a Pasian ah aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama lei leh van leh, tuipi leh asunga um zousie siempa ahi a, Ama’n thutah akem ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman suhgenthei a umte avaihawm pieh a, gilkielte kungah ann neh ding a pe zel hi. Mangpa’n suongkul taangte ahadoha, azalen sah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n mittote mit avahsah a, Mangpa’n akunsuhte aphongtou a, Mangpa’n midihtatte a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa’n mikhuolte avengbit a, Aman tagate leh meithaite apanpi a, hinanleh migiloute lampi alumle pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n kumtawn in vai ahawm dinga, Aw Zion, na Pasian in akhang akhangin Vai ahawm ding hi. Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, I Pasian phata lasah ahoi mama a, tuakhu anuom a, tualeh Ama phat akilawm mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Jerusalem atungding kia a, Aman sal a puimanga um Israelte apuikhawm kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman lungtang hasete adamsah a, aliemnate uh atuom pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman aasite tamdan asim a, amin uh aphuo pieh chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I Mangpa uh athupi a, silbawltheina kiningchingtah nei ahi, atheisiemnain tawp anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n kingaingiemte adomsang a, migiloute pen tuolsenan anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kipahthu gen kawm in Mangpa phat in la sa unlen, kaiging toh i Pasian uh phat in la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman meipi in van akhusah a, leitungah guo azu sah a, taangte tungah hampa apousah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman gantate kungah ann neh ding apie a, va ah noute aham chiengin ann apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama pen sakol hatna ah akipah sih a, mihing keng ah zong kipahna mawngmawng anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa khu Ama giingte tungah akipah a, A khotuona kineppite tungah akipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem Mangpa pahtawi in, Aw Zion na Pasian phat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman na kulkotkhah kilna zawlte akipsah a, na sunga na tate a guolzawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman na gamgite sungah lemna asiem a, bu hoipen in ahing dimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thupiehte leitung ah asawldoh a, athu gangtah in atai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vua khu belam mul bangin a pie a, Vua kie ku vut bangin athezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman gielte khu tanghou themnen bangin apaidoh a, avotna masangah koi ahiei ding thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thu asawldoh a, tuate azun sah hi, Ahuite alaang sah a, tuachi’n tuite a hing luong zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman Jakob kungah athu aphuong doh a, adanthute leh avaihawmnate Israelte kungah akilang sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman koima nam tungah tambangin abawl ngai sih a, tualeh avaihawmna thute zong athei ngai vawt sih uhi. Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, vante akipat Mangpa phat unlen, munsangte ah Ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Avansawltahte zousie in ama phat unlen, Agalkapte zousie in ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni leh ha in ama phat unlen, Aasi taangte zousie in ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vante van in ama phat unlen, vante tung a um tuiten ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amauten Mangpa min phat uhen, aziehpen ama’n thu apie a, siem in ahing umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman tuate khu kumtawn kumtawn a dingin asukip a beithei nawnlou ding in thu abawl khumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou tuipi ganhing liente leh tuithuhpite aw, leitunga kipat in Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mei leh gielte, vua leh meilumte leh, athu zui khopihuiten,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Muol leh taangte zousie leh, ganei singte leh sidar sing zousieten,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamsate leh ganta zousiete, ganhing bohvahte leh tungleeng vate in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />leitung leengte leh michintengin, leengtapate leh leitung vaihawmtein;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tangval leh nungahte’n, Putehte leh naupangten, a kibangin Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amauten Mangpa min phat uhen, aziehpen Mangpa minbou tawisangin a um a, athupinain lei leh van akhup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman amite kii zong atawisanga, Amisiengthoute zousie phatna khu; Ami Israel tate akung nai mite phatna khu. Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa pahtawi unlen, Mangpa phat in la tha sa unlen, misiengthoute kikhopna ah Aphatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israelte khu amauh siempa tungah kipah uhenlen; Zion tate khu aleengpa uh tungah kipah uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amin khu laamkawm in phat u’henlen, khuongta leh kaiging kilawm toh ama phat in la ngai sa uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen amite tungah Mangpa alungdam a, Aman mi kingaingiemte guolzawna toh kilawmtah in azem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Misiengthoute khu thupina ah nuom uhenlen, alupna tung uah nuom in la sa uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian phatna sangtah akam uah um henlen, akhut uah namsau langni a tathiem um nalai hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Namte tunga phuba lahna leh, michin tunga gawtna tungsah ding leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />aleengte uh siakhainieng a akihenna dingin, tualeh ami thupite uh kolbunsah dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thukhenna kigielsa atung ua tungsah dingin: Tami thupina khu Amisiengthoute zousie a ding ahi. Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa phat un, Amunsiengthou ah Pasian phat unlen, A silbawltheina huikhuo ah Ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asilbawl thupitahte zieh in Ama phat unlen; Athupina nasatdan dungzuiin Ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pengkul gingtoh Ama phat unlen, kaiging leh pehgingin Ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuongta leh laam in Ama phat unlen, Tumging guinei leh theile toh Ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dahkhutbeh ging toh Ama phat unlen, dahkhutbeh ging zia zua toh Ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nah hu nei chintengin Mangpa phat chiet uhen! Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
</usx>
